<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">- NUMANA</book>
  <para style="h">LUK</para>
  <para style="toc1">LUK - NUMANA</para>
  <para style="toc2">LUK - NUMANA</para>
  <para style="toc3">LUK - NUMANA</para>
  <para style="mt1">LUK - NUMANA</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1" />
  <para style="s">Ibu alǝla</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1" />Aneshir tetɛk ne ben te bɛ cɛr kiki yiŋ ndi aba ne zhi ne cɛr kɛ ne miŋ mɔr. <verse eid="LUK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2" />Irkeŋ ndi ne baŋ anekta bǝn abaŋ ndi ne kuti yik nayi amen bǝn agɛn abɛ lɛ kǝŋe. <verse eid="LUK 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3" />Neme, ndi Nga ne tu muŋ mne zib kiki yiŋɛ ne kuti, nena rem tem cɛr ikiki didik ne atu mi, ngɔŋ Tiyofulɔ, <verse eid="LUK 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4" />Te duŋ zhin bɛ zhi didik kɛ iki yiŋ ndi ne bla zhin neyi.<verse eid="LUK 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nŋli kɛ Yɔɔna ne su Aneshir ne sak kɛ Arik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5" />Ne mkpaŋ keŋ ndi Hiridus neyi itum ne Yahudiya ine nadum kɛ Arik nuŋ ndi azhɔu te Zakariya, ndi ayi ne miŋ kɛ abɛ gab tsik ibaŋ ye Arik ne ŋa kɛ Abija: iwa maa Alisabɛtu ayi ŋli nga kɛ Haruna ine na ndum kǝ Arik. <verse eid="LUK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6" />Bɔbɔk mǝne ayi tsetser ne ti kɛ Arik, azǝ nkan lɛ bǝn kiki yiŋ ndi Arik ne di abɛ nayi ba na kiyiŋ ndi batei gli ba kinuŋ mimin ba. <verse eid="LUK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7" />Ama Arik bane nǝk ba ŋli ba, Alisabɛtu ayaŋ klu, nɛ cɛ yaya mǝne.<verse eid="LUK 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8" />Ndi mkpaŋ kɛ na ndum Zakariya ne te anezen na ndum ne Akabaŋkɔŋ ayou Arik, <verse eid="LUK 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9" />ne hriau ne zhɔk keŋkam, ne irkeŋ ndi abɛ na ndum Arik ana, te bɛ yir Akabakɔŋ ayou Arik te abɛ goŋ anye neyi shushum <verse eid="LUK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10" />Neme ndi mkpaŋ kɛ goŋ anye ne yi shushum ne te, abɛ ben Arik bɔbɔk mǝne ne biŋ akli ne abɛm te zen ben Arik.<verse eid="LUK 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11" />Fe ine shar ayou Arik amunoru te klikli ne ŋɔk li ne amkpa ne goŋ anye ane yi shushum. <verse eid="LUK 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12" />Ndi Zakariya ne yigu, azhizhi ne ku tena te sisik. <verse eid="LUK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13" />Ankyak ine shar ayou Arik a diu, &lt;&lt;duŋ te sisik ba, Zakariya; ne wɔ ben mi. Iwa mi Alisabɛtu atei ŋli vǝvǝn, utei zhɔ sak maa te Yɔɔna. <verse eid="LUK 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14" />atei duŋ susun mi sik, aner tetɛk atei na nyer ne atu yi ŋli maa, <verse eid="LUK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15" />te atei yi ner ngɔŋ ne ti kɛ Arik. Ba tei sɔ ama dɔ kunkun inebi aneyi mwamwaŋ ba, ba tei na sɔ ki duŋ aneshir ahwa ba. atei shur izhu yi tsetser shak kpama ndi nak rǝ mkpaŋ kɛ ŋli maa. <verse eid="LUK 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16" />Aneshir tetɛk abɛ Isrela aŋur akam nyak ben Arik amen. <verse eid="LUK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17" />Fe atei ku Arik ti te kɔmɔ, ne Izhu bene mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ Iliya, te sen asusun aye atetɛ kam kɔmɔ ben amumun amen tena duŋ abɛ yaŋ zǝ lɛ kɛ Arik bɛ yi Mgbemgbeb te na yi tsetser te duŋ aneshir bɛ sɔŋsɔŋ didik te ŋub Arik.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18" />Zakariya arib ine shar ayou Arik te di, &lt;&lt;M tei na kikin te zhi lɛ keŋɛi? Mne ce iwa muŋ nena ce.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19" />Ine shar ayou Arik adi, &lt;&lt;Me yi ne shar ayou Arik azhɔm te Gebre. Me kliŋkli ne ti kɛ Arik, fe ne shar me tem lɛ bene bɔu te mblau lɛ didik. <verse eid="LUK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20" />Vuŋ rɛ azizaŋa bau tei lɛ ba se mkpaŋ kɛŋ ndi lɛ kǝŋe tei shaga, te bau ne tanyɛmɛ ne lɛ muŋ ba, ndi itei zub ne mkpaŋ keŋ di ne nyak.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21" />Ndi amɛ, aneshir aklɛkli ŋub Zakariya tena vuŋ anu te di anii vuŋu nyak ne Akabakɔŋ ayi Arik. <verse eid="LUK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22" />Ndi ne ru, bane zhi ilɛ bene bɛba ba. Ne shuzhi te ne yik rimla ne Akabakɔŋ ayou Arik. Anaga tsar ba kiki nuŋ te yaŋ lɛ.<verse eid="LUK 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23" />Ndi mkpaŋ kɛ na ndum Zakariya ne klɛ, ne kama kɔmɔ ne kɔmaa. <verse eid="LUK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24" />Ndi iyiŋɛ ne gayir Alisabɛtu iwa maa ne baŋ nnɛ te sɔŋ yaŋ ru abɛm ihwa tuŋ. <verse eid="LUK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25" />Adi, &lt;&lt;Arik wa ne nam kiyiŋ,&gt;&gt; Adi. &lt;&lt;Ne bar yiŋɛ ne tsar ki didik te tun me shisha ne min aneshir.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bla ŋli kɛ Yesɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26" />Ndi Alisabɛtu ne te ihwa tani, Arik ne shar ne shar amaa Gebre ne ntun ndi azhɔ sak maa te Nazara, ne Galili. <verse eid="LUK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27" />Bǝn vǝnwa nuŋ ndi ba ne zhi lulum ba ndi azhɔu te Meryamu waŋ ndi Yusuu a tɔgu, nga ŋli kɛ Doda. <verse eid="LUK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28" />Ine shar ayou Arik ne gar bene bɔu te di, &lt;&lt;Mtegu, uwa waŋ ndi une yik ki didik! Arik ayi bǝn bɔu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29" />Ilɛ kǝŋe ne dam Meryamu ngɔŋ te lɛ ne susun maa itek iyiŋɛ iye ni. <verse eid="LUK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30" />Ankyak ine shar ayou Arik a diu, &lt;&lt;Duŋ te sisik ba, Meryamu, une yik iki didik bene Arik. <verse eid="LUK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31" />Utei gli nnɛ te ŋli vǝvǝn, atei zhɔ sak maa te Yesɔ. <verse eid="LUK 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32" />atei yi Ner ŋgon atei na zhɔu te Izu Ŋgɔŋ ne gbarshu. Arik atei nǝgu mben yi ntsǝntsǝm amaa Doda, <verse eid="LUK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33" />fe atei gli ŋli kɛ Yakubu te gar klɛtu; ngɔŋ maa ba tei yi ne klɛ tu ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34" />Meryamu arib ine shar ayou Arik te di, &lt;&lt;itei na kikin te tǝ amɛ&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;te bam ne zhi lulum ba?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35" />Ine shar ayou Arik a di Meryamu, &lt;&lt;Izhu tsetser itei yir bene bɔu, bene mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ Ŋgɔŋ ne shu tei ku bɔbɔk. Amɛ utei ŋli ne tsetser te zhɔu te Izu Arik. <verse eid="LUK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36" />Te vuŋ Alisabɛtu ne nga ŋli min atei ŋli vǝvǝn ne ce maa, waŋ ndi ne di ba tena gli nnɛ azizaŋa ayi ne nnɛ ihwa tani. <verse eid="LUK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37" />Fe adi ikinuŋ ba naŋ Arik na ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38" />&lt;&lt;Me yi gen ayou Arik,&gt;&gt; Meryamu adi. &lt;&lt;Duŋ lɛ mi bɛ yi amɛ.&gt;&gt; Fe ine shar ayou Arik aduŋu.<verse eid="LUK 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Meryamu Ne Gar Bǝn Alisabɛtu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39" />Ne mkpaŋ yuŋɔ Meryamu ne lu te kɔmɔ andanda ne ntun yi tu gbu ne ntun yi Yahuza, <verse eid="LUK 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40" />amɔ wa ne yir kɔb Zakariya te tek Alisabɛtu. <verse eid="LUK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41" />Ndi Alisabɛtu ne wɔ tek yi Meryamu, vǝvǝn ne nnɛ kɛ Alisabɛtu ne tu ne nnɛ maa, amɛ Alisabɛtu ne shak ne Izhu yi tsetser. <verse eid="LUK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42" />Ne lɛk kɔr ŋgon te di, &lt;&lt;Ne nek anu adidik ne miŋ kɛ amba, mǝne nek anu didik ne vǝvǝn waŋ ndi utei ŋliu! <verse eid="LUK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43" />Ankyak anii duŋ me ne yik ki didik, te Yaa maa Ŋgɔŋ Yesɔ ne nyɛ ben abɛm? <verse eid="LUK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44" />Ndi mne wɔ kɔr kɛ tek mi ne atɔŋ amuŋ, vǝvǝn ndi ayi ne nnɛ muŋ ne lu nyɛr. <verse eid="LUK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45" />Anu adidik ayi ben waŋ ndi ne tanyɛmɛ te Arik ne diu itei shaga!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Asem Ayi Meryamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46" />Ankyak Meryamu ne di,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:46">&lt;&lt;Idur muŋ inǝk Arik ŋgɔŋ.<verse eid="LUK 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47" />Fe izhu muŋ nyer Arik amuŋ ndi ne tam azhɔk,<verse eid="LUK 1:47" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48" />Te ne tɔ nga waŋ ndi ba Me yi kinuŋ ne min kɛ agen amaa ba!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:48">Ivuŋ rɛ azizaŋa bɔbɔk ikab ŋli atei zhɔm te anu adidik,<verse eid="LUK 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49" />Tǝ ine mgbyamgbyaŋ ŋgɔŋ ne nam kiki,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:49">Isak maa iyi tsetser.<verse eid="LUK 1:49" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50" />Ibaŋ rɛ ikab igar nga ikab nuŋ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:50">Lɔ susun maa gar bǝn abaŋ ndi ate sisik maa.<verse eid="LUK 1:50" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51" />Ne na kiki gɔngɔŋ ne ŋɔk amaa; ne var abaŋ ndi alǝk atu ne ki na mimin ne asusun amen. <verse eid="LUK 1:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52" />Ne gli atum agli zǝme ne mben men ama abaŋ ndi azǝ tu azhɔk ne lɛk ba ne shu.<verse eid="LUK 1:52" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53" />Ne yɔk abaŋ ndi kasa vuŋ ba ne kili didik fe te yar abɛ adudunki atibǝ aŋɔk akluklu.<verse eid="LUK 1:53" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54" />Ne lɔk igen amaa Isrela,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:54">Te kama wɔ lɔ susun maa<verse eid="LUK 1:54" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55" />Ne Ibrai ben iŋli maa yaŋ klɛtu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:55">Ndi ne bla Atetɛ mɔr.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56" />Meryamu ne sɔŋ ben Alisabɛtu ihwa tar te she kama kɔmɔ ne kɔb.<verse eid="LUK 1:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ŋli kɛ Yɔɔna ne su Aneshir</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57" />Ndi mkpaŋ kɛ ŋli Alisabɛtu ne te ne ŋli zu maa <verse eid="LUK 1:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58" />Akpa maa ben aner maa ne wɔ ndi Arik ne tsar lɔ susun ma ngɔŋ netu yi Alisabɛtu ne lɔgu nyere.<verse eid="LUK 1:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59" />Nǝ bɛr yi tender ne nyɛ te abɛ kɔgu vǝvǝne zik,fe atei nugu sak kɛ tetɛɛ maa Zakariya, <verse eid="LUK 1:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60" />Fena iya maa ne lɛ te di,&lt;&lt; bai yi me ba! atei zhɔu te Yɔɔna.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61" />Adiu te di, &lt;&lt;Ba azhɔ nuŋ ne nga kɛ ŋli men ne sak kǝŋe ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62" />Fe arib tetɛɛ maa ne angir te di,te aba abɛ zhi ka atei di abɛ zhɔ sak kɛ vǝvǝne te ŋɔ. <verse eid="LUK 1:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63" />Ne rib iki yi cɛr, fe kɔte ŋɔwa avuŋ anu ne cɛrǝ, &lt;&lt;Isak maa iyi Yɔɔna.&gt;&gt;. <verse eid="LUK 1:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64" />Andanda anu amaa akɔ bu lǝlɛn maa ku duŋɔ azhi lɛ, te gbar Arik asak. <verse eid="LUK 1:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65" />Akpa abɛ sɔŋ yaŋ akpa sisik ku vuŋ ba, fe ne bla lɛ kǝŋe agonri zǝ ntun yi atugbu iyi Yahudiya bɔbɔk ne kiyiŋɛ. <verse eid="LUK 1:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66" />kɔte ŋɔwa ndi ne wɔ iki yiŋ ndi ne na, ne lɛ ne susun te rib, &lt;&lt;vǝvǝn waŋa atei yi anii?&gt;&gt;Tǝ iŋɔk kɛ Arik iyi ne atu maa.<verse eid="LUK 1:66" /></para>
  <para style="s">Asem ayi Zakariya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67" />Tetɛɛ maa Zakariya ne shaga ne Izhu tsetser te na bla ki yiŋ ndi tei na ni ti: <verse eid="LUK 1:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68" />&lt;&lt;Ta bǝ gbar Ŋgɔŋ asak, Arik ane Isrela, te ne nyɛ tena ta aneshir amaa azhɔk. <verse eid="LUK 1:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69" />Ne gli ine ta ta azhɔk ne kɔb kɛ igen amaa Doda.<verse eid="LUK 1:69" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70" />Ndi ne bla nenu abɛ bla shar maa abɛ yi tsetser ne mkpaŋ kɛ kukub, <verse eid="LUK 1:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71" />ita zhɔk ire bǝn abɛ te zɔr amɔr ben aŋɔk abaŋ ndi akyak ta bɔbɔk <verse eid="LUK 1:71" /><verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72" />Te tsar lɔ susun iye atsintsim amɔr tena shu zhi ilɛ tsetser kɛ kpa nyak maa, <verse eid="LUK 1:72" /><verse number="73" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73" />Arim ayiŋ ndi ne she ntsǝntsǝm amɔr Ibrai ne yi: <verse eid="LUK 1:73" /><verse number="74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:74" />te abɛ ta ta zhɔk ne aŋɔk abɛ te zɔr bǝn bɛta,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:74">Te duŋ ta bǝ zekuru yaŋ te sisik, <verse eid="LUK 1:74" /><verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75" />te abɛ yi tsetser bǝn susun didik ne ti maa bǝn bɛr mɔr bɔbɔk. <verse eid="LUK 1:75" /><verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76" />Fe uwa, izu muŋ, atei zhɔu te ine bla shar yi Arik Ŋgɔŋ ne Shu; Ayi wa utei ku Ŋgɔŋ ti te te nau ankɔŋ, <verse eid="LUK 1:76" /><verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77" />te bla aneshir lɛ kɛ ta ita zhɔk ne ta ba azhɔk ne zumimin men, <verse eid="LUK 1:77" /><verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78" />te ne wɔ lɔ susun mɔr ndi Arik ne tǝǝ ta, ndi arik ane laŋ atei hrie ta ire shu <verse eid="LUK 1:78" /><verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79" />te laŋ ahrie netu abaŋ ndi ayi ne bu ben izhu iyi ku, te bɛ ŋub aza mɔr ne kɔŋ kɛ sik susun.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:79" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80" />Amɛ vǝvǝne ne te ngɔŋ te yi ne mgbyamgbyaŋ ne Izhu tsetser; te sɔŋ ne zizik ngɔŋ se mkpaŋ keŋ ndi ne gli tu maa aru ndende ne Isrela.<verse eid="LUK 1:80" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2" />
  <para style="s">Nŋli Yesɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1" />Ne mkpaŋ yuŋɔ itum Kaisar Augusta ne nek lɛ ta di abɛ cɛr aneshir abaŋ ndi ayi ne ntuntun yi Roma. <verse eid="LUK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2" />Waŋa ayi cɛr aneshir yi kuti ne mkpaŋ kɛŋ ndi Kiriniya ŋgɔŋ ne gli aneshir abɛ Asuriya. <verse eid="LUK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3" />kɔte ŋɔɔ ne kɔmɔ ne ntun maa te abɛ cɛru.<verse eid="LUK 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4" />Fe Yusuu ne gar ntun yi Nazara ndi iyi ne Galili te kɔmɔ ne ntun yi Yahudiya, ne Batalami ntun ngɔŋ yi Doda, te are ŋli nga kɛ Doda. <verse eid="LUK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5" />Ne gar amɔ te abɛ cɛr ba ben Meryamu, waŋ ndi ne tanyɛmɛ te uwa ai tau ndi nnɛ maa ne te ŋli <verse eid="LUK 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6" />Ndi ne yi amɔ, mkpaŋ kɛ ŋli vǝvǝne ne te, <verse eid="LUK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7" />ankyak ne ŋli zu maa ne kuti, ivǝvǝnlum. Ne ku ne anklu akɛ so vǝvǝn te zǝu azhɔk ne mgblɔ, te iki kɛ kur aneshir ba na yime ba.<verse eid="LUK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abɛ kyu ben abɛ shar abɛ Arik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8" />Ankyak abɛ kyu ayi gbahir ne amkpama, te abene blɛ awanta men ne bu. <verse eid="LUK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9" />Ine shar ayou Arik aru klii ba, ngɔŋ kɛ Arik laŋ hrie ba, fe sisik vuŋ ba. <verse eid="LUK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10" />Fe ine shar ayou Arik adi ba, &lt;&lt;duŋ te zhin sisik ba. Mǝne ngli lɛ kɛ men ngɔŋ ŋgli zhine te duŋ aneshir abɛ nyer bɔbɔk. <verse eid="LUK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11" />Aliŋe ne ntun iyi Doda nɛ ŋli ine ta zhin zhɔk; waŋ ndi wa ayi Almasihu ndi ayi Arik. <verse eid="LUK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12" />Waŋa atei yi zhin ngir: Izhin tei yik ne nyɛn vǝvǝn te kuu ne kluŋklu te zǝu zhɔk ne mgblɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13" />Ne amkpamkpama, ntsan abɛ shar ayou Arik tetɛk nɛrɛ gbarshu te biŋ bene abɛ mimi aru aklɛ te gbar Arik sak te di, <verse eid="LUK 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14" />&lt;&lt;Ngɔŋ bǝ yi kǝ Arik ne gbarshu, fe ne gɔnmimi isɔŋ kɛ sik susun bǝ yi bǝn abaŋ ndi ne tanyɛmɛ bene ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15" />Ndi abɛ shar ayou Arik ne duŋ ba te kɔmɔ ne gbarshu, abɛ kyu mɔ adi akpa men, &lt;&lt;Duŋ tabǝ gar Batalami te kɔte tɔ ki yiŋ ndi nena, iyiŋ ndi Arik ne bla ta netu maa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16" />Fe akɔ nama andanda te kɔte yik Meryamu ben Yusuu, bǝn vǝvǝne, waŋ ndi ne zǝu azhɔk ne mgblɔmɔ. <verse eid="LUK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17" />Ndi ne ka yigu, akɔ bla lɛ keŋ ndi ne bla kɛ netu yi vǝvǝne, <verse eid="LUK 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18" />ankyak bɔbɔk aneshir abaŋ ndi ne wɔ lɛ kǝŋe ne vuŋ anu ne lɛ keŋ ndi abɛ kyu ne bla ba. <verse eid="LUK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19" />Fe Meryamu ne aku kiki yiŋ ndi ne blau ma agli ne susun maa. <verse eid="LUK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20" />Abɛ kyu mɔ ne ŋur akam, te nek Arik ngɔŋ maa tena gbaru asak ne kiki bɔbɔk yiŋ ndi aba ne yigǝ, ndi ne bla ba.<verse eid="LUK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nǝk Yesɔ ne Akabaŋkɔŋ ayou Arik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21" />Ne bɛr yi tender, ndi mkpaŋ keŋ ndi ne kɔk vǝvǝne zik te suu sak te Yesɔ, sak keŋ ndi ine shar ayou Arik ne bla kɛ ndi bane zǝn kɔgu zǝk ba.<verse eid="LUK 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22" />Ndi mkpaŋ kɛ su tsetser ne te nǝ lɛ kɛ cɛr Musa, Yusuu ben Meryamu ne baŋ Yesɔ te gar Urshelima te abɛ nek Arik ne wu <verse eid="LUK 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23" />(irkeŋ ndi ne yi ne icɛr yi Musa, &lt;&lt;Vǝnlum ne kuti ŋli ndi ayi tsetser atei nek Arik ne wu&gt;&gt;), <verse eid="LUK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24" />fe abɛ tsik baŋ ne lɛ keŋ ndi ne bla kɛ ne cɛr ilɛ kǝ Arik: &lt;&lt;Angu amɛ yaa kɔ tatabara amɛ yaa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25" />Fena iner nuŋ waŋa ayi ne Urshelima ndi a zhɔ sak maa te Saminu, waŋ ndi ana ki didik tena nǝk tu nǝ lɛ kɛ Arik. Waŋ ndi asɔŋ aŋub waŋ ndi ate gli sik susun anyɛ me ne Isrela, ndi Izhu tsetser iyi bene bɔu. <verse eid="LUK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26" />Neka mǝne blau ne Izhu tsetser te di ate yik Ŋgɔŋ Kristi te te kashe ku. <verse eid="LUK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27" />Izhu tsetser ne gliu te gar Akabakɔŋ ayou Arik. Ndi ane Yusuu ben Meryamu ne gli Yesɔ te gar Akabakɔŋ te abɛ nau kiyiŋ ndi ne di abɛ nayi nǝ icɛr yi Musa, <verse eid="LUK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28" />Saminu ne tau agli ne aŋɔk amaa te nyer Arik, te di: <verse eid="LUK 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29" />&lt;&lt;Arik Ŋgɔŋ, irkeŋ ndi uneka kpa nyak, duŋ igen ami abɛ ku ne sik susun. <verse eid="LUK 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30" />Tǝ ayi amuŋ neka yik ita zhɔk mi, <verse eid="LUK 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31" />Yiŋ ndi une men nai nyak neyi ita zhɔk aneshir bɔbɔk, <verse eid="LUK 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32" />Ilaŋ ne nyɛ abaŋ ndi ba yi ŋli kɛ Yahudawa ba ben ngɔŋ ne aner abɛ Isrela.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33" />Tetɛɛ maa vǝvǝne ben iya maa ne vuŋ anu ne kiyiŋ ndi ne bla ne atu amaa. <verse eid="LUK 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34" />Ankyak Saminu ne nek ba anu adidik te di Meryamu, yaa maa Yesɔ: &lt;&lt;Vǝvǝn waŋa atei duŋ aneshir anuŋ azhaku te anuŋ tetɛk atei lu ne Isrela. atei yi ngir kǝ rɛ bǝn Arik waŋ ndi aneshir tetek atei lɛlɛ maa, <verse eid="LUK 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35" />te duŋ lɛ ne susun anuŋ bɛ ru abɛm. Tena duŋ anzigba atur susun mi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36" />Ine bla shar ayou Arik nuŋ ndi azhɔu te Ana, iva Fanuwe iŋli kɛ Ashiru. Ne ce ngɔŋ ne yi ase sɔk tendǝr, ne tǝ ase taŋgba bene lu maa, bane duŋ Akabakɔŋ ba, azekuru Arik aririk nǝn ibu, tena ben Arik te aber akpa nu. <verse eid="LUK 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:37" />Ndi lu maa ne ku ne sɔŋ yaŋ lulum ase sɔk tender ane nas. Ne sɔŋ ne Akabakɔŋ te ben Arik ne aririk bǝn bu tǝ nɛ ben kpa anu. <verse eid="LUK 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38" />Ne kpaŋ yuŋɔ Ana ne gar, te kɔte nyer Arik tena lɛ ne atu ayi Yesɔ bene aneshir bɔbɔk abaŋ ndi ne shur ayi bǝn ne ta Urshelima zhɔk.<verse eid="LUK 2:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39" />Ndi ane Yusuu bǝn Meryamu ne na kiki bɔbɔk yiŋ ndi lɛ kɛ Arik kɛ icɛr yi Musa ne di ne kama kɔmɔ ne Galili ne tuŋ men Nazara. <verse eid="LUK 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40" />Fe vǝvǝne ne tǝ ngɔŋ te yi ne mgbyamgbyaŋ; ne yi mgbemgbeb, anu didik kǝ Arik ne yi bene bɔu.<verse eid="LUK 2:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesɔ ne Akabaŋkɔŋ ayou Arik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41" />Kɔte se takǝ tetɛɛ ma ben yaa maa Yesɔ agar Urshelima ne igyaŋ yi tuk glak. <verse eid="LUK 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42" />Ndi Yesɔ ne te ase wur ne ya, ne gar gyaŋ ndi ne kpai ŋyak. <verse eid="LUK 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43" />Ndi gyaŋa ne gayir tetɛɛ maa vǝvǝne ben yaa maa ne kama kɔmɔ ne kɔb, Yesɔ ne kama gbur akli ne Urshelima ne yaŋ zhi men. <verse eid="LUK 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44" />Ne yik te di a tsǝne zǝ ba ne tsin bɛr zhin. Fe awɔbu ne min aneshir bɛ gar kɔb men ben akpa amaa. <verse eid="LUK 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45" />Ndi ne wɔb bu alakakana, ne kam kɔmɔ ne Urshelima te gar wɔb bu. <verse eid="LUK 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46" />Ne te bɛr tar teshe wɔb bu yik ne Akabakɔŋ, ne amkpa ne bla lɛ kɛ Arik. Akɔ sɔŋ ne min abɛ tsar lɛ kɛ Arik, te zǝr wɔ ba te na rib lǝlɛ. <verse eid="LUK 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47" />Waŋ ndi ne wɔu lɛ maa ne sak ŋɔk nenu ne izhi ma ben sak lɛ maa.<verse eid="LUK 2:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48" />Ndi tetɛɛ maa bene yaa maa ne yigu, ne sak ŋɔk nenu. Iya maa adiu te di, &lt;&lt;izu muŋ, Une na ta anii me? Tetɛɛ mi ben nga ta zen shurɔ ayi wɔb bu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 2:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49" />&lt;&lt;Yesɔ adi ba izhin wɔb me ne ni?&gt;&gt; A rib. &lt;&lt;Ba zhin ne zhi te di me te sɔŋ ne kɔb Tetɛɛ muŋ kai?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 2:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50" />Amɛ bane zhi kiyiŋ ndi abla ba ba.<verse eid="LUK 2:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51" />Fe Yesɔ azǝ ba gar Nazara te zǝ lɛ mǝne. Amɛ yaa maa ne su kiki yiŋɛ yir ne susun maa bane bla nuŋ ba. <verse eid="LUK 2:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52" />Amɛ Yesɔ ne te ngɔŋ ne zhi teyi mgbemgbeb gɔŋ. Ne yik ta bǝn Arik bǝn aneshir.<verse eid="LUK 2:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3" />
  <para style="s">Yɔɔna ne su aneshir ne na ankɔŋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1" />Ne se kɛ wur ane tuŋ ne gli ngɔŋ kɛ Kaisar Tiberiya, Buntus Bilatus agli Yahudiya, Hiridus ayi itum ne Galili, izumen ane Filibus a gli Ituniya bene Tarakunitas, Lisaniyas a yi itum ne Abiliya, <verse eid="LUK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2" />ne mkpaŋ keŋ ndi Hannas bene kayafa aba ayi angɔngɔŋ abɛ na ndum kɛ Arik, Arik ne lɛ bene Yɔɔna izu Zakariya ne zizik. <verse eid="LUK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3" />Ne tsin itun yi Juda, te bla lɛ kɛ Arik te na su aneshir na sak kɛ Arik te bɛ duŋ na zumimin te bɛ ta ba zhɔk. <verse eid="LUK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4" />Ndi ne cɛr ne mplɛ kɛ cɛr kɛ Ishaya ine bla shar yi Arik:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">&lt;&lt;Ikɔr kɛ nuŋ zhɔ ne zizik,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">&lt;Naa zhin Arik ankɔŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:4">Na zhin ankɔŋɔ ne nab.<verse eid="LUK 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5" />Ate ku andǝgǝlɛk bɔbɔk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">Ate zir igbu bɔbɔk.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">Ate nab nkunkɔŋ ayiŋ ndi ne vǝk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">Kuŋkɔŋ yi amgbɔk bǝ kɔ.<verse eid="LUK 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6" />Aneshir abɛ yi ne kpa bɔbɔk ate yik ita zhɔk ye Arik.&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7" />Yɔɔna ne di ntsan aneshir ndi aru nyɛ te wa bǝ su ba, &lt;&lt;Izhineba ane wa! Ŋɔwa ne gbaŋ zhin atɔŋ te zhin klu mfu kɛ ŋyɛ? <verse eid="LUK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8" />Nazhin ki didik ndi te tsar duŋ na zumimin min. Kǝr zhin bɛ di akpamin, &lt;Tayi ne tetɛɛ amɔr ndi ai Ibrai.&gt; Fe mblazhin ni min mkpaŋ yiŋɛ Arik atei gli amumun gli ruu Ibrai. <verse eid="LUK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9" />Ne ka tsɔm angen a sak ne nkunkun, fe kuŋkun keŋ ndi ba te dɔ ba ate tsɔm kɛ ne ririŋ atyak zhɔk ne lu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10" />Aneshir aribu te di, &lt;&lt;Aye nii ta tei nai?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11" />Yɔɔna adi ba, &lt;&lt;Waŋ ndi ate yi ne nkluklu me ya bɛ baŋ azhiin nek Kpa maa ndi ba yime ne kǝ ba, ben waŋ ndi ate yi ne kili bɛ na mee.<verse eid="LUK 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12" />Abɛ ta gandu ne nyɛ te bɛ su ba. &lt;&lt;Ne tsar,&gt;&gt; Arib, &lt;&lt;Anii ta tei na?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13" />A diba. &lt;&lt;Duŋ ta naŋ zhin kiyiŋ ndi ne di zhin bǝ ta ba,&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14" />Abɛ kpaakpa na rib bu te di, &lt;&lt;taba mɔryime tate na kikin?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:14">Yɔɔna a di ba, &lt;&lt;Duŋ ta zhin azɔb bene abɛ lalɛ bai ki yi ŋɔk min bǝ mla zhin.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15" />Aneshir a klikli te na shur ayi te na lɛ susun men ka Yɔɔna wa yi Kristi me. <verse eid="LUK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16" />Yɔɔna ne bla ba bɔbɔk mǝne, &lt;&lt;Me su zhin ne mashir ne inek ne juda. Amɛ waŋ ndi ayi ne mgbyamgbyaŋ anaŋ me ate ŋyɛ, bam tei zuk a kpaza maa yir ba. Ate su zhin ne izhu tsetser bǝn lu. <verse eid="LUK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17" />A gli mumu kɛ zee ne ŋɔk maa ate zee ikpu didik abiŋe a shur ne wun, fe te vu atunturɔ ashur ne lu kɛ yaŋ rim.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18" />Yɔɔna ne bla lǝlɛ tetɛk tena bla ba abɛ duŋ kiki yi na men.<verse eid="LUK 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19" />Ankyak ndi Yɔɔna ne vee Hiridus ne ta Hirudiya, iwa zumen, bene kiki mimin ndi ne nayi, <verse eid="LUK 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20" />Hiridus ne biŋ kiyiŋɛ, te vuŋ Yɔɔna aku ne jaru.<verse eid="LUK 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yɔɔna ne Su Yesɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21" />Ndi Yɔɔna ne su aneshir bɔbɔk ne sak kɛ Arik, ne na su Yesɔ mayi. Fe ndi ne zin ben Arik, gbarshu ne bu <verse eid="LUK 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22" />Ankyak izhu tsetser ne zǝǝ sɔŋ ne kpa maa ndi angu. Ankyak kɔr rɛ gbarshu tedi: &lt;&lt;Waŋa ayi zumuŋ, me nyeru; me ne tanyɛmɛ bene bɔu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nga ŋli kɛ Yesɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23" />Yesɔ ne te ase sɔk tar te she vuŋ ndum maa. Ne yi vǝvǝn, ne yik tedi, ayi zu Yusuu,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:23">Izu Heli, <verse eid="LUK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24" />izu Mata,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:24">Izu Levi, ne ŋli Melki,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:24">Izu Janai, ne ŋli Yusuu,<verse eid="LUK 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25" />Izu Matayas, ne ŋli Amɔs, izu Nahum, ne ŋli Esli, izu naggai, <verse eid="LUK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26" />izu Maat, ne ŋli Matayas, izu Semei, ndi a yi zu Josek, izu Joda, <verse eid="LUK 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27" />ne ŋli Joanan, waŋ ndi Rhesa ne ŋliu, izu Zerubabɛl, izu shɛtiyel, ndi Neri ne ŋliu, <verse eid="LUK 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28" />Izu Melki, ne ŋli Addi, izu kɔsam, izu Elmadam, waŋ ndi Er ne ŋliu, <verse eid="LUK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29" />Izu Joshuwa ne ŋli Eliaza, izu Jorim, izu Matat, ne ŋli Levi, <verse eid="LUK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30" />izu Simɔn, waŋ ndi Yahuza ne ŋliu, izu Yusuu, izu Yonana, ŋli kɛ Eliyakim, <verse eid="LUK 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31" />Izu Malaya, waŋ ndi Mainana ne ŋliu, ŋli kɛ Matata, izu Natan, ŋli kɛ Doda <verse eid="LUK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32" />izu Yese, izu Obida, ŋli kɛ Buaza, waŋ ndi Solɔmɔn ne ŋliu, izu Nashan, <verse eid="LUK 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33" />Nashan ayi zu Aminadab, ndi ayi zu Aram, izu Hesruna, ne ŋli Feresa, ndi ayi zu Yahuza. <verse eid="LUK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34" />Yakubu ayi zu Ishaku ne ŋli Ibrai, izu Tera ne ŋli Nahor. <verse eid="LUK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35" />Nahor ayi zu Serug, ne ŋli Reyu, izu Feleg, di ayi zu Ebɛr, Ebɛr ayi zu Shela, <verse eid="LUK 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36" />Shela ayi izu Kena izu Afashak, Afashak ayi izu Shem, Shem ayi zu Nuhu ndi ayi zu Lamek, <verse eid="LUK 3:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37" />ne ŋli Metusela, ndi ayi zu Anuhu, ne ŋli Jare, izu Mahalɛl, waŋ ndi ayi zu Kenan, <verse eid="LUK 3:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38" />Kenan ayi zu Enosh, izu Shitu, ne ŋli Ademu, Ademu Arik ne nau.<verse eid="LUK 3:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4" />
  <para style="s">Ne ten Yesɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1" />Yesɔ, ne shak ne Izhu Tsetser, ne kama nyak rɛ nek ne Urdu, Izhu ne gliu te kɔmɔ ne zizik, <verse eid="LUK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2" />ne te bɛr sɔk nas ndi shetan ne zen tenu, bane li kinuŋ ba ne bɛr sɔk nas te zen ben te kpa anu ni klɛtu mɔ jɔŋ ne vuŋu.<verse eid="LUK 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3" />Shetan ne diu, &lt;&lt;Teyi ndi uyi zu Arik, kam kpaŋ te bɛ yi borodi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4" />Yesɔ adiu, &lt;&lt;Ne cɛr te di, neshir bate yi tsitsir ne borodi ankyak ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5" />Shetan ne gli Yesɔ te kɔmɔ ne shushu te tsaru kiki yi gɔnmimi. <verse eid="LUK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6" />Fe shetan adiu, &lt;&lt;me te nugu mgbyamgbyaŋ bǝn kiki yiŋɛ bɔbɔk, ne nǝm ayi bɔbɔk, me te na nek waŋ ndi ne tanyɛmɛ bene bɔu. <verse eid="LUK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7" />Utǝ zekur mǝ, bɔbɔk kiyiŋ teyi mi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8" />Yesɔ adiu, &lt;&lt;Ne cɛr te di: &lt;Zekur Arik ami te na zǝu ankyak.&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9" />Shetan ne gliu te kɔmɔ ne Urshelima te duŋu yuŋ itushu kɛ Akabakɔŋ. Te diu, &lt;&lt;Te yi ndi uyi zu Arik,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Tuk zhaku ne mimi. <verse eid="LUK 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10" />Tǝ ne cɛr te di, &lt;Arik atei duŋ abɛ shar maa abɛ ziggu.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11" />Tena di, &lt;Atei glǝu nǝ shu ne ŋɔk amen tǝ duŋ kǝr ila za mi bǝ tar nǝ mkpaŋ ba.&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12" />Fe Yesɔ adiu, &lt;&lt;ne di: &lt;Kǝr bɛ ten Arik ami ba.&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13" />Ndi shetan ne klɛ ten Yesɔ ne kama tibɛ te duŋu ne kpaŋ watsɔb.<verse eid="LUK 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ne kyak Yesɔ ne Nazara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14" />Yesɔ ne kama kɔmɔ ne Galili ne mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ izhu tsetser, fe lɛ maa ne shak kɔte me ne ntuno. <verse eid="LUK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15" />Ne zin tsar ne Akabakɔŋ, kɔte ŋɔwa ne gbaru asak.<verse eid="LUK 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16" />Fe ne gar Nazara, ndi ne tǝ ngɔŋ amɔ, fe ne bɛr yi sɔŋ sik ne gar akaba, ndi na mǝne. Fe alu akli te bla lɛ kɛ Arik. <verse eid="LUK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17" />Ankyak ne baŋ icɛr yi Ishaya ine bla shar yi Arik anugu ta gli na ŋɔk ma. Ndi ne bui, ne yik akpa awaŋ ndi ne cɛr te di:<verse eid="LUK 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18" />&lt;&lt;Izhu yi Arik iyi bene bɛm,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">Amɛ ndi ne ka shur me anyɛ tu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">Te bɛ mbla lɛ didik bene bɛ yaŋ ki yi gɔŋmimi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">Ne shar me te me bla abɛ kur ne jaru ilɛ kɛ men,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">Te na duŋ abɛ amfik ayik,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">Te bɛ zuk abaŋ ndi ne kpa ba shur,<verse eid="LUK 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19" />Abɛ na bla ne ise kɛ Arik nyɛ ta aneshir zhɔk.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20" />Fe aŋyen icɛre, te baŋǝ nek abaŋ ndi ne ye amkpama te zie sɔŋ. A bɛ baŋ ndi ayi ne Akaba ma ne shur Yesɔ ayi, <verse eid="LUK 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21" />akɔ diba te di, &lt;&lt;Aliŋ cɛr yiŋɛ ne shaga ne wɔ atɔŋɔ amin.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22" />Bɔbɔk mǝne ne bla lɛ didik ne tu maa te na sak aŋɔk nenu ne lǝlɛ ndi ne rurɛ anu maa. Arib te di, &lt;&lt;Waŋ ba yi zu Yusuu kai?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23" />Yesɔ adi ba, &lt;&lt;Iye mee izhin tei blam nkanlɛ yiŋɛ: &lt;Ine na kǝka, na tu mi! Izhin te na dim na ta iki yiŋ ndi tane wɔ une nayi ne kafanahum.&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24" />&lt;&lt;Me bla zhin lɛ didik,&gt;&gt; te di, &lt;&lt;Ine bla shar yi Arik ba te tau ne tun ma ba. <verse eid="LUK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25" />Mbla zhin zub amba baŋ ndi alulum amen ne ku tetɛk ne gar Isrela ne kpaŋ kɛ Iliya, Ndi alu bane ku ba a se me tar ne hwa tani fe ijɔŋ ngɔŋ ne vuŋ ba bɔbɔk ne ntuno. <verse eid="LUK 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26" />Ndi amɛ bane shar Iliya bene nuŋ ba, ne duŋɔ gar bǝn wa nuŋ ndi lu maa ne ku ne Zarifat ne ntun yi Sidon. <verse eid="LUK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27" />Nǝ kpaŋa abɛ amgbyak aŋɔk ne Isrela a klɛ tetɛk ne kpaŋ kɛ Sidon Elisha ne bla shar yi Arik, ne me nuŋ ba ne rɛ ba ai Naaman a wɔ nǝ Suriya ankyak.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28" />Ndi aner abaŋ ndi ayi ne akaba ne wɔ me te te mfu ngɔŋ. <verse eid="LUK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29" />Ne lu, te yaru agli rumɔ ne ntuno, fe te gliu te kɔmɔ ne igbu ndi ne me tun anyaŋǝ. Te bɛ turu atyak azhɔk. <verse eid="LUK 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30" />Ankyak Yesɔ ne zǝ min ntsan aneshir te naŋadɔ.<verse eid="LUK 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesɔ ne gli izhu mimin agli rumɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31" />Fe ne zie gar kɛ Kafanahum, ne tun yi Galili, ne bɛr yi sɔŋ sik te zen tsar aneshir. <verse eid="LUK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32" />Ne sak aŋɔk ne ne ndi ne wɔ tsar maa, duŋ tsar ma yi mgbemgbeb.<verse eid="LUK 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33" />&lt;&lt;Ne min Akabakɔŋ ner nuŋ ndi anerim ne yir kpa maa, ndi ayi ne izhu mimin. Ne zhin ne kɔr ngɔŋ te di, <verse eid="LUK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34" />&lt;&lt;Kwui! Uwɔb anii bene bɛta, Yesɔ ne Nazara? Ne nyɛ ŋlɔk tei? Me ne zhi uyi ŋɔwa uyi tsetser ne Arik!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35" />Yesɔ atsaŋ ba te di, &lt;&lt;ku anu!&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Ru ne kpa kɛ ner waŋa!&gt;&gt; Ankyak anerime abaŋ nɛrɛ ŋur ne mimi ne ti kɛ aneshir bɔbɔk, te ru te duŋu keke.<verse eid="LUK 4:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36" />Aneshir bɔbɔk abaŋ ndi ayi ne kpama ne sak aŋɔk nenu te di akpa mɛn, &lt;&lt;Waŋa ai tsar ta yi? Ne mgbyamgbyaŋ ben yaŋ te sisik ne lɛ ben izhu mimin te duŋǝ ru ne kpa kɛ ner waŋa!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37" />Ankyak lɛ maa ne shak ntuntun.<verse eid="LUK 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesɔ ne na aneshir tetɛk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38" />Yesɔ ne ru ne Akabakɔŋ te gar kɔb ne Siman ndi azhɔu te Biturus. Azhi men Biturus ikpa ne vuŋu ŋgɔŋ, fe aben Yesɔ abɛ duŋu are. <verse eid="LUK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39" />Fe Yesɔ ne zedɔ ne tu maa te tsaŋ lɔmɔ ankyak akɔ rɛ. Ne kpaa kpama akɔ lu te na ba kili.<verse eid="LUK 4:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40" />Ndi arik ne ku, ne Gli aner abɛ lɔ tetɛk te nyɛ ben Yesɔ ne sak ba ŋɔk te duŋ ba rɛ. <verse eid="LUK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41" />Neme, Anerim ne ru ne kpa kɛ aneshir tetɛk, te lɛ ne kɔr ngɔŋ te di, &lt;&lt;Uyi zu Arik!&gt;&gt; Ankyak Yesɔ ne tsaŋ ba te di ku zhin anu, ne zhi te ayi Kristi<verse eid="LUK 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42" />Ndi bɛr ne ŋan, Yesɔ ru te gar amkpa waŋ ndi ba ner nuŋ. Aneshir ne wɔb bu fe te yik amkpa awaŋ ndi ayime, bane tanyɛmɛ te bɛ kama tibɛ bene bɛba ba. <verse eid="LUK 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43" />Ankyak ne di ba, &lt;&lt;Ai ndum muŋ me bla aneshir lɛ kɛ men kɛ kɔb Arik ne nki ntuntun.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44" />Ankyak ne bla ba lɛ kɛ Arik ne Akabakɔŋ ne Yahudiya.<verse eid="LUK 4:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5" />
  <para style="s">Yesɔ ne zhɔ abɛ zeu tsin abɛ kuti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1" />Iber nuŋ yime Yesɔ a klikli ne kɔtɔŋ nek ne Janisara, ntsan aneshir ne kamɔ azik te zen wɔ lɛ kɛ Arik. <verse eid="LUK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2" />Fe a yik igu mɔtsɔtsɔb me yaa ne kɔtɔŋ nek ngɔŋ, abɛ vu ambɛ a zǝn ŋla burgi amene. <verse eid="LUK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3" />Fe Yesɔ ayir min gu kɛ Siman Biturus, a diu tedi abɛ gli igumɔ te nyɛ kɔtɔŋ nek. Ankyak akɔ zǝ sɔŋ te zen tsar aneshir ne min gumɔ.<verse eid="LUK 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4" />Ndi Yesɔ ne lɛ klɛ, a di Siman Biturus, &lt;&lt;baŋ burgi mi zhɔk ne tiŋ amashir te vu ambɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5" />Siman Biturus a sagu ma, &lt;&lt;Iner ngɔŋ, ta ne yik ya rɛ bu ba ta ne vuŋ kinuŋ ba, ai wa udim, duŋ me tuk burgi me zhɔgo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6" />Ndi ne na me, ne vu ambɛ tetɛk, iburgi ne vu ambɛ izen gbuŋa. <verse eid="LUK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7" />Fe akɔ zhɔ akpa amɛn ndi ayi ne gu kɛ yaa ma te di abɛ nyɛ lɔk ba ma. ne nyɛ tɛ vu ambe ashak min igu mɛ yaa ma ndi tei rim.<verse eid="LUK 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8" />Ndi Siman Biturus ne yik amɛ, azhaku ne ti kɛ Yesɔ te di, &lt;&lt;Kam tibɛ ni ti muŋ, Ngɔŋ; me yi ner ne lalɛ!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9" />Biturus ben akpa amaa, ne vuŋ anu ne ambɛ abaŋ ndi ne vu ba, <verse eid="LUK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10" />Ane Yakubu bǝn Yɔɔna amumun abɛ Zebɛdi, akpa abɛ Siman Biturus. Fe Yesɔ adi Biturus &lt;&lt;duŋ te sisik ba, vuŋ rɛ azizaŋ te kɔmɔ ti utei Gli aneshir te nyɛ bene bɛm.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11" />Ndi ne gli gumɔ te nyɛ kɔtɔŋ nek, ne duŋ kiki men bɔbɔk te zǝu.<verse eid="LUK 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesɔ nena ne kpuk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12" />Ndi Yesɔ ne yi ne min kɛ ntun nuŋ, iner ne kpuk ne nyɛ ben bau, ndi ne yik Yesɔ, ne zhaku te ku ti ma ne mimi te benu, &lt;&lt;Ŋgɔŋ, utǝ tanyɛme duŋ me rɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13" />Fe Yesɔ a nab ŋɔk ma te sa ner ne amkpuk ne kǝ, te di, &lt;&lt;mǝne tanyɛme, ubǝ rɛ&gt;&gt; ne amkpa amkpama akɔ rɛ.<verse eid="LUK 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14" />Yesɔ akɔ gbaŋu atɔŋ te di abɛ duŋ bla nuŋ ba, adiu te di &lt;&lt;Tsin kɔmɔ ben ine na ndum kǝ Arik te duŋɔ ayigu, te na tuk amkpur te tsar ba rɛ mi te duŋ ba abɛ yik, ir keŋ ndi Musa ne bla.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15" />Ne me ilɛ maa ne shak akpa, aneshir a zin nyɛ te wɔu, te abɛ na duŋ ba re menyi. <verse eid="LUK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16" />Mkpaŋ nuŋ Yesɔ ne aben awɔb amkpa te sɔŋ kiki maa ne amkpa waŋ ndi ai wa kiki maa te ben Arik.<verse eid="LUK 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesɔ ne na ne ku kpa gar zhin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17" />Iber nuŋ yime a zin tsar, ane Ferisawa bǝn abǝ zhi cɛr yi Musa ne rurɛ ntuntun yi Galili, ben yi Yahudiya, bǝn Urshelima, te kɔ sɔŋ amɔ. Mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ Arik kɛ ne na aneshire te ne rɛ. <verse eid="LUK 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18" />Fe aneshire nuŋ agli ner ne ku kpa gar zhin ne ki kur te wɔb te ba bǝ zǝu zhɔk ne ti kɛ Yesɔ. <verse eid="LUK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19" />Ndi bane yik ankɔŋ ane na me ba aneshir ne te du, ne baŋu te yuŋ tu ki te zhɔk ririk te zhɔ gu ne ti kɛ Yesɔ.<verse eid="LUK 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20" />Ndi Yesɔ ne yik itanyɛmɛ maa, fe adi, &lt;&lt;kpamuŋ, mǝne zugu zhɔk ne zumimin mi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21" />Amɛ Ferisawa bǝn abɛ tsar cɛr yi Musa alɛ ne akpa men te di, &lt;&lt;Ayi ŋɔ te lǝlɛ kɛ lɛk susun amɛ? Ai ŋɔ tei zuk iner nǝ lalɛ zhɔk mba Arik ankyak?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22" />Yesɔ ne zhi lɛ ne mǝne, te rib, &lt;&lt;Izhin lɛ ne kɛ ni ne min kɛ asusun amin? <verse eid="LUK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23" />Itayi ne naŋ: abɛ di, &lt;Ne zuk zumimin zhɔk, &gt; ka abɛdi, &lt;Lu tsin&gt;? <verse eid="LUK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24" />Tǝ zhin bɛ zhi Izu neshir ayi ne mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ zuk zumimin zhɔk yi gɔnmimi, ankyak.&gt;&gt; Akɔ di ne ku kpama, &lt;&lt;Lu te baŋ ki kur mi te kɔmɔ ne kɔb.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25" />Ne amkpama akɔ rɛ te lu kli ne ti men, te baŋ ki kur maa, te tsǝne kɔmɔ ne kɔb te zen gbar Arik asak. <verse eid="LUK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26" />kɔte ŋɔ ne vuŋ anu te gbara Arik asak. Sisik ku vuŋ ba fe adi, &lt;&lt;Ayi mɔr ne yik ki sak ŋɔk ne ne.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesɔ ne zhɔ lawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27" />Ndi yiŋɛ ne gayir, Yesɔ ne ru te yik ne ta gendu azhɔu te lawi, akɔ sɔŋ ne bur, te zin na ndum kɛ ta gendu, Yesɔ adiu. &lt;&lt;Lu zǝm,&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28" />Fe Lawi ne duŋ ki maa bɔbɔk, te zǝu.<verse eid="LUK 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29" />Ankyak Lawi ne kɔmɔ te kɔ te na gyaŋ te naa Yesɔ kili didik ne kɔb maa, abɛ ta gendu tetɛk bǝn aneshir anuŋ a zin li bene bau. <verse eid="LUK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30" />Fe Ferisawa bǝn abɛ tsar atɔra adi abɛ tsene maa te di &lt;&lt;Anii duŋ zhin li te so bǝn a bɛ ta gendu bǝn abɛ na zumimin?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31" />Yesɔ asak bama te di, &lt;&lt;Aner abɛ yine mgbyamgbyaŋ ba wɔb kǝka ba, se abɛ lɔ. <verse eid="LUK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32" />Bam ne nyɛ zhɔ abɛ yi tsetser ba, mǝne nyɛ te abɛ na zumimin abɛ duŋ zumimin men te zǝm.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ne rib Yesɔ ne tu kpa anu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33" />Fe adiu te di, &lt;&lt;abɛ zǝ Yɔɔna a kpa anu amkpamkpaŋ te na ben Arik, Ferisawa ana na me, ama abɛ tsene ami ali te so.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34" />Ankyak Yesɔ adi ba, &lt;&lt;Izhin wɔb te akpaa abɛ waŋ ndi azugu wama abɛ kpa anu ndi azǝn na gyaŋ? <verse eid="LUK 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35" />Mkpaŋ nyɛ ndi a tei baŋ waŋ ndi akpau ŋa ne ti men. Ai mkpaŋa atei ka kpa anu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36" />Fe Yesɔ ne bla ba nkanlɛ: &lt;&lt;Nuŋ ba tei gbu anklu ayayas aŋaa te ahwɛn acicɛ, ate na me ba tei te ba, ayuŋɔ ba tei te acicɛ me ba. <verse eid="LUK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37" />Nuŋ ba tei vu ama inabi a yayas a shur ne cice ne gwara ba. Ate shurɔ gwarama a tei ŋar hrie gwara tei cɔkla. <verse eid="LUK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38" />Neme ama inabi a yayas, a wɔb gwara yayas. <verse eid="LUK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39" />Ba waŋ di atai wɔb te abɛ sɔ ama inabi ayayas, ndi ne ka sɔ a cice, a tei di &lt;Ai a cice me arɛ naŋ.&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6" />
  <para style="s">Arik ne bɛr Sɔŋ sik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1" />Nǝ bɛr yi Sɔŋ sik nuŋ yiŋɛ Yesɔ azǝn zǝ min arum akɛ alikama, fe abɛ tsene maa akɔ ŋɔr alikama te nuk mgbyaŋa te tei. <verse eid="LUK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2" />Ferisawa anuŋ arib, &lt;&lt;Anii duŋ zhin glak lɛ keŋ ndi ne lɛ kǝ kpa nyak ne atu yi bɛr yi Sɔŋ sik?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3" />Yesɔ asak bama, &lt;&lt;Ba zhin ne tɔ cɛr yiŋ ndi Doda ne na ben akpa amaa ndi abaŋ ndi ijɔŋ ne vuŋ ba kai? <verse eid="LUK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4" />Ne yir kɔb kɛ Arik, te baŋ mbwab borodi ndi ne nyak abɛ na ndum Arik ata, ne ta mbwab borodi kɛ ine na ndum kǝ Arik ndi bai kɛ ta maa ba. Tena nek abɛ tsene maa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5" />Ne klɛtu fe Yesɔ adi ba, &lt;&lt;Izu Neshir a yi Ŋgɔŋ ne bɛr yi sɔŋ sik.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6" />Nǝ bɛr yi Sɔŋ sik nuŋ, Yesɔ ne yir Akaba te zen tsar ba, fe neshir nuŋ ndi ŋɔk maa kɛ lii ne shen. <verse eid="LUK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7" />Ferisawa ben abɛ tsar izhi lɛ azǝn wɔb ankɔŋ ane vuŋ Yesɔ ne lalɛ, aneshir azǝn shurɔ yi ka tei na neshir te bɛ rɛ ne bɛr yi Sɔŋ sik. <verse eid="LUK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8" />Amɛ Yesɔ ne zhi ilɛ mǝne tedi ner ne shen ŋɔgo, &lt;&lt;Lu klɛ ne tii kɛ aneshire.&gt;&gt; Fe akɔ lu kli ne tii mǝne.<verse eid="LUK 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9" />Fe Yesɔ adi ba, &lt;&lt;M rib zhin, aye nii rɛ abɛ nai ne bɛr yi Sɔŋ sik: bɛ na ki didik ka bɛ na ki mimin ni? Abɛ duŋ nuŋ ayik ivli ka abɛ ŋunu ni? &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10" />Akama tɔ ba bɔbɔk, te di neshire, &lt;&lt;Nab ŋɔk mi.&gt;&gt; Akɔ nab kǝ, fe ŋɔk maa ku nab anenen. <verse eid="LUK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11" />Ankyak akɔ te mfu te kama lɛ ne kpa men ne ki yiŋ ndi aba atei na Yesɔ.<verse eid="LUK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesɔ ne hria abɛ na ndum maa awur ane yaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12" />Iber nuŋ yime Yesɔ ne yuŋ tu gbu te gar ben Arik. Tǝ kur amɔ te zen ben Arik. <verse eid="LUK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13" />Ndi bɛr ne ŋan, a zhɔ abɛ tsene maa te hria aner awur ane yaa ne min mǝne abaŋ ndi ne di atei naa wa ndum. <verse eid="LUK 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14" />Siman waŋ ndi azhɔu te Biturus ben zumen Anduru, Yakubu, Yɔɔna, Filibus, Batɔlɔmi, <verse eid="LUK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15" />Matiu, Tɔma, Yakubu izu Halfa. Isiman waŋ di a zhɔu te Zalɔt, <verse eid="LUK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16" />Yahuza Izu Yakubu, ben Yahuza Iskariyɔti waŋ ndi ne baŋ Yesɔ alɛb.<verse eid="LUK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nek Anu didik ben la neshir</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17" />Yesɔ ne gli abɛ tsene maa te kama zi te kli ne amkpa waŋ ndi ba yi gbu ba. Ntsan aneshir ne zeu anyɛ rɛ ntun yi Yahudiya, ben Urshelima, ben gar kɛ Taya ben Sidon. <verse eid="LUK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18" />Abaŋ ndi ne nyɛ wɔ lɛ maa te bɛ nab ba te duŋ ba rɛ ne min kɛ lɔ men. Abaŋ ndi izhu mimin ne sak ba iya ne rɛ, <verse eid="LUK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19" />kɔte ŋɔwa ne min kɛ aneshir awɔb te wa abɛ sagu ŋɔk, te mgbyamgbyaŋ rurɛ kpa maa te duŋ ba rɛ.<verse eid="LUK 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20" />Yesɔ atɔ abɛ tsene maa, te di:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:20">&lt;&lt;Anu didik ayi abaŋ ndi ba yi ne kinuŋ ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:20">Neme kɔb kɛ Arik iyi men.<verse eid="LUK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21" />Anu didik ayi ben abaŋ ndi ijɔŋ vuŋ zhin azizaŋa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">Atei duŋ zhin hri.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">Anu didik ayi ben abaŋ ndi azhin azizaŋa, te izhin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">Tei mlak.<verse eid="LUK 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22" />Anu didik ayi bǝn abaŋ ndi aner akyak zhin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:22">Ndi aneshir ate pwar zhin tena yen zhin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:22">Tena kyak asak amin ndi te ben na kɛ mimin,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="LUK 6:22">Ne atu ayi Izu Neshir.<verse eid="LUK 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23" />&lt;&lt;Nyɛr zhin ne bǝn, te mlak nyɛr, te idǝk min iyi ŋgɔŋ ne gbarshu. Ne me ane naa abɛ bla shar yi Arik.<verse eid="LUK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24" />&lt;&lt;Fena zhin zhɔk atu amin izhin abɛ yi ne ki ŋɔk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:24">Tǝ ne ka yis zhin ayi amin.<verse eid="LUK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25" />Zhin zhɔk atu amin izhin abaŋ ndi neka nek zhin lii.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">Te ijɔŋ tei vuŋ zhin.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">Zhin shur atu min izhin abɛ mlak azizaŋa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">Tǝ izhin tei kɔr asusun tena zhin.<verse eid="LUK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26" />Zhin zhɔk atu amin ndi aneshir tetɛk atei lɛ ki didik ne atu min,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 6:26">Iye mee ane lǝlɛ didik ne atɔ atetɛ min abɛ timu tedi aba bla lɛ kɛ Arik.<verse eid="LUK 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tanyɛme ben ne kyagu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27" />&lt;&lt;Fena Mbla zhin abaŋ ndi awɔm: Nyer abɛ kyagu, te naa ba ki didik, <verse eid="LUK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28" />nek abaŋ ndi ayen zhin anu adidik, ben Arik ne atu abaŋ ndi akyak zhin yi. <verse eid="LUK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29" />Inuŋ ate ŋuru ne ŋkɔn ŋa zhiin, kamu kɛ yaa maa. Iwaŋ ndi ate baŋ anklu ami, duŋɔ abaŋ akɛ su kɛ miŋe. <verse eid="LUK 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30" />Nǝk waŋ ndi ate benu, iwaŋ ndi ate baŋ ki mi duŋ na diu tei ba. <verse eid="LUK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31" />Naa nuŋ iki yiŋ ndi udi abɛ nau neyi.<verse eid="LUK 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32" />&lt;&lt;Izhin tedi izhin ne nyer abaŋ ndi ne nyer zhin ankyak, fe izhin ne baŋ anii? kɔ abɛ &lt;Na zumimin&gt;&gt; A nyer abaŋ ndi a nyer ba. <verse eid="LUK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33" />Ne mee te zhin te na ki didik bene abaŋ ndi ana zhin ki didik. Izhin ne ta nii? Amɛ abɛ na zumimin anai. <verse eid="LUK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34" />Ate yi ndi izhin kɔb abɛ yaa zhin ihria ankyak, aye nii izhin te shur ayi nai? Amɛ abɛ na &lt;zumimin&gt; A kɔb akpa men tena nek kɛ anenen. <verse eid="LUK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35" />Fena nyer abɛ kyak zhin, naa ba ki didik, izhin te kɔb ba duŋ na di zhin ushur ayi te bɛ kama ya zhin ba. Amɛ, idǝk min tei yi ŋgɔŋ, fe izhin tei nayi amun Arik Ŋgɔŋ te awɔ lɔ susun abɛ nyer bǝn abɛ na ki mimin. <verse eid="LUK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36" />Lɔ zhin susun abɛ kyak zhin yi, ndi Tetɛɛ min alɔ susun mine.<verse eid="LUK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ite anuŋ ambuk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37" />Yesɔ adi &lt;&lt;Duŋ te anuŋ ambuk ba, te ba tei teu ba. Duŋ yik neshir nuŋ ayi kisha ba, te ba tei yigu uyi ki sha ba. Zuk izhu zhɔk, atei na zu gu azhɔk. <verse eid="LUK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38" />Nǝk, atei na nǝgu ma. Ikuca kɛ tsar ki, keŋ ndi yi didik ndi ne kpaŋ kɛ, Izhaŋ var hrie, ne a za. Tǝ kuca keŋ ndi utǝ tsar kime, ai kɛ atei tsa ru ma mi yi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39" />Yesɔ nena bla ba nkanlɛ yiŋɛ: &lt;&lt;Ineshir ne amfik atei Gli ner ne amfik ge? Iyah mǝne batei zhaku ne dudu kai? <verse eid="LUK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40" />Iwaŋ ndi a tsaru ba naŋ ne tsaru ba, fena iwaŋ ndi ne tsa ru ŋgɔŋ atei yi ndi ne tsaru.<verse eid="LUK 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41" />&lt;&lt;Anii teu tɔ kenkam kɛ iyi zumin te kyak kam tɔ ikɛ iyi mi? <verse eid="LUK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42" />U na kikin te di zumin, &lt;Zumɔr, duŋ me ntunu mkpɔk kenkam kɛ yi mi,&gt; Ndi bau ne tun kɛ yi mi kai? Izhin abɛ na yik ayi, kuti tun mkpɔk kǝŋkam ndi yi ne yi mi baliŋ, ayemi atei ka laŋ atɔ iyi kɛ zumin te ka tunu maa.<verse eid="LUK 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Itiŋ kuŋkun ben dɔ maa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43" />&lt;&lt;Nkunkun didik ba gli dɔ mimin rumɔ ba, amɛ kuŋkun mimin ba Gli dɔ didik rumɔ ba. <verse eid="LUK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44" />Azhi tiŋ nkunkun ne dɔ maa. Aneshir batei kyaŋ dɔ Lambwe ne tiŋ azaa ne zizik ba, kai kyaŋ inabi ne tiŋ ncɔŋ ba. <verse eid="LUK 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45" />Ineshir didik a gli ki didik arumɔ ne susun maa, amɛ ineshir mimin a gli ki mimin a rumɔ ne susun maa. Ikiyiŋ ndi iyi ne miŋ ne ai yi ru nenu.<verse eid="LUK 6:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iner ne tɔ gar ti ben kpukpur ner</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46" />&lt;&lt;Ai ni duŋ zhin zhɔm, &lt;Ŋgɔŋ, Ŋgɔŋ,&gt; Tǝ kyak na zhin kiyiŋ ndi Mblai? <verse eid="LUK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47" />Mtei tsar zhin ndi ayi ndi waŋ ndi ne nyɛ bene bam te wɔ lɛ muŋ te na ndum ne kǝ me. <verse eid="LUK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48" />Ayi ndi neshir waŋ ndi ne mee kɔb, ne ka ŋlɔ ntanda ayir min ne tu yaŋ. Anca ne ru, amashire ne gara zǝ kɔbɔ, bane zǝr ba, te ne mee kɛ ne tu yaŋ. <verse eid="LUK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49" />Fena iwaŋ ndi ne wɔ lɛ muŋ te kyak na ndum ne kǝ, ayi ndi iner waŋ ndi ne sak ntanda ne tu ablubluk te kyak ka ŋlɔ mkpaŋ tiŋe. Ndi nguŋgu ngɔŋ ne fuk, ikɔbɔ ne zhaku izhaku mimin.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 6:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7" />
  <para style="s">Itanyɛme yi ŋgɔŋ ne tyak kum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1" />Ndi Yesɔ neka bla ilɛmɛ aklɛ ne wɔ aneshir, ne yir Kafanahum. <verse eid="LUK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2" />Igen ayou ngɔŋ ne tyak kum nuŋ, ndi atukɔ maa anyeru ngɔŋ, ne lɔ ndi atei ku. <verse eid="LUK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3" />Ngɔŋ ne tyak kum ne wɔ ki na Yesɔ te shar angɔngɔŋ aneshir abɛ Yahudawa bene bɔu, te bɛ blau te bɛ gar ate na igen amaa. <verse eid="LUK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4" />Ndi ne gar ben Yesɔ, ne benu ŋgɔŋ, &lt;&lt;Ner waŋa ne te di abɛ nau te duŋu are, <verse eid="LUK 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5" />te anyer ntun mɔr tena mee ta Akabakɔŋ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6" />Ankyak Yesɔ ne zǝ ba.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:6">Bane yi gbagbaŋ ne kɔbɔ ba ndi ngɔŋ ne tyak kum ndi ne shar akpa maa te bɛ diu: &lt;&lt;Ŋgɔŋ, duŋ nek tu mi iya tedi utei nyɛ ikɔb muŋ ba, te bam ne mla ndi utei nyɛ kɔ muŋ ba. <verse eid="LUK 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7" />Waŋ kiyiŋ di me ne yik bam ne mla ne nyɛ bǝn bɔu ba. Utǝ lɛ ankyak igen amuŋ atei rɛ. <verse eid="LUK 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8" />Nga me yi ne mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛŋ ndi abɛ yine angus amuŋ, tena yi ne abɛ kpaakpa ne angus amuŋ. Mte ndi nuŋ &lt;kɔmɔ.&gt; Ana kɔmɔ; mte na ndi nuŋ, &lt;Nyɛ,&gt; Ana nyɛ. Mte ndi igen amuŋ &lt;Na kiyiŋ,&gt; ana nai.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9" />Ndi Yesɔ ne wɔ me, ne sak ŋɔk ne ne ne lɛ kɛ ngɔŋ ne tyak kum, te kama tɔ aneshir abɛ tsene maa te di, &lt;&lt;Me blaa zhin, bam ne zen yik itanyɛmɛ ngɔŋ amɛ kɔ ne Isrela ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10" />Fe abaŋ ndi ne shar bama ne kama kɔmɔ te yik igen ayou ne tyak kum ne ka rɛ.<verse eid="LUK 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesɔ ne lɛg izu wakɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11" />Bane baŋ mkpaŋ ba, Yesɔ ne gar ntun yiŋ ndi azhɔi te Nayin, abɛ tsene maa bǝn ntsan aneshir ne zeu. <verse eid="LUK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12" />Ndi atei yir anɔkɔŋ akɛ yir ntuno, ayik agli kum kɛ izu wakɔ, wa anak ayiu vǝvǝne amaa ankyak. Ntsan aneshir ne ntuno ayi ben iwa ma <verse eid="LUK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13" />Ndi Ŋgɔŋɔ ne yigu, akɔ lɔ susun maa te di, &lt;&lt;Duŋ zhin ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14" />Fe Yesɔ ayuŋ te kɔte sak ŋɔk ne kumɔ, fe abaŋ ndi ahru kumɔ atakpa agbur akli ne amkpama. Adi, &lt;&lt;Vǝvǝnen zak, Mdi ubǝ lu sɔŋ!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15" />Vǝvǝne akɔ lu asɔŋ te lɛ, fe Yesɔ avuŋ anu nek iyah amaa.<verse eid="LUK 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16" />Bɔbɔk mǝne ne te sisik te sak ŋɔk nenu te na gbar Arik asak. Adi, &lt;&lt;Ŋgɔŋ ine bla shar yi Arik ne nyɛ bene bɛta. &lt;&lt;Arik ne nyɛ lɔk tama.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17" />Ilɛ kɛ Yesɔ ne shak ntun yi Yahudiya ben ntun yiŋ ndi ne kam Yahudiya azǝk.<verse eid="LUK 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesɔ ben Yɔɔna ne su aneshir</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18" />Abɛ zǝ Yɔɔna tsen ne gar bene bɔu ne jaru te blau kiyiŋ ndi Yesɔ ne nai bɔbɔk. Yɔɔna azho ayaa ne miŋ mǝne, <verse eid="LUK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19" />te shar ba bǝn Yesɔ te kɔte rib bu, &lt;&lt;Uyi waŋ ndi ne di atei nyɛ, kɔ tabǝ shur ayi bǝn nuŋ ini?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20" />Ndi abaŋ di Yɔɔna ne shar ba ne nyɛ ben Yesɔ, ne di, &lt;&lt;Yɔɔna ne su aneshir na shar ta bɛ nyɛ rib bu, &lt;Uyi waŋ di ne di ate nyɛ, ka ta bɛ shur ayi bǝn nuŋ ni?&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21" />Nǝ mkpaŋa Yesɔ ne duŋ anere bɛ lɔ tetɛk arɛ, bene a baŋ di anerim ne yir akpa men, te na buu abɛ mfik yi. <verse eid="LUK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22" />Fe Yesɔ a di a baŋ ndi Yɔɔna ne shar ba ma, &lt;&lt;Kam kɔmɔ zhin te kɔte blau kiki yiŋ ndi izhin ne wɔi bǝn ikiki yiŋ ndi izhin ne yigǝ ne yi amin: Abɛ amfik ayik, abɛ yaŋ tsǝn ne lu te tsǝn, abɛ amkpuk aŋɔk ne rɛ, abɛ yaŋ wɔ lɛ a wɔ, abɛ ku ne lu, ana bla abɛ yaŋ kiyi goŋ mimi lɛ didik. <verse eid="LUK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23" />Waŋ ndi bane zhaku ne tu muŋ ba ne nǝgu anu adidik.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24" />Ndi abɛ shar Yɔɔna ne kama kɔmɔ, Yesɔ ne bla aneshir lɛ kɛ Yɔɔna: &lt;&lt;Izhin gar tɔ anii ne zizigei? Ngungu yi fuk agǝga yi? <verse eid="LUK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25" />Mba me ba, izhin ru gar tɔ anii? Ner waŋ ndi a su nklunklu didik yi? Ba me ba, a baŋ ndi asu nklunklu yi te anyaŋ bǝn abaŋ ndi awɔ men kɛ goŋmimi akɔ sɔŋ ne akaba ayou itum. <verse eid="LUK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26" />Tǝ zhin ne ru gar tɔ anii? Ine bla shar yi Arik? Mbla zhin, Yɔɔna a naŋ ne bla shar ye Arik. <verse eid="LUK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27" />Waŋa a yi waŋ ndi ne cɛr ne tɔ ma te di:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:27">&lt;&lt;&lt;M tei shar gen amuŋ abɛ ku ti min,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 7:27">Ndi atei na ankɔŋ anyagu.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28" />Yesɔ adi Mbla zhin, abaŋ ndi amba ne ŋli ba inuŋ ba naŋ Yɔɔna ba; Amɛ waŋ ndi wa ayi vǝtsɔb ne kɔb Arik anaŋu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29" />Aneshir bɔbɔk, bene abɛ ta gendu, ndi ne wɔ lǝlɛ yi Yesɔ, ne tanyɛmɛ te di ankɔŋ ayou Arik aye anenen, Fe asu ba ndi Yɔɔna asu aneshire. <verse eid="LUK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30" />Ne me Ferisawa bene bɛ zhi cɛr yi Musa ngɔŋ ne kyak kiyiŋ di Arik ne naa ba nayi, bai Yɔɔna ne su ba ba.<verse eid="LUK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31" />&lt;&lt;Fe te ye ni, me tei tsar aneshir ben gɔŋmimi kǝŋe ne anii? Ayi ndi anii? <verse eid="LUK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32" />Ayi ndi amumun abaŋ ndi a kɔ sɔŋ ne dub te zhɔ kpa men,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:32">&lt;&lt;&lt;Tane vli zhin ayiyaŋ ba zhin ne glu ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 7:32">Tane sɔŋ ku ba izhin ne zhin ba.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33" />Yɔɔna ne su aneshir ne nyɛ bane li kili ba, ba nena sɔ ama dɔ nkunkun inabi ba, fena zhin di, &lt;Ayi ne anerim.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34" />Izu neshir ne nyɛ te li te so, fe zhin di, &lt;Tɔ zhin ne li ngɔŋ bǝn ne sɔ waŋa, ikpa ne bɛ ta gendu bene bɛ &lt;&lt;na zumimin.&gt;&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35" />Amɛ mgbemgbebɛ kɛ Arik a tanyɛmɛ ne kiki bɔbɔk ye na amun maa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wa ne na zu mimin ne kin Yesɔ anye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36" />Awɔ ne Ferisawa nuŋ ne zhɔ Yesɔ li kili ne kɔ maa, ne gar kɔb kɛ Bafarisi me te sɔŋ li kili bene bɔu. <verse eid="LUK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37" />Wa nuŋ ne na zumimin ne ntuno ne wɔ Yesɔ a sɔŋ li kili ne kɔbɔ Bafarisi, Fe ne baŋ anye ne ŋu mgbɔ didik te gar kɔbɔ. <verse eid="LUK 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38" />Ne kɔ te kli ne ti kɛ Yesɔ te nugu anye ne za maa te zhin, iwa ma akin amayi ama ne za yi Yesɔ fe te yis aza Yesɔ ne Fumfuk tu ma te kin aza Yesɔ ne ne ma te na shuru anyɛ ne ŋu mgbɔ didik.<verse eid="LUK 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39" />Ndi Bafarisi ndi ne zhɔu ne yik kiyiŋ ndi wa waŋ ne nayi a di tu maa, &lt;&lt;abɛ di ner waŋ a yi ine bla shar yi Arik abɛ zhi waŋ ndi acɔgu ŋɔk tena zhi ayi wa tawa ndi ayi ne na zumimin.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40" />Yesɔ ne ta nyeu ma, &lt;&lt;Isiman, me yi ne ki yi blau.&gt;&gt; Siman</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:40">Adi. &lt;&lt;Blam ne tsar,&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41" />Yesɔ adi&lt;&lt;Aner yaa nuŋ ne ta ner nuŋ hria. Zhin ne ta azɔb ankplik atuŋ ne yaa maa ne ta azɔb sɔk tuŋ. <verse eid="LUK 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42" />Ayaa yaa mǝne ba yi ne ki ya nɛrɛ ba. Fe inɛrɛ ne duŋ ba hria maa. Ne me ita wa atei nyeru ngɔŋɔi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43" />Siman adi, &lt;&lt;Ayi waŋ di ne duŋ hria tetɛk.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:43">&lt;&lt;Yesɔ adiu,&gt;&gt; Une bla nenen.<verse eid="LUK 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44" />Fe akama tɔ wa ne zumimin te di Siman, &lt;&lt;Uyik wa waŋa? Ne yir kɔb mi. Bau ne nǝm amashir ta ŋla aza muŋ ba. Wa waŋa ne kin aza muŋ ne amayi amaa te yise ne fumfuk tu maa. <verse eid="LUK 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45" />Wa bau ne tek me, te kum ne asa ami ba, ama wa waŋa, kpaŋ ndi mǝne yir bane duŋ maa aza muŋ ne ne amaa ba. <verse eid="LUK 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46" />Bau ne shur me anyɛ ne tu muŋ ba, wa waŋa ne shur me anyɛ ne ŋu mgbɔ didik ne za muŋ. <verse eid="LUK 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47" />Fe, me blau, ne zugu zhɔk ne zumimin ngɔŋ maa, ne nyer ngɔŋ. Fe waŋ ndi ate zu gu watsɔb ai nyer watsɔb.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48" />Fe Yesɔ adi iwa ma, &lt;&lt;ne zugu zhɔk ne zumimin ma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49" />Acɛn anuŋ ndi ayi ne ankpama adi akpa men, &lt;&lt;Ner waŋa ayi ŋɔɔ wa te zuk aner abɛ na zumimin shur?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50" />Yesɔ adi iwa ma, &lt;&lt;Itanyɛmɛ yi susun mi ne tau zhɔk; kɔmɔ ne sik susun.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8" />
  <para style="s">Nkan lɛ yi ne tib</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1" />Fe, Yesɔ bǝn abɛ tsene maa ne yir ntun ngɔngɔŋ bǝn ntun mɔtsɔtsɔb, te zin du lɛ kɛ Arik kɛ men, abɛ na ndum ma amɛ awur ne yaa ne yi bene abɔu. <verse eid="LUK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2" />Amba nuŋ ndi ne gli anerim agliru bama bǝn lɔ men a gliru bama. Ne min mǝne Meryamu ndi azhɔu te Magadaliya, waŋ ndi ne Gli ishetan me taŋgba ruu ne kpa maa. <verse eid="LUK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3" />Yuwana iwa kuza, ine shar ayou Hiridus, bǝn Suzana, bǝn amba tetɛk indi ne hru kiki yi lɔk Yesɔ bǝn abɛ tsene maa.<verse eid="LUK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4" />Ndi aneshir zen bin tetɛk, fe aneshir are tuntun te nyɛ bǝn Yesɔ, abla nkanlɛ iyiŋɛ: <verse eid="LUK 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5" />&lt;&lt;Neshir nuŋ ne lɔn ne gar tib bǝbǝ ki. Ayi ne min kɛ yi bǝbǝ ki maa inuŋ ne hrie ne kɔŋ; ne caŋǝ, aŋliŋlɔ ne re gbarshu te vui amli. <verse eid="LUK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6" />Nuŋ ne hrie ne tu mkpaŋ, ndi ne tɔ te kam ku te mimi ba yi ne amkpa ma ba. <verse eid="LUK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7" />Inuŋ ne hrie ne ncoŋ, ne tɔ, ankyak ncɔŋɔ ne mli adɔmɔ. <verse eid="LUK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8" />Inuŋ ne hrie ne mimi didik. Te flu te na shur mgbyaŋ, tena ŋli mgbyaŋ tetɛk naŋ yiŋ ndi ne tib bǝ ma.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:8">Ndi ne bla me, alɛ te di, Waŋ ndi ayi ne atɔŋ ayi wɔ, abɛ wɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9" />Abɛ tsene maa a rib bu nkanlɛ maa yiŋe ndi anii. <verse eid="LUK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10" />Fe Yesɔ adi, &lt;&lt;Izhi ki suyir ne kɔb Arik ne nek zhin neyi, Fe bene nuŋ me lɛ nkan lelɛ, te di,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 8:10">&lt;&lt;&lt;Iyik kam, ba tei yik ba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 8:10">Iwɔ, atei wɔ amaa ba tei zhi ba.<verse eid="LUK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11" />&lt;&lt;Waŋa ayi bla ruu ye nkan lɛmɛ: Bǝbǝ me ayi lɛ kɛ Arik. <verse eid="LUK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12" />Iyiŋ ndi ne hrie ne akɔnɔsa ayi abaŋ ndi ne wɔ lɛ kɛ Arik, fe shetan anyɛ baŋ lɛ me gli tibɛ ne susun mǝne, te bɛ duŋ tanyɛmɛ ndi ne zuk ba shur ba. <verse eid="LUK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13" />Iyi atu mkpaŋ ayi abaŋ ndi ate wɔ lɛ, akɔ ta kɛ ne nyer susun, abaŋa ba yi ne ririŋ ba, atanyɛmɛ mɔ bɛr watsɔb, ama mkpaŋ keŋ ndi ate ten ba iya te vuŋ ba akɔ zhaku. <verse eid="LUK 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14" />Iyiŋ ndi ne hrie ne ncɔŋ ayi abaŋ ndi ne wɔ lɛ, ne shur ayi ne pwǝr, bǝn men kɛ gɔŋmimi ne duŋ ba ne zhaku. <verse eid="LUK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15" />Fe bǝbǝ yiŋ ndi ne tibɛ ne mimi didik ayi abaŋ ndi ne wɔ ilɛmɛ te vuŋ kɛ Gli gbamgbaŋ ne susun didik, ne vuŋ akpa Gli te na ki didik.<verse eid="LUK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sak ki laŋ lu ne amkpa ne sɔŋ ama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16" />&lt;&lt;Inuŋ ba tei sak lu ne iki laŋ te kui ne adonke kɔ abɛ nyak kɛ ne angus akpa ne kur ka. Neme, a sak kɛ ne amkpadeb, te duŋ abaŋa ndi ayir abɛ yik laŋ maa. <verse eid="LUK 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17" />Fe ba ki yiŋ ndi ne suyir ndi ba tei Gli arumɔ ba, ka ki yi kuŋkum yiŋ ndi ba tei bu ayi aŋyak ne bɛm ba. <verse eid="LUK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18" />Ne mee izhin bɛ shur kpa, tena wɔ. Iwaŋ ndi ayi ne ki ana sagu inuŋɔ, iwaŋ ndi ba yi ne ki ba, ivǝ yiŋ ndi ayime ne yi a tei bene bɔu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iya maa Yesɔ&gt; ben amun zumen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19" />Iya maa Yesɔ bǝn amun zumen ne nyɛ te aba abɛ yigu, bane yigu ba aneshir ne te du. <verse eid="LUK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20" />Ineshir nuŋ a blau te di, &lt;&lt;Iya mi ben amun zumin aklɛkli ne bɛm a ŋubu te bɛ yigu. <verse eid="LUK 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21" />A ta nyɛmɛ tedi, &lt;&lt;Abaŋ ndi a wɔ lɛ kɛ Arik te na zǝ kǝ, aye ba ayi yaa muŋ ben amunzumɔr.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesɔ ne tsaŋ ŋguŋgu lu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22" />Iber nuŋ yime Yesɔ ne di, abɛ tsene maa, &lt;&lt;Nyɛ zhin tabǝ glɔ te kɔmɔ ne goŋ nek yuŋ.&gt;&gt; Fe akɔ lu te yir gumɔ te kɔmɔ. <verse eid="LUK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23" />Ayi ne min kɛ tsin ankyak, ina baŋu. Ŋguŋgu goŋ ne te ne nek ŋgɔŋ, Ngugumɔ zin fa amashir ndi te kam ku, amɛ ayi ne min kɛ ya.<verse eid="LUK 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24" />Abɛ zǝu tsin akɔte suu ne na, tedi, &lt;&lt;Ngɔŋ, ngɔŋ, ta te dɔ ne mashir!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:24">Akɔ si, te tsaŋ ŋguŋgu mɔ ben aŋkun amashire; fe ŋguŋgu mɔ kɔ te zee, te zǝkur. <verse eid="LUK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25" />Fe adi abɛ tsǝne maa. &lt;&lt;Itanyɛmɛ mine iyi ne mee?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:25">Ne sisik ne vuŋ anu te di akpa men, &lt;&lt;Ai ŋɔwa? Te atsaŋ ŋguŋgu ben amashir, te awɔ lɛ ma te zǝ kɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesɔ ne na iner ne yi ne shetan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26" />Fe Yesɔ ben abɛ zǝu tsin ne yir ntun yi Garisinawa iyiŋ ndi yi ŋɔk aklu ben ntun yi Galili. <verse eid="LUK 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27" />Ndi Yesɔ ne ru ne gumɔ te yi agankubgbu, ineshir nuŋ ndi ayi ne anerim aru rɛ ntunɔ. Ne baŋ mkpaŋ, bane su iki su ba ne sɔŋ ne kɔb ba, akur ne amkpa ne ru aneshir. <verse eid="LUK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28" />Ndi ne yik Yesɔ, fe aŋur ruru te zhaku ne za maa, alǝk kɔr tedi, &lt;&lt;Yesɔ, uwɔb anii bene abɛm, Izu Arik Ŋgɔŋ? Me benu, duŋ sak me ya ba!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29" />Fe Yesɔ ne tsaŋ anerime te duŋ ba aru ne kpa kɛ neshire. Amkpaŋ tetɛk ina ŋuru tyak zhɔk ne mimi, ana ku aŋyak, ana kluk atsǝtsaŋ zɔb ndi ne kpa aŋɔk amaa shetan na yaru kɔmɔ ne zizik.<verse eid="LUK 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30" />Yesɔ aribu, &lt;&lt;Azho sak mi te ŋɔ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:30">&lt;&lt;Tetɛk,&gt;&gt; Ne diu, anerim abaŋ ndi yi ne kpa maa iyi tetɛk. <verse eid="LUK 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31" />Fe anerim aben Yesɔ tedi, duŋ ta hrie ne amkpa ne naŋ dɔ ba. <verse eid="LUK 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32" />Ne ankpa waŋa a yɔk ane gluk abɛ kɔb ne tiŋ gbu. Ki tuk aben Yesɔ tedi abɛ ta nyɛ bama te duŋ ba yir min mǝne, ne ta nyɛ bama. <verse eid="LUK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33" />Fe anerim akɔ ru ne kpa kɛ neshire te duŋ neshire, te yir min ane gluk abɛ kɔbɔ, fe akɔ zǝǝ akɔmɔ ne nkam amashire te dɔ.<verse eid="LUK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34" />Abɛ yɔk ne gluk abɛ kɔbɔ ayik amɛ, aklu te kɔ te abla lɛ me ne min ntun ben abɛ kɔno sa, <verse eid="LUK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35" />Fe aneshire akɔ ru te yik kiyiŋ ndi ne na. Ndi ne nyɛ ben Yesɔ akɔte yik neshir waŋ ndi anerime ne ruu ne kpa maa, te akɔ sɔŋ ne aza yi Yesɔ&gt; ne suu ki itu ma iyi anenen; fe sisik te ba. <verse eid="LUK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36" />A baŋ ndi kime ne na ne ayi amen akɔ bla aneshir ndi ne yi ne anerim ne rɛ. <verse eid="LUK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37" />Ankyak aneshir abɛ ntun bɔbɔk abɛ Garisinawa aben Yesɔ te bɛ duŋ ba, te sisik ne vuŋ ba ŋgɔŋ. Fe Yesɔ akɔ yir igu te kɔmɔ. <verse eid="LUK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38" />Iner waŋ ndi anerim ne ru ne kpa maa, abenu tedi abɛ duŋ wa zeu, fe Yesɔ ne duŋɔ kɔmɔ, adi, <verse eid="LUK 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39" />&lt;&lt;kɔmɔ ne kɔb, te bla aneshir iki goŋgɔŋ yiŋ ndi Arik ne nau ane yi.&gt;&gt; Ankyak neshire a kɔ kɔmɔ ne tuntun te zen bla ki ngɔngɔŋ yiŋ di Yesɔ ne naa wa ne yi.<verse eid="LUK 8:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesɔ ne lɛk va Yarus ndi ne ku ben iwa ne zi azhizhi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40" />Fe ndi Yesɔ ne ŋur kam, ntsan aneshir ne tau. Ne men azǝn ŋub nyɛ ma. <verse eid="LUK 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41" />Fe ineshir nuŋ a zhɔ sak maa te Yarus ngɔŋ ne akaba, ne nyɛ zhaku ne ti kɛ Yesɔ, te benu abɛ gar kɔmaa. <verse eid="LUK 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42" />Ayi ne vǝvǝn wa zhin ankyak, ne ase wur aneya, ne dǝk watsɔb te bɛ ku. Ndi Yesɔ ayi ne min kɛ tsǝn, aneshir tetɛk a mɔu, <verse eid="LUK 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43" />Fe, iwanuŋ waŋ ndi azǝ azhizhi a se wur ane yaa, waŋ ndi ne ŋun azɔb ama bɔbɔk ne kpa ne ta kǝka, ba ne rɛ ba. <verse eid="LUK 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44" />Ne kama zǝ gɔŋ kɛ Yesɔ te sak ŋɔk ma ne anklu maa, ne amkpama izi azhizhi me ku gbur kli. <verse eid="LUK 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45" />Fe Yesɔ adi, &lt;&lt;Ai ŋɔwa a sak me ŋɔk?&gt;&gt; Ndi aneshir aturu, Biturus ben abaŋ ndi ayi bene bau adi, &lt;&lt;Ŋgon, a aneshir ne te du te zin turu tena mɔu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46" />Ama Yesɔ a di; &lt;&lt;Ne sak me ŋɔk, me wɔ mgbyamgbyaŋ muŋ ne ru ne kpa muŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47" />Ndi iwa ma ne yik ba tei ya su yir ba, fe a tib nyɛ te zin iri kpa, a ja ku ne ti ma, te bla ne ti kɛ aneshir ki yiŋ ndi ne duŋ wa ne sagu ŋɔk, bǝn yir kɛŋ ndi wa ne re ne kpama. <verse eid="LUK 8:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48" />Fe a diu te di; &lt;&lt;Va muŋ, tanyɛmɛ ne susun mi ne duŋu rɛ lu kɔmɔ keke.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49" />Ayi ne min kɛ lɛ fe neshir nuŋ are kɔb kɛ ngɔŋ ne akaba, te di; &lt;&lt;Ai Va mi ne ku, duŋ na sak ine tsar ya ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50" />Ndi Yesɔ ne wɔ me, adi ŋgɔŋ ne akaba, &lt;&lt;Duŋ te sisik ba; ubɛ tanyɛmɛ ne susun mi ankyak, Va mi atei rɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51" />Ndi ne yir kɔb kɛ Jarus ba ne ta nyɛmɛ te nuŋ abɛ zu ayir kime ba, anaga yi Biturus bǝn Yɔɔna, ben Yakubu, ben tetɛɛ maa Vǝvǝn iwa ma bǝn iya maa kyak. <verse eid="LUK 8:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52" />Azǝn zhin tɛ tǝ ruru ne atu ayi Vǝvǝnwa ma, akyak Yesɔ adi. &lt;&lt;Kuu zhin anu,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;bane ku ba, a kukurna.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53" />Fe amlagu te ne zhi ne kaku. <verse eid="LUK 8:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54" />Ankyak avuŋ ŋɔk kɛ Vǝvǝn iwa ma, te lɛk kɔr tedi, &lt;&lt;Vǝvǝnwa lu&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55" />Ivli maa ŋur kam nyak, ne kpa maa a lu sɔŋ. Fe adi abɛ nugu kili <verse eid="LUK 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56" />Aner amaa akɔ sak ŋɔk nenu, fe Yesɔ akɔ gbaŋ ba atɔŋ te di kǝr abɛ duŋ bla nuŋ ki yiŋ ndi ne nai ba.<verse eid="LUK 8:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9" />
  <para style="s">Yesɔ ne shar awur ane yaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1" />Ndi Yesɔ ne zhɔ awur ane yaa, ne nek ba mgbyamgbyaŋ ben klik te abɛ Gli anerim arumɔ te na abɛ lɔ tǝ bɛ rɛ, <verse eid="LUK 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2" />te shar ba abɛ kɔte du lɛ kɛ kɔb Arik tena duŋ abɛ lɔ abɛ rɛ. <verse eid="LUK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3" />Ne bla ba kǝr abɛ baŋ ikinuŋ agli ba ne tsin mǝne, kǝr abɛ baŋ mkpɔki ba, bǝn abubu ba, kǝr abɛ na Gli ikili ben azɔb ba, kǝr abɛ na Gli anklu anuŋ ba. <verse eid="LUK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4" />Ikɔb keŋ ndi izhin te yir kɛ, izhin bɛ sɔŋɔ ne kǝ gar mkpaŋ keŋ ndi izhin te duŋ ntuno. <verse eid="LUK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5" />Fe aneshir abɛ ntuno bate ta zhin ba, izhin bɛ klu gbumgbuk ye aza min shur ba te duŋ ntuno, bɛ yi ngir ndi izhin ne yir kɔbɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6" />Ne me ne vuŋ tsǝn te yir ntuntun, te bla lɛ didik kǝ men te na duŋ abɛ lɔ arɛ.<verse eid="LUK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7" />Ankyak itum ndi azhɔu te Hiridus ne wɔ kiki yiŋ ndi awur na yaa abaŋa anai. Susun maa ne cɔkla, ndi ne blau te di ne lik Yɔɔna gli rumɔ ne bɛ, <verse eid="LUK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8" />Anuŋ adi ayi Iliya wa ne munoru, anuŋ adi ayi cice nuŋ ine bla shar yi Arik ne lu tsitsir. <verse eid="LUK 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9" />Ankyak Hiridus adi, &lt;&lt;Mne kyaŋ tu kɛ Yɔɔna. Tei ŋɔwa, waŋ ndi mwɔ kiki yiŋɛ ne tɔ amaa?&gt;&gt; Ne te te wa abɛ yigu.<verse eid="LUK 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesɔ ne nek aneshir azhin tuŋ kili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10" />Ndi abɛ zǝ Yesɔ tsin amɛ wur ane yaa baŋa ne kama nyak. Ne bla Yesɔ kiyiŋ ndi ne na. Ankyak ne Gli ba te kɔmɔ ne Batseda, <verse eid="LUK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11" />Fe aneshir tetɛk ne wɔ te zeu. Ne ta ba te lɛ bene ba ne lɛ kɛ kɔb Arik. Te duŋ abɛ lɔ are.<verse eid="LUK 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12" />Ndi kab arik ne te, awur ane yaa ne nyɛ diu, &lt;&lt;Duŋ aneshir abaŋa abɛ kɔmɔ ne ntuntun te kɔ te wɔb ikili ben kpǝmkpa yi kur, te amkpa ne kur ben ikili ba yime yaŋa ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13" />Yesɔ adi ba, &lt;&lt;Izhin bɛ nek ba kinuŋ atali.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:13">A sagu ma tedi, &lt;&lt;Tayi ne mbwab durgba me tuŋ ankyak ben ambɛ amɛ yaa, fena ta bǝ yir min ntun te lɛb ntsan aneshire abaŋa ikili.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14" />(Alulum neyi azhin atuŋ ne amkpama.)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:14">Ankyak Yesɔ adi abɛ tsene maa, &lt;&lt;Duŋ zhine ba azesɔŋ ntentek aner sɔk tutuŋ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15" />Abɛ zeu na ndumo akɔ na kiyiŋ ndi ne diba, ankyak kɔte ŋɔwa a zǝ sɔŋ. <verse eid="LUK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16" />Fe Yesɔ abaŋ mbwab durgba ime tuŋ tena baŋ ambɛ amɛ yaa te tɔ shu te ben Arik te mlige. Te nek abɛ tsene maa bɛ ta gab aneshire. <verse eid="LUK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17" />Bɔbɔk aneshir ne li te hrii, ankyak abɛ zǝ Yesɔ na ndum ne vu ikili ndi ne dǝk ashak sisa mee wur ane yaa.<verse eid="LUK 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Biturus ne ta Yesɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18" />Ndi Yesɔ ne su yir te zen ben Arik te abɛ tsene maa ne nyɛ bene bɔu, a rib ba te di, &lt;&lt;Aneshir adi Me yi ŋɔwa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19" />Asaga, &lt;&lt;Anuŋ adi uyi Yɔɔna ne su aneshir, anuŋ adi uyi Iliya, anuŋ ana di uyi ne bla shar ye Arik ne kukub ndi ne ku aru.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20" />&lt;&lt;Fe izhineba fa?&gt;&gt; A rib ba. &lt;&lt;Izhin di nga Me yi ŋɔwa?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:20">Biturus adi, &lt;&lt;Kristi ne rɛ ben Arik&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21" />Yesɔ ne gbaŋ ba atɔŋ te di kǝr abɛ bla nuŋ lɛ kǝŋe ba. <verse eid="LUK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22" />Ankyak adi, &lt;&lt;Izu Neshir atei yik iya tetɛk bǝn angɔŋgɔŋ aneshir atei na kyagu, ngɔŋ ne abɛ na ndum kǝ Arik bene abɛ tsar lɛ kɛ Arik atei na kyagu te na ŋunu ama atei lu tsitsir ne bɛr yi ntar.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23" />Fe adi ba bɔbɔk mǝne: &lt;&lt;Waŋ ndi ate zǝm, abɛ kyak tu maa tena baŋ mkpɔk nkunkun kǝ gen maa te zǝm kɔte bɛr tayi. <verse eid="LUK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24" />Neme waŋ ndi ba te kyak ivli maa ba atei suk kɛ, waŋ ndi ate kyak susun maa atei yik kɛ. <verse eid="LUK 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25" />Ayi ki didik iye ni te neshir abɛ yik kiki yi gɔnmimi bɔbɔk te suk susun maa? <verse eid="LUK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26" />Waŋ ndi te te shisha muŋ bǝn ilɛ muŋ, Izu Neshir atei na te shisha maa ndi ate nyɛ ne ngɔŋ maa bǝn ngɔŋ kɛ Tetɛɛ maa bǝn abɛ shar ayou Arik bɛ yi tsetser. <verse eid="LUK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27" />Mbla zhin lɛ didik, anuŋ ndi ake klɛ yaŋa batei yik ku teshe yik Ŋgɔŋ kɛ kɔb Arik ba.<verse eid="LUK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isen kpa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28" />Ndi bɛr tender ne gayir ndi Yesɔ ne bla kiyiŋɛ, Ne Gli Biturus, Yɔɔna ben Yakubu te gar tu gbu te kɔmɔ ben Arik. <verse eid="LUK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29" />Ndi ne zen bene Arik, iti maa ne kam sen, nklunklu maa ne kam te klikla ndi laŋ lu kɛ baŋ ayi. <verse eid="LUK 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30" />Aneshir aya, Musa ben Iliya, <verse eid="LUK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31" />aru klɛ ne ngɔŋ men, te lɛ ben Yesɔ. Alɛ lɛ kɛ lu maa tɛ kɔmɔ nǝ gbarshu ndi sɔŋ ye shaga ne Urshelima. <verse eid="LUK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32" />Biturus bene akpa amaa, ina ne vuŋ ba ngɔŋ fe ndi ne kama si, ne yik ngɔŋ kɛ Yesɔ ben aner ayaa aklɛ klɛ bene bɔu. <verse eid="LUK 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33" />Ndi anere aduŋ Yesɔ, Biturus a diu, &lt;&lt;Ngɔŋ, ne rɛ ndi ta yi ayaŋa, duŋ ta na abur amɛ tar izhin bɛ yi mi, izhin bɛ yi kɛ Musa, izhin bɛ na yi kɛ Iliya.&gt;&gt; Bane zhi kiyiŋ ndi ablai ba.<verse eid="LUK 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34" />Ndi azǝn lɛ, akpa ne nyɛ ku ba, fe ate sisik ndi ne yir akpa ma. <verse eid="LUK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35" />Ikɔr ne rurɛ amkpama, te di, &lt;&lt;Waŋa ayi Zumuŋ, waŋ ndi Mne hriau; wɔ zhin ne wu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36" />Ndi ikɔro ne lɛ, ayik Yesɔ akɛkli kiki maa. Abɛ zǝ Yesɔ na ndum ne Gli ki yiŋɛ ne susun amen, bane bla nuŋ kiyiŋ ndi aba ne yige ba.<verse eid="LUK 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesɔ ne na Vǝvǝn waŋ di Kituk ne yiru.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37" />Ndi bɛr ne ŋan, fe ne zi are gbu, ntsan aneshir ne nyɛ bene bɔu. <verse eid="LUK 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38" />Neshir nuŋ ne miŋ mǝne aru te zhɔ, &lt;&lt;Nǝ Tsar, me benu teu bǝ tɔ zumuŋ, iwa anaga yi zumuŋ ankyak. <verse eid="LUK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39" />Izhu mimin ne yiru te duŋu ate ahwa te tuk azhaku ne mimi te tsik kpaakpa te ru ante nenu. Ba duŋu ba aŋɔk kpa maa shur amkpaa. <verse eid="LUK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40" />Mne mben abɛ tsene maa abɛ nau tǝ nɛ nau alakakana.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41" />Yesɔ adi, &lt;&lt;Izhineba kab kɛ yaŋ tanyɛmɛ ne susun amin,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Amkpaŋa aben mne sɔŋ bene bɛ zhin tena vuŋ susun bene abɛ zhin? Gli Vǝvǝne mi nyɛmɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42" />Ne me ndi Vǝvǝn ne sɔŋɔ nyɛ, anerime abaŋu tyak zhɔk ne mimi te duŋɔ tsik kpaakpa. Ankyak Yesɔ atsaŋ izhu mimiŋe te duŋǝ ru ne kpa kɛ vǝvǝne, fe vǝvǝne are Yesɔ avuŋ anu nek tetɛɛ maa. <verse eid="LUK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43" />Ankyak aneshir bɔbɔk asak aŋɔk nenu ne iki ngɔŋ ndi Arik ne nai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:43">Ndi kɔte ŋɔwa ne sak aŋɔk nenu ne kin yiŋ ndi Yesɔ ne nai, ne di abɛ tsene maa, <verse eid="LUK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44" />&lt;&lt;Shur zhin atɔŋ amin te wɔ zhin kiyiŋ ndi M tei bla zhin. atei vuŋ Izu Neshir asak ne aŋɔk aneshir.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45" />Ne me bane zhi kiyiŋ ndi ablai ba. Ne sui ayir bama, te duŋ ba kǝr abɛ gli ba, ne te sisik rib Yesɔ ilɛmɛ.<verse eid="LUK 9:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ŋɔwa atei yi ŋgɔŋɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46" />Abɛ zǝ Yesɔ nadum ne te antam ne kpa men te ŋɔwa atei yi ngɔŋ ne min mǝne. <verse eid="LUK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47" />Yesɔ, ne zhi lɛ kɛ susuno mǝne, abaŋ vǝvǝn vǝtsɔb te duŋɔ klɛ ne kɔnsa maa. <verse eid="LUK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48" />Fe adi ba, &lt;&lt;Waŋ di ne ta vǝvǝn vǝtsɔb waŋa ne sak muŋ ne tam, waŋ di ne tam ne ta waŋ ndi ne shar me, waŋ ndi wa ayi vǝtsɔb ne miŋ mine wa atei yi ngɔŋ ne miŋ min.<verse eid="LUK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49" />Yɔɔna adi &lt;&lt;Ŋgɔŋ, tane yik ner nuŋ agli anerim gli rumɔ ne sak mi fe tane te te bǝ yaru ma, te ba yi ne min mɔr ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50" />Yesɔ adi, &lt;&lt;Kǝr yar zhin ne wu ba,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Waŋ ndi ba kyak zhin ba, ayi amɔr.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:50" /></para>
  <para style="s">Samariyawa ne kyak Yesɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51" />Ndi mkpaŋ ne te kɛ baŋ Yesɔ te kɔmɔ ne shu, Yesɔ ne ta nyɛmɛ te wa atei gar Urshelima. <verse eid="LUK 9:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52" />Ne shar abɛ bla shar abɛ kuti, ndi ne gar te yir ntun yi Samariya te bɛ na kiki anyagu; <verse eid="LUK 9:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53" />ankyak aneshire abɛ muɔ bane tau ba, ndi a sɔŋɔ kɔmɔ ne Urshelima. <verse eid="LUK 9:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54" />Ndi abɛ tsene maa, Yakubu ben Yɔɔna ne yik amɛ, aribu te di, &lt;&lt;Ŋgɔŋ, une tanyɛmɛ te tabǝ duŋ lu rɛ gbarshu te goŋ bai?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 9:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55" />Ankyak Yesɔ akama tɔ ba te tsaŋ ba, <verse eid="LUK 9:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56" />fe a kɔmɔ ne ntun nuŋ.<verse eid="LUK 9:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iluk yi zǝ Yesɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57" />Ndi ne tsǝnetsin ne ankɔŋ, ner nuŋ adi Yesɔ, &lt;&lt;M tei zeu ŋgar kɔte me ndiu gar.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58" />Yesɔ adiu, &lt;&lt;Wuwuoma ayi ne amkpa ne kur, aŋliŋlɔ abe gbarshu ayi ne anjer, Fe Izu Neshir ba yi ne amkpa ane kur ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59" />Yesɔ adi ner nuŋ, &lt;&lt;Zǝm.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:59">Ankyak nɛrɛ adi, &lt;&lt;Ŋgɔŋ, duŋ me nkɔte ru tetɛɛ muŋ ba liŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60" />Yesɔ adiu, &lt;&lt;Duŋ abɛ ku abɛ ru akpa mɛn abɛ ku, fe iwa bɛ kɔte bla lɛ kɛ kɔb Arik.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61" />Ner nuŋ ne na di, &lt;&lt;M tei zeu, Ngɔŋ; bɛ duŋ me kam kɔmɔ ntǝ bla anere bǝ kɔmuŋ baliŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62" />Yesɔ adiu, &lt;&lt;Waŋ ndi te sak ŋɔk ne ŋa ne lɔn te kama tɔ goŋ bane mla ne na ndum ne kɔb Arik ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:62" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10" />
  <para style="s">Yesɔ ne shar aner sɔktamgba ane yaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1" />Ndi ne yeme, Ŋgɔŋ ne hria aner sɔktamgba ane yaa te shar ba aya-yaa te bene kuti te kɔmɔ ne ntun kɔte mee ne ntun ndi atei garǝ. <verse eid="LUK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2" />Abla ba, &lt;&lt;Ndum kɛ sɛr ikili na ahwaŋ iyi tetɛk, abɛ na ndumo ayi watsɔb. Rib Ŋgɔŋ ne ndum kɛ sɛr ikili me, tǝ bɛ tur abɛ na ndum ne ahwaŋa. <verse eid="LUK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3" />Tsǝn zhin! M shar zhin ndi awanta ne min kɛ awuwɔma. <verse eid="LUK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4" />Duŋ baŋ zhin abu ka mgbɔ ka akpaza ba, duŋ tek zhin nuŋ ne ankɔŋ ba.<verse eid="LUK 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5" />Ate yi ndi ijin te yir kɔbɔ, ijin bǝ di, &lt;&lt;Isɔŋ kɛ sik susun ibǝ yi ne kɔb kǝŋe.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6" />Ate yi ndi nuŋ ata nyɛmɛ ne sɔŋ kɛ sik susun amɔ isɔŋ kɛ sik susun tei zǝ ba, bate te ba, itei ŋurkam zǝ zhin. <verse eid="LUK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7" />Sɔŋ zhin amɔ ne kɔbɔ, izhin li tena so ikiyiŋ ndi ne nek zhin, te ine na ndum abɛ nǝgu dǝk maa. Duŋ lu zhin ne kɔb nuŋ te na gar nuŋ ba.<verse eid="LUK 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8" />Izhin te yir ntun te ate ta zhin, li zhin iki yiŋ ndi ne nek zhin. <verse eid="LUK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9" />Izhin bɛ na abɛ lɔ kpa tena bla ba te, &lt;Nyɛ kɔb Arik ne te gbahir bene abɛ zhin.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10" />Fena izhin te yir ntun te ate kyak ta zhin, kɔmɔ zhin ne keŋkɔŋ te di, <verse eid="LUK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11" />&lt;Mgbumgbuk mimi yi ntun min tane klui ne aza mɔr shur zhin: Tǝ izhin bena ta ta ba, kɔb ngɔŋ kɛ Arik ne te gbahir.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12" />Mbla zhin, itei yi ne sik ne bɛr yi Sodɔm naŋ ntun yuŋɔ,<verse eid="LUK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13" />&lt;&lt;Zhin zhɔk atu amin, kɔrasinu! Zhin zhɔk atu amin, Batseda! Tɔ iki iyi vuŋ anu ndi ne nai ne atu amin nena nai ne Taya bǝn Sidon, abɛ duŋ na zumimin ire kukub, asu anklu zhin tena sɔŋ ne ntɔŋ. <verse eid="LUK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14" />Fena ibǝ rɛ ne Taya ben Sidon ne bɛr te ŋas naŋu. <verse eid="LUK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15" />Bǝn wa, Kafanahum, atei baŋu atuk akɔmɔ ne gbarshu? Bai te ba, utei zǝǝ gar min lu. <verse eid="LUK 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16" />&lt;&lt;Iwaŋ ndi ate wɔ zhin ne wɔm; Iwaŋ ndi ate kyak zhin akyak me, fe iwaŋ ndi ate kyak me akyak waŋ ndi ne shar me.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17" />Aner sɔk tangba aneyaa ma ne nyak ne nyer tedi, Ngɔŋ anerim menyi anekta tu ne sak mi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18" />Fe wa adi, &lt;&lt;Myik ne shetan a zhaku are gbarshu ndi laŋ amkpa. <verse eid="LUK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19" />Wɔ zhin, Mne nek zhin mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ caŋ anǝwa bǝn ane laŋ tena naŋ mgbyamgbyaŋ abɛ kyak zhin yi, ikinuŋ batei vuŋ zhin ba. <verse eid="LUK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20" />Ndi amɛ, kɛrzhin bǝ nyer te anerim anek zhin tu ba, izhin bǝ nyɛr tǝ nɛ cɛr asak amin ne gbarshu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21" />Nǝ mkpaŋa Yesɔ, anyer ne Izhu Tsetser tetɛk, adi, &lt;&lt;Mni mgbaru asak, Tetɛɛ, Ŋgɔŋ ne gbarshu bǝn gɔnmimi, te Une yar abɛ bu ayi iki nuŋ ben abɛ yik ti, tena duŋ abaŋ ndi bane zhi kinuŋ ba abɛ zhi. Mtanyɛme tena nye ru Tetɛɛ, te waŋai iyik mi ne tu mɔr.<verse eid="LUK 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22" />&lt;&lt;Ne baŋ ki bɔbɔk asak me ne aŋɔk ire bǝn Tetɛɛ muŋ. Inuŋ bane zhi kai ŋɔwa yi Zumɔ ayi Tetɛɛ wa ankyak. Inuŋ bane na zhi Tetɛɛ me ba, ayi Zumɔ wa ankyak ne zhiu fena abaŋ ndi Izumɔ ne hria ba ne duŋ ba yigu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23" />Fe akam atɔ abɛ tsene maa tedi ne ŋkɔnsa, &lt;&lt;Abɛ ta anu adidik abɛ yi abaŋ ndi ne yik abɛ yik ne yi. <verse eid="LUK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24" />Fe Mbla zhin te abɛ bla shar yi Arik bǝn Atum ne wɔb te aba abɛ yik ama bane yik ba, te bɛ wɔ bane na wɔ ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nkanlɛ iyi ner didik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25" />Iber nuŋ yime iner ngɔŋ nuŋ ne tsar zhi nkenlɛ alu aklɛ tǝ wa abɛ tsar zhi Yesɔ. &lt;&lt;Ine Tsar,&gt;&gt; arib, &lt;&lt;Aye anii M tei na tem ta ivli kɛ yaŋ klɛtu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26" />&lt;&lt;Ayi nii ne cɛrǝ ne cɛr iyi Musa?&gt;&gt;Yesɔ asagu ma, &lt;&lt;Ubla kɛ kikini?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27" />A diu: &lt;&lt;&lt;Nyer Arik Ŋgɔŋ ami ne susun mi ben kpami ben Iklik mi ben izhi mi, te na, &lt;Ta nyɛmɛ ben kpami ndi itu mi.&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28" />&lt;&lt;Une ta nyɛmɛ anenen,&gt;&gt; Yesɔ adiu. &lt;&lt;Na amɛ te utei yi tsitsir.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29" />Ankyak akɔ di wa atei ŋla tu maa, fe akɔ rib Yesɔ, &lt;&lt;Tǝ ayi ŋɔwa ayi kpamuŋɔi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30" />Yesɔ a saga te di: &lt;&lt;Iner nuŋ a azǝ are Urshelima te nyɛ Jerikɔ, ndi ne te zhaku ayir aŋɔk abɛ zhib. Ne kpob iki maa, te tsǝgu te lu kama tibɛ te duŋu ne ku asǝ. <verse eid="LUK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31" />Ine na ndum kǝ Arik ne gar azǝ ankɔŋɔ ne yigu, te gayir azǝ kɔnsa. <verse eid="LUK 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32" />Amɛ, ine na ndum kɛ Arik nuŋ nena yigu tena zǝ kɔnsa gayir. <verse eid="LUK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33" />Ankyak awɔnǝ Samariya nuŋ ne gar azǝ amɔ te yik nɛrɛ akɔkur, te wɔ lɔ susun maa. <verse eid="LUK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34" />Te gar bene bɔu te kpau amkpaa ma, te bwau anyɛ bene amashir mwamwaŋ ne amkpaa ma. Te baŋu asak ne tu tatur te yuŋu te kɔmɔ ne amkpa ane kur amaa te nau. <verse eid="LUK 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35" />Ndi bɛr ne ŋen a baŋ azɔb amɛ yaa anǝk iner ne kɔbɔ. &lt;Tǝ abɛ bene tɔu,&gt; a diu, &lt;Mte nyak, M tei nka yau idǝk mi.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36" />&lt;&lt;Ai ŋɔwa ne min kɛ aner atar abaŋa ayi kpa maa neshir waŋ di abɛ zhib ne tsǝgu mai?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37" />Ine zhi kenlɛ a sagu ma tedi, &lt;&lt;Iwaŋ di ne wɔ lɔ susun nɛrɛ.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 10:37">Yesɔ adiu, &lt;&lt;kɔmɔ te na mee mi yi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesɔ ne kɔb ane Marta ben Meryamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38" />Ndi Yesɔ bǝn abɛ tsene maa agar ivǝ ntun nuŋ ndi azhɔ wa nuŋ te Marta ne ta ba ne kɔmaa. <verse eid="LUK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39" />A yine va men waŋ di a azhɔu te Meryamu, waŋ ndi ne te zǝ sɔŋ te zen wɔ bla yi Yesɔ. <verse eid="LUK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40" />Fena Marta wa azǝne goŋri wɔb acɛn amaa ikili. A gar bǝn Yesɔ te rib, &lt;&lt;Ŋgɔŋ, bau yik va mɔr aduŋ me ngɔŋri kiki muŋ kai? Blau te bɛ lu zok me na ndumo!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41" />&lt;&lt;Marta, Imarta,&gt;&gt; Ŋgɔŋɔ adiu, &lt;&lt;Ulɛ ne tena kɔr susun ne iki tetɛk, <verse eid="LUK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42" />fena ai iki zhin ne dǝk. Meryamu ne hria iki yiŋ ndi iyi didik, batei na baŋǝ a kama tibɛ bene bɔu ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11" />
  <para style="s">Tsar Yesɔ ne tɔ yi ben Arik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1" />Nǝ bɛr nuŋ Yesɔ ne zen ben Arik ne amkpa nuŋ. Ndi ne klɛ, izhin ne abɛ tsene maa adiu, &lt;&lt;Ŋgɔŋ, tsar ta yir keŋ ndi ta te ben, ndi Yɔɔna ne tsar abɛ zeu na ndum.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2" />Yesɔ a di ba, &lt;&lt;Izhin tǝ ben Arik, di zhin te:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">&lt;&lt;&lt;Tetɛɛ, ne gbarshu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">Sak me bǝ yi tsetser,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">Ngɔŋ mi bǝ nyɛ,<verse eid="LUK 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3" />Nek ta kili yi kɔte bɛr tayi.<verse eid="LUK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4" />Zuk ta zhɔk ne zumimin mɔr,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:4">Tǝ taba mɔryi ta zuk izhu iye abaŋ ndi ala ta lɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:4">Kǝr gli ta gar ne amkpa ne ten ta ka.&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5" />Fe Yesɔ adi abǝ zǝu tsin amaa, &lt;&lt;Abɛ di nuŋ ne miŋ min ayi ne kpa maa, te gar bǝn bɔu ne tsutsu bu te diu, &lt;Ikpa muŋ, kɔb me ambwab borodi mei tar, <verse eid="LUK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6" />te kpamuŋ ŋɔ ne rɛ tsin te nyɛ bene bɛm, bam yi ne kili yi nǝgu ba.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7" />&lt;&lt;Ankyak ine kur ne min kime adi, &lt;Duŋ dam me ba, ne ka ku ankɔŋɔ, nga bene amumune muŋ tane ka zukur. Bam tei na lu te nǝgu kinuŋ ba.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8" />Mbla zhin, te ba tei na lu te nǝgu drugba ba ndi ayi kpa ma, ndi nǝ nǝk tu maa yaŋ te shisha atei nǝgu kiyiŋ ndi awɔbǝ.<verse eid="LUK 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9" />&lt;&lt;Fe mdi zhin: Rib atei nǝgu wɔb utei yik, ŋur ankɔŋ atei buu. <verse eid="LUK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10" />Waŋ ndi arib anegu, waŋ ndi awɔb ayik, waŋ ndi a ŋur ankɔŋ abuu.<verse eid="LUK 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11" />&lt;&lt;Jineba atetɛ, ŋɔwa ne miŋ min izu maa atei benu ambɛ fe atei kama baŋ iwa nǝgu? <verse eid="LUK 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12" />kɔ atei rib mkpaŋ kukɔ atei baŋ Ilaŋ anegu? <verse eid="LUK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13" />Fe atei izhineba, abaŋ ndi zhin yi aner bɛ yi ne susuno mimin, izhin nek amumune min kiki didik, fe amɛ tetɛɛ min ne gbarshu atei nek abaŋ ndi aribu izhu Tsetser!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesɔ ben ŋgon anerim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14" />Ndi Yesɔ ne Gli anerim ru ne kpa kɛ ner ne yaŋ lɛ, ndi anerime ne ru inere ne kpa maa, abu anu te lɛ, fe aneshir sak aŋɔk ne ne. <verse eid="LUK 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15" />Ankyak aneshire nuŋ adi, &lt;&lt;Yesɔ ne gli anerim aglɛ rumɔ ne mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ itum ane anerim.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16" />Anuŋ ne ten Yesɔ te wɔb te abɛ tsar ba ngir kǝ ire gbarshu.<verse eid="LUK 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17" />Yesɔ ne zhi lɛ kɛ susun mǝne te di ba: &lt;&lt;Ntun yiŋ di gab kpa maa itei zhaku, kɔb keŋ ndi nena gab kpa maa itei na zǝr. <verse eid="LUK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18" />Shetan ate gab tu maa, te kɔmaa itei kli kikin? Mdi amɛ te zhin di mne gli anerim rumɔ ne mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ ngɔŋ anerim. <verse eid="LUK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19" />Te yi ndi me gli anerim rumɔ ne mgbyamgbyaŋ kǝ ngɔŋ anerim, abɛ zǝ zhin agli ba rumɔ ne nii? Fena, atei yi abɛ tei zhin ambuk. <verse eid="LUK 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20" />Te yi ndi mgli anerim rumɔ ne mgbyamgbyaŋ kǝ Arik, fe ikɔb kǝ Arik neka nyɛ ben abɛ zhin.<verse eid="LUK 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21" />Te yi ndi ner ne klik, ne ble kɔmaa bleble didik, ba nuŋ atei zhib ki maa ba iki maa itei yi keke. <verse eid="LUK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22" />Ankyak te yi ndi nuŋ ne klik nuŋ anaŋu atei yaru, atei vu ateta maa ayiŋ ndi ne nyagǝ te gabɛ bǝn anuŋ.<verse eid="LUK 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23" />&lt;&lt;Waŋ ndi ba yi bene bɛm ba akyak me, waŋ ndi ba abiŋ bene bɛm ba, avarǝ.<verse eid="LUK 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24" />Te yi ndi izhu mimin te ru ne kpa kɛ neshir, iwɔb amkpa waŋ ndi ayi zizik te bɛ kur asik te bane yigǝ ba. Ankyak adi, &lt;M tei kam kɔmɔ ne kɔb keŋ ndi mne ru remɛ.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25" />Ndi ne yir, te yik kɔbɔ ne kun kɛ te na kɛ aŋyak anenen. <verse eid="LUK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26" />Fe itei gar baŋ izhu mimin amɛ taŋgba anuŋ ndi na zumimin anaŋu, fe akɔte yire zǝ sɔŋ ne mine. Fe ikpa kɛ neshire lɔu ŋgon naŋ ye kuti me.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27" />Ndi Yesɔ azǝn bla kiki yiŋɛ, iwa nuŋ ne min kɛ aneshir azho, &lt;&lt;Anu adidik ayi ne tu kɛ iyah waŋ ndi ne ŋliu tena yɔgu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28" />Asaga, &lt;&lt;Anu adidik ne naŋ abaŋ ndi ne wɔ lɛ kɛ Arik te Gli kɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngir kɛ Yonana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29" />Ndi aneshir ne kli tetɛk, Yesɔ adi, &lt;&lt;Waŋ ayi kab aneshire mimin. Awɔb ngir amɛ batei tsar ba kinuŋ ba, nak ngir kɛ Yunana. <verse eid="LUK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30" />Ndi Yunana ne yi ngir bǝn anere bǝ Neneba, ne me Izu neshir atei yi ngir ne kab aneshire. <verse eid="LUK 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31" />Itum amba ne rɛ gar kǝ amgbalu atei lu te te ŋas bene aner abɛ kab kǝŋe tena nek ba shisha; ndi are klɛtu yi gɔnmimi te bɛ wɔ mgbemgbeb kɛ Solɔmɔn, fe nuŋ ndi anaŋ Solɔmɔn aye yaŋa. <verse eid="LUK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32" />Aner bɛ Neneba atei lu kli ne bɛr yi te ambuk ne kab kɛ aneshir te nek ba shisha; ndi ne duŋ lalɛ ne du lɛ kɛ Yunana ne lɛ kɛ Arik amɛ inuŋ ndi anaŋ Yunana ne nyɛ.<verse eid="LUK 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ilaŋ yi kpa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33" />&lt;&lt;Inuŋ ba tei mɔr lu kǝ pitila te baŋ kɛ suyir ne amkpadeb waŋ ndi ba tei yik laŋ ma ba. kɔ abɛ nyak kɛ ne angus adǝdak, ne me atei mɔr kɛ sak ne shu te aneshir bɛ yik laŋ lumɔ. <verse eid="LUK 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34" />Iyi mi iyi pitila ne laŋ yi kpa mi. Te yi ndi ayemi ayi kyekye, kpami bɔbɔk tei nek laŋ lu. Te yi ndi ba yi kyekye ba, ikpa mi itei te bu. <verse eid="LUK 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35" />Na tɔ iyi amɛ, ilaŋ lu ndi yi bene bɔu ba yi bu ba. <verse eid="LUK 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36" />Ne me, ta yi ndi kpa mi nek laŋ lu bɔbɔk, ba ŋa nuŋ kɛ te bu, itei laŋ shaga, ndi laŋ lu kǝ pitila itei laŋ ne atɔ mi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesɔ ne vǝ abɛ tsar lɛ kɛ Arik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37" />Ndi Yesɔ ne lɛ klɛ, awɔnǝ Ferisawa nuŋ ne zhɔu li kili: Fe ne gar te kɔte li kili me. <verse eid="LUK 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38" />Ankyak awɔnǝ Ferisawa ma ne sak ŋɔk ne ne ndi ne yik Yesɔ ne li kili iyaŋ ŋla ŋɔk.<verse eid="LUK 11:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39" />Fe Yesɔ adiu, &lt;&lt;Amɛ, zhine ba Ferisawa zhin ŋla goŋ abɛm kɛ agbǝgba bǝn kuca, fe miŋ min izhin sɔ tu tena naa zumimin. <verse eid="LUK 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40" />Jineba bliblik! Ba yi waŋ ndi ne na goŋɔ abɛm wa ne na mine kai? <verse eid="LUK 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41" />Fena, nek abɛ yaŋ ki iki yiŋ ndi yi ne min agbǝgba ma, kɔte nii itei yi zhin tsetser.<verse eid="LUK 11:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42" />&lt;&lt;Zhin zhɔk atu amin izhineba Ferisawa, zhin nek Arik zhin ne min kɛ wur yi kimin, iyi mbumburniŋ bǝn amgbaki bɔbɔk, te kyak na didik bǝn nyer Arik. Zhin bǝ na kiyi azizaŋ bǝn yi kukub.<verse eid="LUK 11:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43" />&lt;&lt;Zhin zhɔk atu amin zhin Ferisawa, zhin nyer sɔŋ ne mben didik ne Akabakɔŋ te na duŋ abɛ tek zhin ne dub.<verse eid="LUK 11:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44" />&lt;&lt;Zhin zhɔk atu amin, izhin yi ndi abɛ ayiŋ ndi aneshir bane yige neyi ba te caŋǝ te gayir.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45" />Izhiin ne abɛ tsar zhi ne nkenlɛ asagu ma, &lt;&lt;Ine Tsar, ndi utǝ di kiyiŋɛ amɛ upwar ta miyi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46" />Yesɔ adi, &lt;&lt;zhin abɛ tsar cɛr yi Musa, Zhin zhɔk atu amin, zhin nek aneshir hru kɛ luk ngɔŋ ndi batei baŋ kɛ yir ba, fe zhine ba minyi ba zhin tei lɛk vǝn ŋɔk zok bama ba.<verse eid="LUK 11:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47" />&lt;&lt;Zhin zhɔk atu amin, te zhin mee abɛ ayi abɛ bla shar yi Arik, ndi atsintsim amin aba ne ŋlɔk ba. <verse eid="LUK 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48" />Izhin ne yik ne yi amin te tanyɛmɛ te atsintsim amin aba ne ŋlɔk abɛ bla shar yi Arik izhineba ne mee abɛ mǝne. <verse eid="LUK 11:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49" />Ndi iyeme, Arik ne mgbemgbeb ma ne di, &lt;M tei shar ba abɛ bla shar muŋ bene abɛ na ndum muŋ. atei tsik anuŋ aŋlɔk tena sak anuŋ iya.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50" />Fena ikab kǝŋe aba atei vuŋ ba gli ne tu azhizhi anere abǝ bla shar yi Arik vuŋ rɛ kuti gɔnmimi, <verse eid="LUK 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51" />Vuŋre azhizhi ayou Abila bene azhizhi ayou Zakariya, waŋ ndi ne ŋunu ne amkpa ne tsik baŋ ne Akabakɔŋ. Mm, mbla zhin, ikab kǝŋe atei gli ba ne kiki yiŋɛ bɔbɔk.<verse eid="LUK 11:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52" />&lt;&lt;Zhin zhɔk atu amin izhin bɛ zhi cɛr yi Musa! Ndi izhin ne yak iki bu ankɔŋ ane zhi ki . Izhin bane yir ba, ba zhin nena duŋ anuŋ ayir ba!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53" />Ndi Yesɔ ne ru abɛm, Ferisawa bene abɛ tsar cɛr yi Musa ne ruk abɛm te rib bu lǝlɛ, <verse eid="LUK 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54" />te aba bɛ vuŋu ne nkan lɛ ndi atei blai.<verse eid="LUK 11:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12" />
  <para style="s">Gbaŋatɔŋ ben nek lɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1" />Ne me, ndi ntsan aneshir tetɛk ne tuŋ abiŋ, te zen turo akpa mɛn, Yesɔ ne kuti lɛ bǝn abɛ tsene amaa te di: &lt;&lt;Zhin bɛ hria ayi ne yist kɛ Ferisawa, abaŋ ndi akamagli. <verse eid="LUK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2" />Ba kiyiŋ ndi ne kuyi ndi ba tei bui ba, kɔ ki yiŋ ndi ne sui ayir ndi ba tei yigǝ ba. <verse eid="LUK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3" />Ikiyiŋ ndi izhin blai ne bu atei wɔi aririk, bǝn kiyiŋ ndi zhin lɛ ne tɔŋ ne miŋ ki atei blai ne bɛm.<verse eid="LUK 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4" />&lt;&lt;Mbla zhin akpa amuŋ, kǝr zhin bɛ te sisik abaŋ ndi atei ŋun kpa ankyak batei na kinuŋ ba. <verse eid="LUK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5" />Amɛ M tei ntsar zhin waŋ ndi zhin tei te sisik maa: Tǝ zhin sisik waŋ ndi atei ŋun kpamin ayi ne mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ baŋ zhin tyak zhɔk ne lu. mbla zhin, te zhin sisik maa. <verse eid="LUK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6" />Ba alɛb amuɔcice amɛ atuŋ ne azɔb ayaa kai? Arik bane ŋuro suk ne zhin ba. <verse eid="LUK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7" />Fena, ne zhi kli kɛ mfumfuk tu min. Kǝr zhin bǝ te sisik ba; izhin yi ne shaga ayi naŋ amuɔcice tetɛk.<verse eid="LUK 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8" />&lt;&lt;Mbla zhin, waŋ ndi te tanyɛmɛ bene bɛm ne ti kɛ aneshir, Izu Neshir atei tsar tanyɛmɛ ne atɔ maa ne ti kɛ abɛ shar ayou Arik. <verse eid="LUK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9" />Waŋ ndi te kyak zhim ne min aneshir atei na kyak zhiu ne ti kɛ abɛ shar ayou Arik. <verse eid="LUK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10" />Waŋ ndi ate lǝlɛ mimin ne tu ayi Izu Neshir atei zugu zhɔk, fe waŋ ndi ate tun ne mgbyamgbyaŋ yi Izhu Tsetser ayi Arik ba tei zu gu azhɔk ba.<verse eid="LUK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11" />&lt;&lt;Te yi ndi ne gli zhin anyɛ Akabakɔŋ ne angus ayi angɔŋgɔŋ bene abɛ yi ne mgbyamgbyaŋ, kǝr zhin bǝ lɛ ne susun ndi zhin tei ta akpa min zhɔk ba, ben ki yiŋ ndi zhin tei blai, <verse eid="LUK 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12" />te Izhu Tsetser atei bla zhin kiyiŋ di zhin tei blai.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nkanlɛ yi neshir ndi ayi ne dudunki tena yi bliblik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13" />Nuŋ ne min kɛ aneshir tetɛk adi Yesɔ, &lt;&lt;Ne tsar, bla zumɔr abɛ gab kiyiŋ ndi ayime neyi bene bɛm.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14" />Yesɔ adiu, &lt;&lt;Neshir, ŋɔwa ne hriam te myi ne ŋas kɔ myi ne gab zhin kiyiŋ ndi tetɛɛ mɔr ne ku te duŋ ta neyi?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15" />Fe adi ba, &lt;&lt;Hria zhine ayi! Sɔŋ zhin awa ne tu kiyi tik ayi; ba ai adudunki yi gɔŋmimi tetɛk iyi itei nek neshir vli ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16" />Ankyak abla ba nkanlɛ yiŋɛ: &lt;&lt;Ahwaŋ ayi ner nuŋ ne rɛ kili ŋgɔŋ. <verse eid="LUK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17" />Ne di tu maa, &lt;M tei na kikin? Bam yi ne wun yi nyak kili muŋ ba.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18" />&lt;&lt;Fe adi, &lt;Waŋai kiyiŋ ndi M tei nai. M tei nzir wun muŋ te mee wun ngɔngɔŋ, te nyak kili muŋ ndi yi tetɛk. <verse eid="LUK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19" />Fe M tei ndi tu muŋ, &lt;&lt;U yi ne kiki didik tetɛk ndi tei te ase tetɛk. Sɔŋ sik; te li, te so te zhɔk susun.&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20" />Ankyak Arik adiu, &lt;&lt;Uyi bliblik! Nǝ bu yiŋɛ atei baŋ vli mi. Ne me ŋɔwa atei vu kiki yiŋ ndi une nyak tu mi ne yi?&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21" />&lt;&lt;Waŋai kiyiŋ ndi itei yime ben waŋ di aŋyak tu maa kiki ndi ba yi ne kinuŋ bene Arik ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Duŋ lɛ ne susun ba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22" />Fe Yesɔ ne di abɛ tsene maa: &lt;&lt;Fe na mbla zhin, kǝr zhin bǝ lɛ ne susun amin te di, ta tei li anii; kɔ ne kpa min, tei suu anii. <verse eid="LUK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23" />Ivli inaŋ kili, ikpa naŋ nklunklu. <verse eid="LUK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24" />Tɔ zhin aŋliŋlɔ: ba tib ba ba sɛr ba, ba yi ne wun ba; ne me Arik ayok ba. Amɛ ba zhin shak ayi naŋ aŋliŋlɔ ka! <verse eid="LUK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25" />Ŋɔwa ne miŋ mine ne lɛ susun maa atei nek tu maa mkpaŋ zhin? <verse eid="LUK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26" />Te yi ndi ba zhin tei na ki vǝtsɔb yiŋɛ ba, te zhin lɛ susun ne nki kime tǝ ni?<verse eid="LUK 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27" />Tɔ zhin awu ndi aflu. Ba na ndum ba ba tyak aruru ba. Amɛ me mbla zhin, Solɔmɔn ne yi ne adudunki tetɛk yi gonmimi bane duŋ anaŋ awu ayiŋɛ ba. <verse eid="LUK 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28" />Ate yi ndi Arik aduŋ agǝga ayi zizik, ndi ayime aliŋ, amblɛ atuge ashur ne lu, te izhineba abɛ tanyɛmɛ watsɔb, bai su zhin nkluŋklu kai? <verse eid="LUK 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29" />Ne mee, kǝr zhin bǝ nek susun min ne kiyiŋ ndi zhin tei li tena so, kɔka izhin bǝ lɛ ne susun ba. <verse eid="LUK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30" />Ndi abɛ yaŋ zǝ Arik abɛ gɔnmimi aklu agɔŋɔri te wɔb kiyiŋɛ menyi, Tetɛɛ min ne zhi te zhin wɔb kiki yiŋɛ. <verse eid="LUK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31" />Amɛ wɔb zhin kɔb Arik ne liŋ te atei na nek zhin kiki me.<verse eid="LUK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32" />Kǝr zhin bǝ te sisik ba, izhineba amuen awanta, Tetɛɛ min ne shu anyɛr tǝ wa bɛ nek zhin kɔb Arik. <verse eid="LUK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33" />Vu zhin adudunki yi gɔnmimi min lɛb te nek abɛ yaŋǝ, wɔb zhin atɔ min mgbɔ ndi batei rus ba, kiki yi gbarshu ndi batei klei ba, ndi abɛ zhib batei zhibǝ ba kɔ aden batei lii ba. <verse eid="LUK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34" />Amkpa waŋ ndi adudunki yi gɔnmimi mi ayime, amɔ wa susun mi yime.<verse eid="LUK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sɔŋ Shur Ayi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35" />Kpa zhin atiŋ kɛ na ndum te duŋ zhin pitila min bǝ laŋ, <verse eid="LUK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36" />ndi agɛn abaŋ ndi asɔŋ aŋub atukɔ amen te kama nyak ne gyaŋ yi kpa ŋa, fe ndi te nyɛ te kpyaŋ ankɔŋ atei lu andanda te kɔte buu ankɔŋ. <verse eid="LUK 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37" />Anu adidik ayi atu agen abaŋ ndi atukɔ amen te yik ba akɔ sɔŋ ashur ayi. Mbla zhin lɛ didik, atei te duŋ ba zǝ sɔŋ te gab kili. Te kama den asɔŋ ne mben ngɔŋ yi sak kili. <verse eid="LUK 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38" />Anu adidik ayi ne atu abaŋ ndi atukɔ amen te nyɛ yik ba akɔ sɔŋ ashur ayi, kate nyɛ ne tsutsu bu kɔ ne nyɛ ŋan bɛr. <verse eid="LUK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39" />Zhin bɛ zhi kiyiŋɛ: Te yi ndi akiki ne kɔbɔ ate zhi mkpaŋ keŋ ndi abɛ zhib atei nyɛ, ba tei ta nyɛmɛ abɛ nyɛ cɔk ankɔŋ ala te yiru kɔb ba. <verse eid="LUK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40" />Jineba minyi izhin bɛ sɔŋ shur ayi, Izu Neshir atei nyɛ ne nkpaŋ kɛŋ ndi ba zhin ne zhi ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41" />Biturus arib, &lt;&lt;Ŋgɔŋ, U bla taba nkanlɛ yiŋɛ kɔ aneshir bɔbɔk ni?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42" />Ŋgɔŋɔ adi, &lt;&lt;Ayi ŋɔwa ngɔŋ ne na zub te nayi mgbemgbeb, ndi ngɔŋ amaa te nǝgu ngɔŋ ne tɔ agɛn amaa te bɛ ya ba azɔb ayi li kili ne kpaŋ anenen? <verse eid="LUK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43" />Anu adidik ayi ne atu igen waŋ ndi atukɔ amaa te nyɛ te yigu ana amɛ ndi te nyak. <verse eid="LUK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44" />Mbla zhin lɛ didik, atei nǝgu Gli kiki yi gɔŋmimi maa bɔbɔk. <verse eid="LUK 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45" />Ankyak te yi ndi igen waŋa adi tu maa, &lt;Atukɔ amuŋ atei baŋ mkpaŋ lǝlɛ teshe nyak,&gt; Fe akɔ tsik nki agene, alulum bǝn amba, te li te so te hwa. <verse eid="LUK 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46" />Atukɔ ayi igen waŋa atei nyɛ ne bɛr yiŋ ndi bai nkpaŋ kɛŋ ndi bane zhi ba. atei tseu amkpomkpok te baŋu tyak azhɔk ne amkpa waŋ ndi abɛ yaŋ ta Arik ayime.<verse eid="LUK 12:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47" />&lt;&lt;Igen waŋ ndi ne zhi susun kɛ atukɔ amaa te ba ne sɔŋ shurɔ yi ba kɔ ba ne na kiyiŋ ndi atukɔ maa awɔb atei sagu iyah ngɔŋ. <verse eid="LUK 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48" />Te yi ndi waŋ ndi ba ne zhi ba te na kiyiŋ ndi atei nǝgu iyah tena tsǝgu watsɔb. Waŋ ndi te nǝgu tetɛk, atei wɔb tetɛk bene bɔu; waŋ ndi ate nǝgu tetɛk amɛ atei na wɔb tetɛk ben bau.<verse eid="LUK 12:48" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sik susun ba yi ame ba ayi ŋar aneshir</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49" />&lt;&lt;Mne nyɛ zhɔk lu ne gɔnmimi, ne yik muŋ ilumɔ bǝ zen ta! <verse eid="LUK 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50" />Me sɔŋ ŋub isu yi ya ndi itei nyɛm, ndim wɔi ne kpa muŋ te bǝ klɛ! <verse eid="LUK 12:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51" />Izhin yik te di mǝne Gli sik susun nyɛmɛ ne gɔnmimi? Ba yeme ba, mbla zhin, mne nyɛ ŋar aneshir. <verse eid="LUK 12:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52" />Vuŋ rɛ azizaŋa kɔb zhin itei gab te yaa, aneshir atuŋ ne kɔb zhin, amɛ tar bene ayaa, ayaa bene atar. <verse eid="LUK 12:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53" />atei ŋar akpa, Tetɛɛ atei kyak zu maa, izu atei kyak Tetɛɛ maa, iyah atei kyak Va maa, Va atei kyak Iya maa, azhi men atei kyak wa zu maa, iwazu atei kyak azhi men.<verse eid="LUK 12:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Izhi mkpaŋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54" />Yesɔ adi ba: &lt;&lt;Zhin te yik akpa alu akli ne gar kɛ anzaŋ, zhin di alu atei kuh,&gt; Ana kuh. <verse eid="LUK 12:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55" />Zhin tena yik ŋguŋgu te fuk rɛ shin izhin di, &lt;Abɛm atei wu,&gt; Ana wu. <verse eid="LUK 12:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56" />Abɛ kamgli! Izhin zhi tsar kiki yiŋ ndi ite na ne gɔnmimi bǝn gbarshu. Zhin na kikin te ba zhin ya bla ikiyiŋ ndi ite na ne mkpaŋ kɛ azizaŋ kai?<verse eid="LUK 12:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57" />&lt;&lt;Anii duŋ zhin yaŋ bla akpa min ki didik yi na? <verse eid="LUK 12:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58" />Ate yi ndi izhin tsǝn gar amkpa ne ŋas, lɛ bǝn waŋ ndi zhin te antam bene bɔu, kam nyak te tsǝn zhin ankun azhiin, te kǝr abɛ baŋu gli gar bǝn ne te ŋas ka, fe ne te ŋas abaŋ zhin anǝk ngɔŋ ne ku aneshir ate kuu ne jaru. <verse eid="LUK 12:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59" />Mbla zhin, izhin ba tei ru ba, atei duŋ zhin yaa azɔbɔ bɔbɔk neliŋ teshe ru zhin.<verse eid="LUK 12:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13" />
  <para style="s">Duŋ na zumimin kɔ izhin bǝ yik iyah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1" />Amɛ, aner anuŋ ne amkpama ne bla Yesɔ kiyiŋ ndi Bilatus ne duŋ aŋlɔk aner abɛ Galili anuŋ ndi azhizhi amen ne acɔk aglik ne azhizhi ane tsik baŋ. <verse eid="LUK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2" />Yesɔ adi ba, &lt;&lt;Izhin yik te di aner abɛ Galili abaŋa ne na zumimin anaŋ nki aner abɛ Galili me waŋai kiyiŋ ndi ne yik iyah amei? <verse eid="LUK 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3" />Mbla zhin, ba yeme ba! Izhineba min yi, mba zhin te duŋ na zumimin ba, izhin tei ku dɔ. <verse eid="LUK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4" />kɔ izhin tei di aner awur ane tender ndi iki kɛ shu ne zhaku te ŋlɔk ba ne Silɔm, zhin yik te di aner abaŋa nena zumimin anaŋ nki aneshir abaŋ ndi ayi ne Urshelima yi? <verse eid="LUK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5" />Mbla zhin, ba yi amɛ ba! Izhin te kyak duŋ na zumimin, izhin tei ku dɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6" />Fe Yesɔ abla ba nkanlɛ te di: &lt;&lt;Ner nuŋ ane yi ne tiŋ nglǝnglǝ ne ahwaŋa amaa, ankyak ne gar wɔb dɔ maa bane yik kinuŋ ba. <verse eid="LUK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7" />Fe adi ner waŋ ndi ablɛ ahwaŋ ne tiŋ nglǝnglǝ me, &lt;Ase me tar ndi mne nyɛ kye dɔ ŋgliŋgli me, bam yik kinuŋ ba tsɔm tiŋe tyak zhɔk! Aduŋ kɛ klɛ te na anii ne mimi me?&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8" />&lt;&lt;&lt;,Nɛrɛ adi, Ngɔŋ&gt; &lt;Duŋ kɛ bǝ na te ise zhin, M tei nka tiŋe te shur kɛ asu. <verse eid="LUK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9" />Te yi ndi te dɔ ire amɛ! Te yi ndi bate dɔ ba M tei ntsom kɛ ntyak zhɔk.&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesɔ ne na Iwa ne tsib goŋ ne bɛr yi sɔŋ sik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10" />Nǝ bɛr yi sɔŋ sik Yesɔ ne zen tsar ne Akabakɔŋ anuŋ, <verse eid="LUK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11" />iwa nuŋ ndi anerim ne nau azhɔk itsibgoŋ ase awur ane tender. Nǝ baŋ mkpaŋ bane ya lu kli ba. <verse eid="LUK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12" />Ndi Yesɔ ne yigu, azhɔu aŋyak ne ti te diu, &lt;&lt;Iwa, ne tunu ilɔ mi agli tibɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13" />Fe a sagu ŋɔk maa, ne amkpamkpaŋ ma iwama alɔ nab aklɛ te gbar Arik sak.<verse eid="LUK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14" />Ankyak fe ngɔŋ ne Akabakɔŋ akɔ te mfu ndi Yesɔ ne duŋ iwama are ne bɛr yi sɔŋ sik, ngɔŋ ne Akabaŋkɔŋ ŋɔ adi aneshire te di, &lt;&lt;Ber tani yime iyi na ndum. Amɛ izhin nyɛ te duŋ abɛ duŋ zhin rɛ, ba ne bɛr yi sɔŋ sik yiŋɛ ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15" />Fe ngɔŋ adiu, &lt;&lt;Izhin abɛ kamgli! Ba zhin zuk alandɔŋ kɔ tatur amin ne amkpa ne kur amen ne bɛr yi sɔŋ sik te gli ba te gar nek ba amashir ata so kai? <verse eid="LUK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16" />Ne me iwa waŋa ndi ayi nga ŋli ikɛ Ibrai, shetan ne kpau nyak ase wur ane tender, ba tei rɛ ndi abɛ zu gu azhɔk ne bɛr yi sɔŋ sik kai?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17" />Ndi ne di amɛ, abɛ kyagu yi ishisha ku vuŋ ba, ankyak aneshir ne nyɛr tetɛk ne ki yiŋ ndi Yesɔ ne nai.<verse eid="LUK 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nkanlɛ netu ayi mgbyaŋ ŋklik ben mumuŋ atuntu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18" />Fe Yesɔ arib, &lt;&lt;Ikɔb Arik yi kikin? M tei tsar kɛ ne ni? <verse eid="LUK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19" />Iyi ndi bǝbǝ nklik, ndi neshir ne baŋǝ ayi ne ahwaŋ ama. Nǝ tɔ te tiŋ nkunkun, fe aŋliŋlɔ ne rɛ shu te shɔr anjer ne ngǝŋga ma.<verse eid="LUK 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20" />Fe ana rib ba, M tei ntsar ikɔb Arik ne anii? <verse eid="LUK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21" />Iyi ndi mumuŋ atuntu yiŋ ndi uwa nuŋ ane shur ne mumuŋ alikama te duŋǝ ne saŋ shak agbǝgba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ankɔŋ avetsɔb</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22" />Fe Yesɔ ne yir ntuntun ngɔngɔŋ ben mɔtsɔtsɔb, te zin tsar te bene vuŋ ankɔŋ ane gar Urshelima. <verse eid="LUK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23" />Ankyak ner nuŋ aribu te di, &lt;&lt;Ŋgɔŋ, atei ta aner watsɔb ankyak azhɔk yi?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 13:23">Yesɔ adi ba, <verse eid="LUK 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24" />&lt;&lt;Zhin bɛ nak tsǝ kli te zǝ zhin ankɔŋ avetsɔb, mbla zhin, aner tetɛk atɛi te tɛ aba abɛ zǝ ankɔŋ awaŋa ayir ate lak akɛne. <verse eid="LUK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25" />Ankyak ndi ner ne kɔbɔ te lu te ku ankɔŋɔ, izhin tei kli ne abɛm te kpyaŋu te ben te di, &lt;Ngɔŋ, bu ta ankɔŋɔ.&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 13:25">&lt;&lt;Akyak atei di, &lt;Zhin rɛ me? Bam ne zhi zhin ba.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26" />Fe izhin tei di, &lt;Ta ne li te so bene bɔu, une na tsar ne nkuŋkɔŋ mɔr.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27" />&lt;&lt;Ankyak atei di ba, &lt;Bam ne zhi zhin ba, bam ne na zhi amkpa waŋ di zhin rɛ me ba. Kam deme zhin ne ti muŋ, bɔbɔk min abɛ na ki mimin!&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28" />&lt;&lt;Zhin tei zhin te fa aŋin ndi izhin te yik Ibrai, Ishaku ben Yakubu ben bɔbɔk abɛ bla shar yi Arik ne kɔb Arik, ankyak atei yar zhin ashur ne bɛm. <verse eid="LUK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29" />Aneshir atei rǝ ti kǝ anzaŋ ben amgbalu, atushu ben ishin, atei zǝ asɔŋ ne mben men ne gyaŋ yi kɔb Arik. <verse eid="LUK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30" />Fena anuŋ abɛ ku goŋ atei zǝ ti, anuŋ abɛ ku ti atei zǝ goŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesɔ ne lɔ susun ne tu Urushelima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31" />Nǝ mkpaŋ yuŋɔ Ferisawa nuŋ ane nyɛ ben Yesɔ te diu, &lt;&lt;Lu duŋ ayaŋa te na kɔmɔ ne amkpa nuŋ. Hiridus azǝnǝ wɔb bu ne fǝr ŋun.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32" />Yesɔ adi ba, &lt;&lt;Tsǝn gar bla zhin wuwuoma, &lt;M tei nak gli anerim gli rumɔ te na nduŋ aneshir are aliŋ ben amblɛ, ne bɛr yi ntar me ntei aklɛ ndum muŋ. <verse eid="LUK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33" />ka abɛ di anii, M tei nak kɔmɔ ne ti aliŋ bǝn amblɛ bǝn bɛr ŋan ndi ner ine bla shar yi Arik bai nku ne abɛm Urshelima ba!<verse eid="LUK 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34" />&lt;&lt;Uu Urshelima, Urshelima, zhineba ŋlɔk abɛ bla shar yi Arik te tyak abaŋ ndi ne shar ba bǝn abɛ zhin ne mkpaŋ, mǝne mbaŋ mkpaŋ ndi M tei biŋ amumun amin amkpa zhin, ndi kukɔ abiŋ mumuen ma te alab ba aku ne amgba maa, izhin ne nak kyak! <verse eid="LUK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35" />Nak tɔ zhin, izhin ne duŋ akabakɔŋ amin ne te janjak. Mbla zhin, ba zhin tei na yik me ba se mkpaŋ ndi izhin te di iwaŋ ndi anyɛ ne sak kɛ Arik ne negu anu adidik.&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14" />
  <para style="s">Yesɔ ne yir kɔb Bafarisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1" />Ne bɛr yi Sɔŋ sik, Yesɔ ne gar li kili ne kɔb kɛ ngɔŋ nuŋ ndi awɔnǝ Ferisawa; aneshir ne suu Yesɔ ayi. <verse eid="LUK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2" />Ne muɔ ner nuŋ ne lɔ iwu mbwak ne nyɛ kliu ne ti. <verse eid="LUK 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3" />Yesɔ ne rib ane Ferisawa ma bǝn abɛ tsar cɛr yi Musa te di, &lt;&lt;Ire te bɛ na ner ne lɔ ne bɛr yi sɔŋ sik ka abɛ duŋ ini?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4" />Ba ne bu anu ba. Fe Yesɔ avuŋ nɛrɛ te duŋɔ are te diu abɛ kɔmɔ.<verse eid="LUK 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5" />Fe Yesɔ arib ba, &lt;&lt;Iŋɔwa ne miŋ mine te vǝvǝne amaa kɔ vǝn wuwu maa te zhaku ne dudu kɛ amashir ne bɛr yi Sɔŋ sik te ba tei yir te baŋu agli rumɔ kai?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6" />Ankyak bane di kinuŋ ba.<verse eid="LUK 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7" />Ndi ne yik acɛn ahria mben didik ne abɛm, fe abla ba nkanlɛ: <verse eid="LUK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8" />Ate yi ndi nuŋ ate zhɔ zhin igyaŋ yi kpa ŋa, kǝr zhin bɛ nen abɛ yi sɔŋ didik ba, inuŋ waŋ ndi ne zhɔu ndi ayi ŋgɔŋ anaŋu te nyɛ. <verse eid="LUK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9" />Ner ne gyaŋa atei diu &lt;&lt;Lu te nek waŋa mben mi.&gt;&gt; Fe utei lu ne miŋ kɛ shisha te nǝgu mbene te kam wɔb abɛ avetsɔb zisɔŋɔ. <verse eid="LUK 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10" />Ne me ate yiŋ ndi te zhɔu igyaŋ utǝ gar ubǝ zisɔŋ ne mben yiŋ ndi ba yi didik ngɔŋ ba, fǝ ner ne gyaŋa te nyɛ, atei diu ikpa muŋ lu kam zisɔŋ ne mben didik yiŋɛ. &lt;&lt;Amɛ aneshir abɛ gyaŋa atei nǝgu ŋgɔŋ mi. <verse eid="LUK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11" />Ne me ner waŋ ndi aliktu maa ne shu atei gliu aŋyak mimi, iwaŋ ndi azǝ itu maa azhɔk ne mimi Arik atei lɛgu akɔmɔ ne shu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12" />Fe Yesɔ adi nɛrɛ, &lt;&lt;Ate yi ndi utei zhɔ aneshir li kili yi aririk kɔ iyi amgbalu, kǝr bǝ zhɔ akpa mi ankyak ba, kɔ amun zumin, kɔ amun va min kɔ aner abɛ rɛ nga min ankyak kɔ apkaami abɛ yine ki yi ŋɔk ba; utǝ na amɛ, atei na zhɔu agar igyaŋ men. <verse eid="LUK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13" />Ate yi ndi utei na igyaŋ, zhɔ abɛ yik iyah, ben abɛ amkpɔk aza, ben abɛ sɔŋ aglugluk, ben abɛ amfik ayi, <verse eid="LUK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14" />kɔ bate zhɔu te ubǝ yaa ba ba, a tei sagu anu adidik. Ne me utei ta shar didik ne bɛr yi ilu aneshir abɛ yi atsetser.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nkanlɛ ne atɔ yi igyaŋ ŋgɔŋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15" />Ndi nuŋ ne sɔŋ ali kili ben Yesɔ ne wɔ me, adi Yesɔ, &lt;&lt;waŋ ndi atei li kili ne kɔb Arik ne nǝgu anu adidik.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16" />Yesɔ adiu: &lt;&lt;Ner nuŋ ane tei na igyaŋ ŋgɔŋ ane zhɔ acɛn tetɛk. <verse eid="LUK 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17" />Ndi mkpaŋ kɛ gyaŋa ne te ne shar igen amaa abɛ kɔte abla acɛn abaŋ ndi ne zhɔ ba gyaŋa te di, &lt;Nyɛ zhin, te neka na kɔte ni aŋyak.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18" />Fena bɔbɔk mǝne adi aba batei nyɛ ba. Ine kuti me ne di, &lt;Mne ntashi lɛb ahwaŋ, M tei ngar ntɔu. Zuk me zhɔk.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19" />&lt;&lt;Nuŋɔ anadi, &lt;Mne lɛb alandɔŋ abɛ lɔn atuŋ, me ŋgar duŋ ba lɔn atɔ. Zuk me zhɔk.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20" />&lt;&lt;Fe nuŋ ana di, &lt;Mne ntashi nta iwa, bam tei yik nyɛ ba.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21" />&lt;&lt;Igene ne akama aŋyak te bla atukɔ amaa lǝlɛ yiŋɛ bɔbɔk. Fǝ ner ne kɔbɔ abaŋ afuk te di gen amaa &lt;Ru kɔmɔ andanda ne nkunkɔŋ te yir min ntun te zhɔ abɛ yik iyah, ben abɛ amkpɔk aza, ben abɛ amfik ayi ben abɛ yaŋ lɛ.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22" />&lt;&lt;&lt;Igene ne di, &lt;Ŋgɔŋ, iki yiŋ ndi une blam mne nka nai.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23" />&lt;&lt;Fǝ atukɔ mɔ adi igen amaa, &lt;Kam kɔmɔ ne nkuŋkɔŋ yi ntuntun muɔ tsɔtsɔb bǝn ntuntun ngɔngɔŋ te bla aneshir abɛ nyɛ tetɛk te bɛ anyɛ te shak kɔmuŋ. <verse eid="LUK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24" />Mbla zhin, ba nuŋ ne min kɛ abaŋ ndi mne zhɔ ba igyaŋa ndi atei li gyaŋ yiŋɛ bene bem.&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iya iyi ne zǝ Yesɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25" />Ntsan aneshir tetɛk ne zǝ Yesɔ, ankyak akama tɔ ba te di: <verse eid="LUK 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26" />&lt;&lt;Waŋ ndi ate nyɛ bene bem ndi ba te kyak tetɛɛ maa, bǝn iya maa, bǝn iwa maa, bǝn amumun amaa, bǝn amunzumen, bǝn amun va men, bǝn susun maa ba, batei zǝme yir ba. <verse eid="LUK 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27" />Waŋ ndi ba te baŋ mkpɔk nkunkun kǝ gen maa te zǝm ba ba tei yi ne zǝm ba.<verse eid="LUK 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28" />Ate yi ndi inuŋ ne miŋ mine atei mee iki ngɔŋ, ba tei sɔŋ te tɔ ka wa ayi ne zɔb ayiŋ ndi atei mlau mee kime klɛ kai? <verse eid="LUK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29" />Teyi ndi ate sak ntanda kɛ mee me te bate klik ba, iwaŋ ndi ate gar te yik kɛ atei zhabu, <verse eid="LUK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30" />te di, &lt;Nɛr waŋa ne mee ki te gun kɛ alakakna akana.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31" />&lt;&lt;Kɔ Itum ndi atei gar ikum ben Itum nuŋ. Batei zǝ sɔŋ te bla tɔ ka wa atei Gli abɛ tei ikum azhin wur te nyɛ tsik mgbu ben waŋ ndi anyɛ ne abɛ tei ikum azhin amɛ sɔk yaa kai? <verse eid="LUK 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32" />Ate yi ndi batei klik ayir ba atei men ashar anuŋ abɛ kɔte ayik akpa ndi anaga ri yi gbagbaŋ te aba bɛ lɛ biŋ te sɔŋ keke. <verse eid="LUK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33" />Ne me, waŋ ndi ba wa tei vu ki maa anǝk bɔbɔk ba ba tei zǝm ayir ba.<verse eid="LUK 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34" />&lt;&lt;Imaŋ rɛ, ate yi ndi imen maa te ru, itei na kikin te men ndi imaŋ i? <verse eid="LUK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35" />Ba tei rɛ na ndum kinuŋ ne ahwaŋ ba, batei na flu ki li kɔ bǝ rɛ kinuŋ yi mimi ba; atei tyak kǝ ahrie. &lt;&lt;Waŋ ndi ate yi ne atɔŋ ayi wɔ, abɛ wɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15" />
  <para style="s">Nkanlɛ wanta ne dɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1" />Ndi abɛ ta gendu bǝn &lt;&lt;abɛ naki mimin&gt;&gt; Ne zhɔk Yesɔ ne tsutsu te zen wɔu. <verse eid="LUK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2" />Fe na ferisawa bǝn abɛ tsar nkanlɛ alɛ ne: &lt;&lt;Neshir waŋa ata abɛ na ki mimin tena li kili bene ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3" />Ankyak Yesɔ abla ba nkanlɛ yiŋɛ: <verse eid="LUK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4" />&lt;&lt;Te bɛ di inuŋ ne miŋ mine ayi ne awanta sɔkwur te zhiin ne dɔ. Bai duŋ sɔk tres anetres ne amkpa ne kyu te kama te wɔb bu te yigu baliŋ kai? <verse eid="LUK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5" />Fe ate yigu, batei mlak anyɛr te baŋu asak ne ampa <verse eid="LUK 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6" />te kɔmɔ ne kɔb. Fe atei zhɔ akpa amaa bene akpa abɛ sɔŋ yaŋa akpa te di, &lt;Zɔk mezhin nyere; te mniyik iwanta amuŋ ndi ne adɔmɔ.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7" />Mbla zhin te ye mee atei nyer ngɔŋ ne shu ne atu ayi ner zhin ne lalɛ waŋ ndi ne duŋ na zumimin inaŋ aner sɔk tres anetres ndi ayi tsetser.<verse eid="LUK 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nkanlɛ yi dɔ azɔb</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8" />&lt;&lt;Ka abɛdi Iwa waŋ ndi ayi ne azɔb awur fǝ izhin lu yaŋa. Bai lɔ sak pitila ne ki laŋ, te kun min kɔbɔ bwe te bɛ wɔb kɛ abaŋ kai? <verse eid="LUK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9" />Ndi ate yik kɛ, bai zhɔ akpa amaa bene abɛ sɔŋ yaŋ akpa tedi, &lt;Zɔk mezhin nyere; Mniyik azɔb muŋ keŋ ndi ne dɔ.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10" />Nǝ na ye mee, mbla zhin, nyer yime ne ayi abɛ shar ayou Arik ne atu yi neshir ne lalɛ ndi ne duŋ lalɛ maa te zǝ Arik.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nkanlɛ yi vǝvǝn ne dɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11" />Yesɔ azǝn le: &lt;&lt;Ineshir nuŋ ayi ne amumun ayaa. <verse eid="LUK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12" />Fe ivǝtsob o adi tetɛɛ maa, &lt;Tetɛɛ, nǝm iki yiŋ ndi iyi muŋ yi gadu.&gt; Fe akɔ gab ba kime ntǝg yaa.<verse eid="LUK 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13" />&lt;&lt;Bane baŋ mkpaŋ ba, vǝtsɔbɔ ata ki maa bɔbɔk, te gar tsǝn kɛ lak te kɔmɔ ne Ntun nuŋ te vu azɔbɔ maa aŋlɔk ne nyaŋatɔŋ. <verse eid="LUK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14" />Ndi ne ŋlɔk iki iyi nǝgu ma aklɛ, ijɔŋ ŋgɔŋ ne lu kɔte me fe ba na yi ne kinuŋ yi li ba. <verse eid="LUK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15" />Ankyak akɔte wɔb ndum kǝ na ne ntuno, inuŋ anugu yɔk ane gluk abɛ kɔb. <verse eid="LUK 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16" />Ana vu kili ne mglo kǝ shur ane gluk kili azǝn li, ba nǝgu kinuŋ ba.<verse eid="LUK 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17" />&lt;&lt;Ndi susun maa ne kam nyak, adi, &lt;Amkpaŋa ben tetɛɛ muŋ abaŋ abɛ nau ndum te li kili tena duŋ nki, te ijɔŋ tei ŋun me! <verse eid="LUK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18" />M tei ŋurkam nyak bǝn tetɛɛ muŋ te ndiu: Tetɛɛ, mne la Tetɛɛ ne shu lɛ tena lau lɛ. <verse eid="LUK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19" />Bam nayi waŋ ndi uzhɔm tǝ Zumi ba, duŋ mǝ yi izhiin ne min kɛ agen ami. <verse eid="LUK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20" />Ankyak alɔ kɔmɔ te ate yik tetɛɛ maa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 15:20">&lt;&lt;Ndi anaga ri yi gbagbaŋ, tetɛɛ maa atɔu azhi te wɔ lɔ susun maa; aklu te yigu, te klau avuŋ te tsar nyɛr maa. <verse eid="LUK 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21" />&lt;&lt;Zu maa adiu, &lt;Tetɛɛ, Mni laa shu tena lau lɛ. Bam ne mla te ubǝ zhɔm te zumi ba.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22" />&lt;&lt;Fena tetɛɛ me adi agene maa, &lt;Nama! Baŋ zhin anklu akɛ rɛ ngɔŋ ayuŋɔ suu. Suu zhin ne wu vǝne ankawun ne vǝnŋɔk maa tena suu akpaza. <verse eid="LUK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23" />Gli zhin alandɔŋ aŋgɔŋ te yak zhin ne wu. Tǝ tabǝ na igyaŋ ŋgɔŋ te glu nyɛr. <verse eid="LUK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24" />Tǝ Vǝvǝn amuŋ waŋa ne ku ama ayi tsitsir azizaŋa; ne dɔ ama ne yigu.&gt; Fe akɔ naa gyaŋ.<verse eid="LUK 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25" />&lt;&lt;Ne mee, Izu maa ngɔŋɔ ayi ne ahwaŋ. Ate tsǝne te gbahir ne kɔb, awɔ asem ben glu. <verse eid="LUK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26" />Fe akɔ zhɔ zhin ne min kɛ agene te rib bu anii tsǝn. <verse eid="LUK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27" />&lt;Izumin neka nyak,&gt; a blau, &lt;fe tetɛɛ mi ne yak alandɔŋ aŋgɔŋ te ne nyak kyekye.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28" />&lt;&lt;Izu maa ŋgɔŋɔ ate mfu te kyak yir kɔbɔ. Ankyak tetɛɛ maa aru abɛm te benu. <verse eid="LUK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29" />Fena adi tetɛɛ maa, &lt;Tɔ! Ne se yiŋɛ M zǝn yik iya ne nau ndum. Ne mee kɔ bɛr zhiin bɔu ne dim ta vǝn wuwu nuŋ yak tem nyer bǝn akpa amuŋ ba. <verse eid="LUK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30" />Ama izumi waŋ ndi ne ŋlɔk kiki mi ben amba abɛ zǝ alulum ne kama nyak kɔb, fe uyagu alandɔŋ aŋgɔŋ!&gt;<verse eid="LUK 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31" />&lt;&lt;&lt;Izu muŋ,&gt;&gt; tetɛɛ me adi, &lt;kɔte bɛr tayi ndɔ, iki muŋ inayi mi. <verse eid="LUK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32" />Ndi amɛ tabǝ naa igyaŋ tena nyɛr, te izumin waŋa ne ku fe ayi tsitsir azizaŋa, ne dɔ te ne yigu.&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 15:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16" />
  <para style="s">Nkanlɛ netu ner ne yaŋ bla lɛ didik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1" />Yesɔ ablaa abɛ tsene maa: &lt;&lt;Ine yi ne azɔb nuŋ waŋa ne vǝ ngɔŋ abɛ nau ndumo te avu azɔbɔ avar ate nten. <verse eid="LUK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2" />Fe a zhɔu ayir min ki te diu, &lt;Aye nii tsǝn tem wɔi ne tu mi? Blam ki yiŋ ndi une nai nǝ min kɛ na ndum mi, te bam na duŋu na ndum kǝŋe ba.<verse eid="LUK 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3" />&lt;&lt;Iwaŋ ndi ne sagu ndum ne adi tu maa, &lt;M tei na kikin azizaŋa yi? Ngɔŋɔ muŋ ata ndumo. Bam yi ne mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ ka dudu ba, fe Ishisha tem ne ben ki. <verse eid="LUK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4" />Mni zhi ki ndim na ndi, kɔ mte suk ndum muŋ ayaŋa, aneshir atei tam ne akɔb amen.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5" />&lt;&lt;Ankyak akɔ zhɔ kɔte neshir waŋ ndi ne ta hria ne aŋɔgɔ maa. Arib ne kuti me, &lt;Ayi kin ŋgɔŋ amuŋɔ zeu?&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6" />&lt;&lt;&lt;Ambu sɔkwur amɛ tender iyi anyɛ zetun,&gt; adi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 16:6">&lt;&lt;Ta azɔb ami, zisɔŋ andanda, te duŋ kɛ ŋli sɔkwur me nas.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7" />Fe akɔ rib ne Yaa amaa, Fǝ ihria mi yi kikin?&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 16:7">Adiu,&lt;&lt;&lt;Ai azhin azhiin kɛ alikama,&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 16:7">&lt;&lt;A blau, &lt;Baŋ azɔbɔ ami te kam aŋɔgɔ neyi tǝ bɛ ŋliu sɔkwur me tender ne tu mɔ.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8" />&lt;&lt;Ngɔŋ ne amkpama adi nǝ yaŋ gli ndum gli didige ndi ne nakǝ nten. Tǝ Aneshir abɛ gɔnmimi kǝŋe ayi nten ne na ki men inaŋ aner abaŋ ndi ayi abɛ laŋ abɛm. <verse eid="LUK 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9" />Mbla zhin, na zhin ndum ne adudun ki yi gɔnmimi te yik akpa ye tu min, ndi iki me tei klɛ, atei ta zhin ne mkpǝmkpa yi sɔŋ sik.<verse eid="LUK 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10" />&lt;&lt;Iwaŋ ndi ate kiu ki vetsɔb te ne kyui agli anenen, atei nugu ngɔŋ, fe waŋ ndi bate zhi kyu ivetsob agli ba, ba atei zhi gli ngɔŋ ba. <verse eid="LUK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11" />Iye mee ndi bau tei na zub ne azɔb ndi ne nǝgu ubǝ kam ŋɔgo ayi gɔnmimi ka, ŋɔwa atei tanyɛmɛ te baŋ azɔb adidik anegui? <verse eid="LUK 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12" />Fe ate yi ndi bau tei zhi na azɔb ayi nuŋ nyak anenen ba, teu na kikin ne ki mi?<verse eid="LUK 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13" />&lt;&lt;Igen ba tei naa aneshir angɔŋgɔŋ ayaa ndum mkpaŋ zhin ba. Ai kyak zhin te tanyɛmɛ ne zhin, kɔ abɛ nek tu maa bǝn zhin te kyak nuŋɔ. Bau tei zǝ Arik tena zǝ azɔb ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14" />Iferisawa, abaŋ ndi asu ayi ne azɔb, ate wɔ mee akɔ gli Yesɔ. <verse eid="LUK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15" />A diba, &lt;&lt;Ai zhineba na ki yige ayi te aneshir abɛ yik ne akpamin, ama Arik ne zhi asusun amin. Iki yiŋ ndi aneshir ayige ba ire bǝn Arik ba.<verse eid="LUK 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ne na kama tsar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16" />&lt;&lt;Ibla nkenlɛ bǝn abɛ na ndum bla tɔ ti ne lɛ kɛ Arik ne di te Yɔɔna abe shɛ nyɛ. Ire mkpaŋ yuŋɔ, ilɛ kɛ men ike shu kɛ kɔb Arik ne bla kɛ, ankyak kɔte ŋɔwa asu tu maa tǝ bɛ gara. <verse eid="LUK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17" />Iyi ne sik te gbarshu bǝn gɔnmimi bǝ naŋ ndɔ inaŋ yiŋ ndi kɔ ntǝ ke ne lɛ kɛ cɛr iyi Musa bai naŋ dɔ ba.<verse eid="LUK 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18" />&lt;&lt;Iwaŋ ndi ate kyak iwa maa tena ta wanuŋ ne lalɛ kǝ ze amba, kai lulum nuŋ ne ta iwa ndi ne kyagu nena lalɛ maayi.<verse eid="LUK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ine yi ne adudunki ben Lazaru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19" />&lt;&lt;Neshir nuŋ waŋ neyi ne adudunki, iki su yi duŋ maa iyi didilim te irɛ ngɔŋ tena yi ne kɔb didik. <verse eid="LUK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20" />Ne anɔkɔŋ kǝ kɔb maa ine ben ki nuŋ ndi a zhɔ sak maa te Lazaru, amkpaa ne ku kpa maa <verse eid="LUK 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21" />aŋub mbumbur kili yiŋ ndi ŋgɔŋɔ nɛ li tǝ nɛ var hrie ne mimi tǝ wa abɛ vu ali. Ane viu ana nyɛ lak amkpaa ma.<verse eid="LUK 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22" />&lt;&lt;Mkpaŋ ndi ine ben kime ne ku fe ine shar ayou Arik anyɛ baŋu ate zhɔk ne angus Ibrai. Ine yine adudunki nena nyɛ ku maayi tena ruu. <verse eid="LUK 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23" />Nǝ min lu azǝn zhin te tsik kpa alǝk ayi ayik Ibrai tedi wa yik iyah, tena yik Lazaru ne nkɔn sa maa. <verse eid="LUK 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24" />Fena akɔ zhɔu, &lt;Itetɛ Ibrai, wɔ lɔ susun muŋ te shar Lazaru te bɛ yiŋ ven ŋɔk maa ne amashir ayiŋ me lǝlɛne, te myi ne min kɛ yik iyah ne lu.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25" />&lt;&lt;Ankyak Ibrai adiu, &lt;Izu muŋ, shuzhi ne mkpaŋ kɛ yine iki didik mi, ndi Lazaru bane yi ne kinuŋ ba, fe azizaŋa Lazaru ayi amkpa ne wɔmen amaa te iwa uyi ne min kɛ yik yaa. <verse eid="LUK 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26" />Ba amɛ ankyak ba, ne min mɔr bǝn iwa mgbɔk ŋgɔŋ yine angus amɔr, ndi abaŋ ndi atei wɔb ankɔŋɔ ane gar bene bɛ zhin ba yime ba, inuŋ bai glɔ aŋyak ben taba ba.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27" />&lt;&lt;A sagu ma tedi, &lt;Tǝm mbenu, tetɛɛ, shar Lazaru ne kɔb tetɛɛ muŋ, <verse eid="LUK 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28" />Tǝm yi ne amun zumɔr amɛ tuŋ. Tǝ bɛ gbaŋ ba atɔŋ, kǝr abɛ na zǝ ankɔŋɔ ane yik iyah awaŋa ba.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29" />&lt;&lt;Ibrai adiu, &lt;Ayi ne Musa bǝn abɛ bla lɛ kǝ Arik; Duŋ ba abɛ wɔ ba.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30" />&lt;&lt;&lt;Mkyak, tetɛɛ Ibrai,&gt; Adi, &lt;Tǝ nuŋ ne abɛ ku ate gar bene ba, atei duŋ lalɛ men,&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31" />&lt;&lt;Adiu, &lt;atedi ba tei wɔ Musa bǝn abɛ bla lɛ kɛ Arik ba, ba tei tanyɛmɛ bǝn nuŋ di ne ku te kama lu ba.&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17" />
  <para style="s">Lalɛ, ta nyɛmɛ, ndum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1" />Yesɔ adi abɛ tsene maa: &lt;&lt;Ki yiŋ ndi duŋ aneshir alalɛ itei nyɛ, fe iner waŋ ndi inyɛ ne ŋɔk amaa abɛ zhin azhɔk tu maa. <verse eid="LUK 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2" />Ibǝ rɛ bǝn neshire te abɛ kpau mkpaŋ nena ne tɔ te tugu azhɔk ne nek ŋgɔŋ ndi atei yi ankɔŋ ane duŋ anuŋ alalɛ. <verse eid="LUK 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3" />Ndi amɛ tɔ zhin akpamin. &lt;&lt;atei ndi zumin ne lalɛ, gbaŋu atɔŋ, ate di wa ne duŋ lalɛ, zugu zhɔk. <verse eid="LUK 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4" />Ate lau lɛ amkaŋa taŋgba ne bɛr zhin, te na diu amkpaŋa taŋgba &lt;Mne laulɛ zuk me zhɔk,&gt; Zuk zhu zhɔgu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5" />Abɛ tsene maa a di Ŋgɔŋ, na fa ŋyaŋ ta ne tanyɛmɛ mɔrɔ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6" />A diba, &lt;&lt;Izhin te tanyɛmɛ watsɔb ndi mgbyaŋ ŋklik, te di tiŋ nkunkun, &lt;Ubǝ tun te shi ne nek ŋgɔŋ itei wɔ zhin.<verse eid="LUK 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7" />&lt;&lt;Te bɛdi inuŋ ne miŋ min ayi ne igen waŋ di anau ndum kɔ akyu awanta. Ba tei di gene ndi ate nyak are ahwaŋ, &lt;Ŋyɛ zǝ sɔŋ te li kili kai?&gt; <verse eid="LUK 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8" />Ndi abɛdi, &lt;Nam kili ye amgbalu, te na sɔŋ, tem lii tena so; ndi M tei hri ukana baŋ lii tena so mi yime kai? <verse eid="LUK 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9" />Ba tei nyer igene ndi ne zǝ kiyiŋ ndi ne di abɛ nama kai&gt;? <verse eid="LUK 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10" />Ndi amɛ, ate yi ndi utei na ki yiŋ ndi ne di ubǝ nai, bai di &lt;Ba ta ne mla abɛ yi agen ba; tane nak na ndum mɔr.&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abɛ amgbyamgbyak aŋɔk amɛ awur ne rɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11" />Ndi Yesɔ ayi ne ankɔŋɔ ne kɔmɔ ne Urshelima, Yesɔ Ne tsǝn ne akɔnɔsa ntun yi Samariya ben Galili. <verse eid="LUK 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12" />Ndi ne yi ne min kɛ ntuno, aneshir awur abɛ lɔ amgbyak nga aŋɔk a yigu. Aklɛ gbagbaŋ. <verse eid="LUK 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13" />Te aŋar kɔr te zhɔu, &lt;&lt;Yesɔ, Ŋgɔŋ, wɔ lɔ susun ne atu amɔr&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14" />Ndi ne yik ba, adi, &lt;&lt;Tsǝn, tsar zhin akpamin ben abɛ na ndum kǝ Arik. Ndi anaga kɔmɔ, akɔ rɛ.<verse eid="LUK 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15" />Izhiin ne min mǝne, ndi ne yik wa ne rɛ, aŋur akam,te gbar Arik asak ne kɔr ŋgɔŋ. <verse eid="LUK 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16" />Azhaku ne aza yi Yesɔ te nyeru ane yi awɔnǝ Samariya.<verse eid="LUK 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17" />Yesɔ arib, &lt;&lt;Mdi ka aye aner awur mne duŋ ba rɛ? Nki amɛ tres ma ayi neme? <verse eid="LUK 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18" />Nuŋ bane mla ne ŋurkam anyɛ gbar Arik asak ne rɛ maa ka anaga yi cen waŋa kiki mai? <verse eid="LUK 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19" />Fena akɔ diu, &lt;&lt;Lu kɔmɔ; itanyɛmɛ mi ne duŋu rɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inyɛ kɔb Ŋgɔŋ kɛ Arik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20" />Iber nuŋ, awɔnǝ Ferisawa anyɛ rib tedi ayi atenta atei yik nyɛ ikɔb kǝ Arik, Yesɔ adi, &lt;&lt;Inyɛ kɔb Ŋgɔŋ kɛ Arik bai shur ayi abɛ blɛ nyɛ maa ba, <verse eid="LUK 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21" />Ka aneshir ai di, &lt;Tɔ kǝkɛŋ, ka tɔ yuŋɔ amɔ,&gt; te ikɔb kǝ Arik iyi ne miŋ min.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22" />Ankyak akɔ di abɛ tsene maa, &lt;&lt;Mkpaŋ nyɛ ndi izhin tei shur ayi te zhin bǝ yik iber yi nyɛ Izu Neshir, ba zhin tei yik ba. <verse eid="LUK 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23" />Aner atei bla zhin, &lt;Tɔ yuŋ!&gt; Duŋ klu zǝ zhine ba ka. <verse eid="LUK 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24" />Tǝ Izu Neshir iber yi nyɛ maa itei yi ndi li nas, ndi ibu tena laŋ ne gbarshu rɛ gar nuŋ igar kɔmɔ ne gar nuŋ. <verse eid="LUK 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25" />Nǝ kuh ti, atei yik iyah tetɛk baliŋ fe aner atei kyagu.<verse eid="LUK 17:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26" />&lt;&lt;Ndi ne yi ne mkpaŋ kɛ Nuhu, iteina ye mee ne bɛr yi Izu Neshir. <verse eid="LUK 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27" />Aneshir ne zen lii, te so, te hwa te ta mbǝmba igar te yir bɛr ndi Nuhu ne yir gu. Anca aŋgɔŋ anyɛ vu ba adɔmɔ.<verse eid="LUK 17:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28" />&lt;&lt;Nǝna yi anenen ndi mkpaŋ kɛ lɔt. Aneshir ne zǝn lii te so, lɛb tena vu alɛb, atib ki tena mee. <verse eid="LUK 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29" />Ankyak ne bɛr yiŋ ndi lɔt ne duŋ sodɔm, ilu ben aŋkliŋkla lu ne ren ahrie rɛ shu te goŋ ba bɔbɔk.<verse eid="LUK 17:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30" />&lt;&lt;Itei ye mee ne bɛr yiŋ ndi Izu Neshir a tei Gli tu maa rumɔ. <verse eid="LUK 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31" />Nǝ bǝn, kǝr nuŋ waŋ ndi akɔ sɔŋ ne tu ki kǝ kɔb maa, te kiki maa yi ne abɛm kǝr abɛ di wa gar vui ba. Amɛ, iwaŋ ndi ayi ne abɛm kǝr abɛ di wa agar baŋ kinuŋ ba. <verse eid="LUK 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32" />Shuzhi iyi iwa Lɔt! <verse eid="LUK 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33" />Waŋ ndi ate di wa akyu ivli maa, atei zhɔk kɛ adɔmɔ,fe iwaŋ di atei ku ne atɔ muŋ atei ta kɛ azhɔk. <verse eid="LUK 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34" />Mbla zhin, aner ayaa atei kukur ne ki kur zhiin, atei baŋ zhin te duŋ zhin. <verse eid="LUK 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35" />Amba yaa atei dɔ zen kɔk ne nena amkpa zhiin; atei baŋ nuŋ te duŋ nuŋ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:36" />Alulum ayaa atei dɔ na ndum ne ahwaŋ: atei baŋ zhin te duŋ zhin.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 17:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37" />&lt;&lt;Ne me, Ŋgɔŋ? Aba rib. A diba, &lt;&lt;Amkpa waŋ ndi ikum yime, utei yik angulu ne biŋe.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 17:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18" />
  <para style="s">Nkanlɛ yi su tu wakɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1" />Fe Yesɔ abla abɛ tsene maa nkanlɛ te abɛ ben Arik iyaŋ mkpaŋ kǝr abɛ tun susun ba. <verse eid="LUK 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2" />Adi: &lt;&lt;Nǝ ntun nuŋ iyiŋɛ ine te ŋas ayime ndi ba klu sisik Arik ba kai bɛ lɔ wɔ lɔ susun aner. <verse eid="LUK 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3" />Nǝ ntuno iwakɔ nuŋ azǝn zeu gar te ben, &lt;Yir min mɔr bǝn waŋ ndi awɔb zhaku muŋ.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4" />&lt;&lt;Ne lɔ di wa akyak. Te nalɔ di ne susun maa, &lt;Mni nzhi bam klu sisik Arik ba bam na nkam tɔ aneshir ba, <verse eid="LUK 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5" />ndi kime iye mee wakɔmɔ adam me, M tei nǝgu ikiyiŋ ndi iyi maa, kǝr abɛ zen nyɛ te dam me ba!&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6" />Fe Arik Ŋgɔŋ adi, &lt;&lt;Wɔ zhin ki yiŋ ndi ne yaŋ te ambuk zub waŋa adi. <verse eid="LUK 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7" />Fena Arik bai lɔ wɔ zhin kɛ abaŋ ndi ne hria ba kai, ndi azhin ashuru aririk bǝn bu kai?Ai lɔ kyak wɔ bai? <verse eid="LUK 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8" />Mbla zhin, atei nek kɔte ŋɔwa ikiyiŋ ndi iyi anenen. Ndi iye mee, ne bɛr yi nyɛ Izu Neshir, atei yik itanyɛmɛ ne gɔnmimi? &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nkenlɛ yi awɔnǝ Ferisawa ben ne ta gendu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9" />Fe ne bla nkanlɛ tedi, aneshir abaŋ ndi ne tanyɛmɛ ne kpa men te ba naki didik, te bene yik nki aneshir bayi ikinuŋ ba, adi: <verse eid="LUK 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10" />&lt;&lt;Anere yaa ne gar ben Arik ne Akabakɔŋ, nuŋ aye awɔnǝ Ferisawa ine yaa ma ata gendu. <verse eid="LUK 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11" />Awɔnǝ Ferisawa ma alu akli adidik te ben yi gbaar atu amaa sak: &lt;Arik, Mne nye ru te bam yi ndi nki aneshir ba, abɛ zhib, abɛ na ki mimin abɛ ze amba, te vuŋ waŋ ndi ata gendumɔ. <verse eid="LUK 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12" />Mkpaŋ anu amkpaŋ ayaa ne min kɛ sati, ikiyiŋ ndi mtǝ yik mtun zhiin ne min kɛ wur nek.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13" />Ndi amɛ, ine ta gendumɔ aklɛ shaan, bane lɛk ayi atɔ shumɔ ba, fe atsik asa amaa te bene di, &lt;Arik, wɔ lɔ susun muŋ, myi ne lalɛ.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14" />&lt;&lt;Mdik mbla zhin te neshir waŋa, ne kama kɔmɔ ne kɔ maa te Arik ne ŋlau azhɔk anaŋ ne ŋur asa yuŋɔ, te waŋ ndi ate lɛk tu maa atei gliu azime, iwaŋ ndi ate Gli tu maa azime, atei lɛgu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesɔ ne nek amumun amuotsɔtsɔb anu adidik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15" />Aneshir ne gliu amumun amen te nyɛ ben Yesɔ te bɛ sak ba ŋɔk. Abɛ tsene maa te yik amɛ, akɔ tsaŋ ba. <verse eid="LUK 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16" />Ankyak Yesɔ akɔ zhɔ amumune tedi, &lt;&lt;Duŋ zhin amumune abaŋa anyɛ bene bɛm, duŋ yar zhin neba ba, te kɔb Arik ŋgɔŋ kɛ shu iyi men. <verse eid="LUK 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17" />Mbla zhin lɛ didik, ate yi ndi waŋ ndi bate ta nyɛmɛ ne kɔb Arik ndi vǝvǝn vǝtsɔb ba, ba tei yir kɛ ba ne mla yaŋ klɛtu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ŋgɔŋ ne yi ne ŋɔk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18" />Ngɔŋ ne yine ŋɔgo aribu, &lt;&lt;Ine tsar didik, M tei na kikin tem ta ivli kǝ yaŋ klɛtu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19" />Fe Yesɔ adiu. &lt;&lt;Anii duŋu zhɔm te ne tsar didik?&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Inuŋ ne rɛ ba na yime ba aye Arik ankyak. <verse eid="LUK 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20" />Une zhi ilɛ kǝ kpa nyak: &lt;Duŋ ze amba ko ze alulum ka, duŋ ŋun neshir ba, duŋ zhib ba, duŋ ta lɛ ndi bau nǝ zhi ki ba, nek tetɛɛ mi ben yaa mi ŋgɔŋ men.&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21" />&lt;&lt;Iki yiŋɛ bɔbɔk mni men zee ire mkpaŋ kɛ tashi lu rɛ nzak muŋ,&gt;&gt; adi.<verse eid="LUK 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22" />Ndi Yesɔ ne wɔ amee, adiu, &lt;&lt;Ikinuŋ yaŋa. Leb adudunki ayiŋ ndi uyime neyi te nek abɛ yaŋ kinuŋ, teu tei yik ki tetɛk ne shu. Tǝ kashe zǝm.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23" />Ndi ne wɔ mee, akɔ te mfu ŋgɔŋ, te iwa ayine ŋɔk. <verse eid="LUK 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24" />Yesɔ ne yigu amɛ te di, &lt;&lt;Itei yini iya te ner ne yi ne adudunki abɛ yir ikɔb Arik! <verse eid="LUK 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25" />Nǝ tǝ te lakurmi abɛ zǝ mblu alura inaŋ ndi neshir ne ŋɔk abɛ yir kɔb Arik.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26" />Abaŋ ndi ne wɔ amɛ arib, &lt;&lt;Tei ŋɔwa atei li aru i?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27" />Yesɔ asaga, &lt;&lt;Iki yiŋ ndi naŋ neshir ben Arik bai naŋ ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28" />Biturus adiu, &lt;&lt;Tane duŋ ki bɔbɔk te zee wa!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29" />Mbla zhin lɛ didik, Yesɔ adi ba, &lt;&lt;Baa nuŋ ndi ne duŋ kɔb, te duŋ wa, te duŋ amunzu, amunva, atetɛ ka ye amumun ne sak kɛ kɔb Arik <verse eid="LUK 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30" />ndi atei yik ki tetɛk azizaŋa bǝn ivli kǝ yaŋ klɛtu naŋ yi kukub yime, ne gbarshu ba atei dɔ ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesɔ ne na bla iku maa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31" />Yesɔ ne gli awur ane yaa ma gar nkɔnsa te diba, &lt;&lt;Ta kɔmɔ ne Urshelima, kiyiŋ ndi ne cɛrǝ ne nkanlɛ yi abɛ bla shar yi Arik ne atu yi Izu Neshir ne shaga. <verse eid="LUK 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32" />Atei baŋu nek abaŋ ndi bai ŋli Yahudawa ba. Atei mlagu, ateu mla, te sɛre ntǝ shuru, te tsǝgu, tena ŋunu. <verse eid="LUK 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33" />Iber yi ntar atei na lu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34" />Abɛ tsene maa inuŋ ba ne zhi iki yiŋ ndi tsǝn ba, te ilɛmɛ menyi kuŋkum bene beba, bane mǝne zhi kiyiŋ ndi ne blai ba.<verse eid="LUK 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesɔ nena neshir ne amfik te duŋɔ yik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35" />Ndi Yesɔ ne te gbahir ne ntun yi Jerikɔ, iner ne amfik asɔŋɔ ben ne kɔno ankɔŋ. <verse eid="LUK 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36" />A shur atɔŋ te wɔ aneshir azǝn gayir, a rib ka ye anii tsǝn. <verse eid="LUK 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37" />A blau, &lt;&lt;Ai Yesɔ awɔnǝ Nazara agayir.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38" />Akɔ zhɔ, &lt;&lt;Yesɔ, Izu Doda, wɔ lɔ susun ne atɔ muŋ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39" />Abaŋ ndi ayi ne tii maa akɔ tsaŋu abɛ kwɔnu ayi ndi a shɔgu, a ŋar kɔr, &lt;&lt;Izu Doda, wɔ lɔ susun muŋ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40" />Yesɔ agbur aklɛ tedi abɛ glii wa neshire. A te te gbahir, Yesɔ aribu, <verse eid="LUK 18:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41" />&lt;&lt;Aye nii mnau neyii?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 18:41">&lt;&lt;Ŋgɔŋ, tem yik!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42" />Fe Yesɔ akɔ diu, &lt;&lt;Duŋ ayi ami abɛ tɔ; itanyɛmɛ mi ne duŋu rɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 18:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43" />Andanda ayi amaa bu akɔ zǝ Yesɔ, te nyer Arik. Ndi aneshir ne yik amɛ, akɔ nyɛr Arik menyi.<verse eid="LUK 18:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19" />
  <para style="s">Zaka ne ta gendu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1" />Ndi Yesɔ ne yir Jerikɔ te gara zǝ min ntunɔ. <verse eid="LUK 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2" />Fe neshir nuŋ waŋa ndi azhɔu te Zaka; ayi ŋgɔŋ ne min kɛ abɛ ta gendu, ana yi ne adudunki. <verse eid="LUK 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3" />Ne wɔb yik ka ai ŋɔwa ayi Yesɔ mɔ, ama ne lak akana te yi ner vǝmkpuk, aneshir neyi ne du. <verse eid="LUK 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4" />Akɔ klu akɔmɔ ne tii te gar ayuŋ tiŋ bwab asɔŋɔ tǝ bɛ yigu, ne zhi te Yesɔ atei zǝ amɔ.<verse eid="LUK 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5" />Ndi Yesɔ ne yir amkpama, a lɛk ayi atɔ shumɔ te diu, &lt;&lt;Zaka, zi andanda, M tei ŋgar kɔmi aliŋǝ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6" />Akɔ nama azǝ te tau aŋɔgɔ yaa.<verse eid="LUK 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7" />Aneshir te nak ayik amɛ, akɔ lɛ mumur, &lt;&lt;Ne yir kɔb kɛ ne na zumimin.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8" />Fena Zaka alu aklɛ adidik tedi Ŋgɔŋ, &lt;&lt;Tǝ,Ŋgɔŋ! Baŋ rɛ aliŋ, iki yiŋ ndi yi muŋ M tei ŋgab nkime nek abɛ yaŋ adudunki, fe te yi ndi mne nkyer kinuŋ nta ben nuŋ, M tei yai amkpaŋa nas.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9" />Yesɔ adiu, &lt;&lt;Aliŋe ita zhɔk ne yir kɔb kǝŋe, te neshir waŋa maayi, ayi izu Ibrai. <verse eid="LUK 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10" />Tǝ Izu Neshir ne nyɛ te bɛ wɔb tena ta iki yiŋ ndi ne dɔ azhɔk.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nkenlɛ yi abɛ na ndum ka mkpaŋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11" />Ndi ne asɔŋ azǝn wɔu, Yesɔ a blaa ba nkanlɛ, ndi ne te gbahir ne Urshelima, ndi aneshir ayik te di kɔb Arik itei nyɛ andanda. <verse eid="LUK 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12" />Adi, &lt;&lt;Neshir waŋ ndi ne ŋliu ne kɔb ŋgɔŋ ne gar ntun nuŋ yi lak te bɛ nyɛn wa Itum tɛka kama nyak. <verse eid="LUK 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13" />Fena, alu azho agɛn amaa amɛ wur te nek ba azɔb amɛ wur tedi, &lt;Kam zhin aŋɔgɔ neyi, mla ne nyak muŋ.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14" />Ankyak agɛn amaa akɔ kyagu, te lu ashar anuŋ ne goŋ maa te bɛ blau, &lt;Ba ta ne tanyɛme te neshire abɛ yi itum amɔr ba.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15" />&lt;&lt;Ne shuru itum, ndi amɛ, ne nyak kɔb. Fena, akɔ duŋ azho agene abaŋ ndi ne nek ba azɔb ayi kam aŋɔgɔ, te wa abɛ zhi kɔ ayi kin kɔte ŋɔwa ne yik ne sɔŋ ne tumɔ.<verse eid="LUK 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16" />Fe ine kuti me anyɛ di, &lt;Ngɔŋ, azɔb ayiŋ ndi une nǝm ma, mne kam aŋɔgɔ neyi nena nǝm azɔb amɛ wur ne tu mɔ.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17" />&lt;&lt;Igen amuŋ une na ndum didik!&gt;&gt; Atukɔ amaa adiu, &lt;Ndi une na ki didik ne ki vǝtsɔb, nyɛ gli ntuntun wur.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18" />&lt;&lt;Ine yaa maa anyɛ tedi, &lt;Ngɔŋ, azɔb ayiŋ ndi une nǝm ma ne ŋli azɔb amɛ tuŋ ne tu mɔ.<verse eid="LUK 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19" />&lt;&lt;Atukɔ amaa adiu, &lt;Uwa bǝ Gli ntuntun mei tuŋ.<verse eid="LUK 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20" />&lt;&lt;Ankyak igen nuŋ anyɛ te diu, &lt;Atukɔ, tɔ azɔb mi keŋ, mne men kpaa kɛ zhɔk ne mkpɔk anklu. <verse eid="LUK 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21" />Mne klu sisik mi, ulɔ zhi, uwɔb li isha, ubaŋ kiyiŋ ndi bai wa une nai ba tedi iyi mi te na sɛr iyiŋ ndi bau ne tibɛ ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22" />&lt;&lt;Atukɔ amaa adiu, &lt;M tei teu ambuk ne nkanlɛ mi, uwa igen ne naki mimin! Amɛ une zhi tem lɔ zhi, te mbaŋ kiyiŋ ndi bai ŋgam ne nai ba tem ndi iyi muŋi? <verse eid="LUK 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23" />Ite yeme, anii ne yaru zhɔk kɛ ne amkpa anǝ nyak azɔbɔ, te bɛr yiŋ ndi mte nyak M tei yik kinuŋ ne yuŋ tu mɔ kai?&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24" />&lt;&lt;Ankyak akɔdi abaŋ ndi aklɛkli amɔ, &lt;Ta zhin azɔb kɛ waŋa, te nek zhin ne amɛ awur ne kɛ.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25" />&lt;&lt;Ngɔŋ, akɔ diu, amene yi ne azɔb amɛ wur!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26" />&lt;Mdik mbla zhin,&gt; iwaŋ ndi ate yini ki, atei na anyaŋu nuŋ, fena iwaŋ ndi ayaŋ ki a tei ta vǝ yiŋ ndi ayime neyi. <verse eid="LUK 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27" />Ndi amɛ, abɛ di abaŋ ndi akyak me iyi, te kǝr me yi itum amen ba, gli zhine ba nyɛmɛ te ŋlɔk ba ne tii muŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesɔ ne yir Urshelima ndi Tum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28" />Ndi Yesɔ ne lɛ amɛ, alɔ ku ti te kɔmɔ ne Urshelima. <verse eid="LUK 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29" />Ndi ne te gbahir ne vǝ ntun yi Betafaji bene Batanya, yaŋ igbu yiŋ ndi azhɔi te Igbu atiŋe akuŋkun Zetun, fe ne shar abɛ tsene maa amɛ ayaa. <verse eid="LUK 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30" />Te di ba, &lt;&lt;kɔmɔ zhin ne vǝ ntun yi ti min amɔ. Izhin te yirǝ, izhin tei yik ne kpa tatur, waŋ di nuŋ bane zǝn yuŋu atɔ ba. Zuk zhin ne wu igli nyɛmɛ. <verse eid="LUK 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31" />Ineshir nuŋ ate rib zhin, &lt;Ŋɔwa adi izhin bǝ zu gu?&gt; Izhin bǝ diu, &lt;Ŋgɔŋ awɔbu.&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32" />Abaŋ ndi ne shar ba ne kate yigu ndi ne blama. <verse eid="LUK 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33" />Ayi ne min kǝ zu gu ma, akiki ne tatur ma arib ba, &lt;&lt;Ai ŋɔwa adi zhin bǝ zuk Tatur waŋai?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34" />Fe akɔ di, &lt;&lt;Ŋgɔŋ awɔbu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35" />Agliu agli Yesɔ mɔ, ne lab nklunklu mǝne ne goŋ taturo te baŋ Yesɔ asak ne goŋɔ. <verse eid="LUK 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36" />Ayi ne min kǝ tsen, aneshir avu nklunklu mǝne lab ne ankɔŋ.<verse eid="LUK 19:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37" />Mkpaŋ keŋ ndi ne tsene te yir andǝgǝlɛk ane zi kɔmɔ ne atiŋe akunkun ayi gbu Zetun, ankyak abɛ tsene maa akɔ nyer te gbara Arik Ŋgɔŋ asak ne akɔr amen ne ki ngɔngɔŋ iyiŋ ndi aba ne yigǝ.<verse eid="LUK 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38" />Tedi, &lt;&lt;Inek anu adidik ne te ne atu ayi Itum waŋ ndi ne nyɛ ne sak kɛ Arik!&gt;&gt; Sik susun ne gbarshu bǝn Ŋgɔŋ ne gbarshu!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39" />Anuŋ ne min kɛ Ferisawa ne miŋ ntsan kɛ aneshire adiu, &lt;&lt;Ine Tsar, tsaŋ abɛ tsene ami te abǝ ku anu!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40" />&lt;&lt;Mdi zhin,&gt;&gt; A tanyɛme, &lt;&lt;Ate kyak lɛ, mkpaŋ tei ŋur ruru.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41" />Ndi ne tsǝne gbahir ne Urushelima te yuŋ aru yik ntuno, akɔ hrie ayi ne tu ayi ntuno <verse eid="LUK 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42" />te di, &lt;&lt;atei wa, mdi wa, abɛdi une zhi tedi bɛr yiŋɛ atei Gli zhin sik susun, amɛ ne sui ayir zhin ma. <verse eid="LUK 19:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43" />Ibɛre nyɛ ndi abɛ kyak zhin ayi atei mee nkɔntsǝn, te kam zhin azik, te bɛ te ikum ben zhin. <verse eid="LUK 19:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44" />Atei caŋ zhin ashur ne mimi, ben amumun amin abɛ klɛ ne akɔnɔntsin. Ba tei duŋ mkpaŋ nuŋ ne atɔ ayi nuŋ ba, te zhin ne kyak kam tɔ mkpaŋ kǝŋe ndi Arik ne anyɛ atu amin&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="LUK 19:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesɔ ne Yis Akabaŋkɔŋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45" />Ankyak akɔ yir gar kɛ Akabakɔŋ ŋɔ te kɔ yar aneshir abɛ zen lii dub ne akɔnɔsa ayi mɛ me. <verse eid="LUK 19:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46" />Ablaa ba te di &lt;&lt;Ne mǝne cɛrǝ,&gt;&gt; &lt;Ikɔb muŋ itei yi kɔb kɛ ben Arik,&gt;; fena izhin kam kɛ te min kɔb abɛ zhib!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47" />Kɔ te bɛr ta yi a zen tsar ne Akabakɔŋ. Ndi amɛ ngɔŋ ine na ndum kǝ Arik, abɛ tsar zhi lɛ cɛr Musa, bǝn acicɛ nuŋkub awɔb ankɔŋ ane ŋunu. <verse eid="LUK 19:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48" />Ne wɔb ki nau alakakna akana, te ilɛ maa ne baŋ asusun aneshir.<verse eid="LUK 19:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20" />
  <para style="s">Akyak tanyɛme ne mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ Yesɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1" />Iber nuŋ yime, Yesɔ azǝne tsar aneshir te na bla ba lɛ didik, ne iki kɛ ku ayi, ankyak ngɔŋ ine na ndum kǝ Arik, ben abɛ tsar kenlɛ yi cɛr Musa, a gar bene bɔu. <verse eid="LUK 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2" />&lt;&lt;Bla ta ai mgbyamgbyaŋ ta kɛ u na iki yiŋɛ ne kǝ,&gt;&gt; te di. &lt;&lt;Ai ŋɔwa ne nugu mgbyamgbyaŋ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3" />A di ba, &lt;&lt;M tei na rib zhin. Blam azhin, <verse eid="LUK 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4" />Isu aneshir ne amashir iyi Yɔɔna, ire shu ka rɛ bene aneshir nii?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5" />Akɔ lɛ ne akpaa men te di, &lt;&lt;Ta te di, &lt;Ire shu,&gt; Atei rib ta, &lt;Tǝ nii yar zhin tanyɛmɛ bǝn Yɔɔna?&gt; <verse eid="LUK 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6" />Fe na ta te di, &lt;Ire bene aneshir,&gt; aneshir bɔbɔk atei tyak ta ne mkpaŋ, te aneshir bɔbɔk ne tanyɛmɛ te Yɔɔna ayi ine bla shar yi Arik.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7" />Fe akɔ diu, &lt;&lt;Bata ne zhi ka are amɛ ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8" />Yesɔ adi ba, &lt;&lt;Nga muŋ yi bam bla zhin kai mgbyamgbyaŋ ta kɛ mna ki yiŋɛ ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nkan lɛ yi ne sɔŋ ne kɔb kɛ yaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9" />Akɔ bla ba nkanlɛ te di: &lt;&lt;Ner nuŋ ne lɔn ahwaŋ inabi ama, te baŋu nek anuŋ te bɛ bene tɔu newu, te lu kɔmɔ ne tsǝn gbagbaŋ ndi ba ne wɔ ŋyak ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10" />Nǝ mkpaŋ kɛ kye dɔ nkunkunɔ ne te ashar igene amaa te bɛ ta dɔ nkunkunɔ a gliu ma. Ankyak abɛ na ndum ne ahwaŋa avuŋ anu tsik te duŋɔ ŋuro kama kɔmɔ aŋɔk akluklu. <verse eid="LUK 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11" />Ana shar igen nuŋ iwa mayi ne na vuŋɔ tsik azhɔk ishisha te duŋɔ kɔmɔ aŋɔk akluklu. <verse eid="LUK 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12" />Atara na shar gen nen tar, avuŋ anu tsik ashur amkpaa te yaru tibɛ.<verse eid="LUK 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13" />&lt;&lt;Fe akiki ne ahwaŋa adi, &lt;M tei na kikinei? M tei shar izu muŋ, waŋ ndi mne tanyɛme bene abɛba; kai tɔu ashaga yi.<verse eid="LUK 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14" />&lt;&lt;Ndi amɛ abɛ na ndumo ne yigu, tɛ ru. &lt;Waŋa ayi zu maa,&gt; adi. &lt;Duŋ tabǝ ŋunu, ahwaŋ Tetɛɛ maa ai ka yi amɔr.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15" />Fe akɔ tsǝgu agli rumɔ ne ahwaŋ te ŋunu te baŋu tyak zhɔk ne goŋ ganki kɛ arumɔ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:15">&lt;&lt;Yesɔ arib, iner ne ahwaŋa atei na ba kikini? <verse eid="LUK 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16" />Ataki ne ahwaŋa atei nyɛ ŋlɔk anere te baŋ ahwaŋa nek anuŋ.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:16">Ndi aneshir ne wɔ bla yiŋɛ, akɔdi, &lt;&lt;Bata ben te kinuŋ bǝ yeme ba!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17" />Ankyak Yesɔ alǝk ayi atɔ bama te rib, &lt;&lt;Fe bla me zhin kiyiŋ ndi ne icɛre te di:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:17">&lt;&lt;&lt;Mkpaŋ yiŋ ndi abɛ mee ne kyagǝ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:17">Ayi ne anyage ne nju ki&gt;?<verse eid="LUK 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18" />Iwaŋ ndi ate zhaku ne mkpaŋa, atei tsik amlik. Ama waŋ ndi mkpaŋa te zhaku ne tu maa, atei te mbumbur ndi mumuŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19" />Abɛ tsar tsar nkanlɛ kɛ Arik bǝn ngɔŋ ine na ndum kǝ Arik ne wɔb ankɔŋ ne vuŋu andanda, te ne zhi te ilɛ kɛ bla maa iyi ne atu amen. Ndi amɛ azǝn klu sisik aneshir.<verse eid="LUK 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iyah Kaisar Gandu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20" />Azǝn zib aza maa, te bene aduŋ anuŋ azǝn ŋubu te na kamgli te di aba ye abɛ na lɛ didik, te aba abɛ vuŋu ne nkanlɛ maa te abaŋu anǝk angɔngɔŋ te duŋ abɛ teu ambuk. <verse eid="LUK 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21" />Izhiin ne min mine aribu tedi: &lt;&lt;Nǝ tsar, tani zhi teu lɛ tena tsar ikiyiŋ ndi rɛ, bau na nyer tu mi naŋ nuŋ ba, ubla ilɛ kɛ Arik anenen. <verse eid="LUK 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22" />Ire te ta bǝ yaa Kaisar gendui?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23" />Yesɔ ne tɔ ba aklɛ te di ba, <verse eid="LUK 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24" />&lt;&lt;Tsar me zhin zɔb. Ayi izhu bǝn cɛr yi ŋɔwa isɔŋ ne zɔbɔ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:24">&lt;&lt;Kaisar&gt;&gt; akɔ diu. <verse eid="LUK 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25" />Yesɔ a di ba, &lt;&lt;Fe nek zhin Kaisar ki yiŋ ndi iyi Kaisar, nek zhin Arik iki yiŋ ndi iyi Arik.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26" />Ilɛ maa iduŋ ba awɔb ankɔŋ ane vuŋu alakane ne du aneshir. Ilɛ maa duŋ ba shur ayu, bane na di kinuŋ ba.<verse eid="LUK 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ikamlu ben ŋaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27" />Sadukiyawa anuŋ abaŋ ndi adi ina kam lu ndi neshir ate ku ba yime ba, anyɛ rib Yesɔ. <verse eid="LUK 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28" />&lt;&lt;Ine Tsar, &lt;&lt;Musa ne cɛr te di, ner ate ku yaŋ vǝvǝn ben wa maa, izu mǝne abɛ ta uwa kɔmɔ te ŋlii zumen amumun. <verse eid="LUK 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29" />Fe amunwa amɛ taŋgba. Ine kuti me ne ta iwa ma te lɔ te ku ayaŋ vǝvǝn. <verse eid="LUK 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30" />Ine yaa maa nena tau, <verse eid="LUK 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31" />ne ntar ma nena tau, amɛ itaŋgba mǝne ne ku bɔbɔk iyaŋ amumun. <verse eid="LUK 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32" />Ankyak, iwama ne aku mayi. <verse eid="LUK 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33" />Azizaŋ fa, ne mkpaŋ kɛ kam lu abɛ ku, iwama atei yi ayou ŋɔwa ndi ne ŋa ba bɔbɔk mene?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34" />Yesɔ adi, &lt;&lt;Anere abɛ mkpaŋ kǝŋe alulum ata mbǝmba te na gar ŋa. <verse eid="LUK 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35" />Fena abaŋ ndi ne mla tɔ shak ayi ne mkpaŋ yuŋɔ ba tei na kama lu ba tei ta amba ba ne min kɛ abaŋ ndi neka ku batei na ta mbǝmba ba ben abɛ gar ŋa. <verse eid="LUK 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36" />Fe ba tei na ku ba; ne kam ate ndi abɛ shar ayou Arik. Ayi amumun abɛ Arik, ndi ayi ne min kɛ abɛ tei kama lu. <verse eid="LUK 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37" />Nǝ atu ayi igɔŋ zizik, Musa ne bla ilɛ kɛ kpo tuk te di abɛ ku atei kama lu, amkpa waŋ ndi ne zhɔ Arik, &lt;Arik ayou Ibrai, ben Arik ayou Ishaku, ben Arik ayou Yakubu.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38" />Ba yi Arik abɛ ku ba, ayi ayou aner abɛ vli ben abɔu bɔbɔk avli.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39" />Fe abɛ tsar Atɔra a tanyɛme te di, &lt;&lt;Ine tsar une bla anenen!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40" />Ne muɔ fe nuŋ ba ne na rib bu kinuŋ ba.<verse eid="LUK 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesɔ mɔ ayi zu ŋɔɔ?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41" />Fe Yesɔ ne di ba, &lt;&lt;Ayi anii duŋ ba di Yesɔ mɔ ayi zeu Doda? <verse eid="LUK 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42" />Dauda ne tu maa ne cɛr yi Zabura ne di:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:42">&lt;&lt;&lt;Arik ne di ngɔŋ amuŋ:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:42">&lt;&lt;Zǝ sɔŋ ne ŋɔk li muŋ<verse eid="LUK 20:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:43" />Mte duŋ abɛ kyagu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:43">Utei caŋ ba ne aza mi.&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:43" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44" />Doda ne zhɔu te di &lt;Ngɔŋ amuŋ.&gt; Atei na kikin te yi vǝvǝn amaa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45" />Ndi aneshir bɔbɔk ne zin wɔu, Yesɔ adi abɛ tsene maa te di, <verse eid="LUK 20:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46" />&lt;&lt;Izhin bǝ te zee bene abɛ tsar Atɔra, abɛ tsen ne nklunklu gɔngɔŋ te zǝ ntuntun bǝn abɛ li dub, abɛ wɔb mkpemkpa yi sɔŋ didik ne akaba, bǝn mkpemkpa yi abɛ tɔ shak ayi ne gyaŋ. <verse eid="LUK 20:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47" />Alɔm amba kɔ ne kɔbɔ men te anyer baŋ mkpaŋ te ben Arik. Atei sak aner abaŋa iya ngɔŋ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21" />
  <para style="s">Nǝk yi wakɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1" />Ndi Yesɔ ne lik tu te yik aner abɛ yi adudunki ne azǝn shur azɔb ne mgbo yi shur azɔb ne Akabakɔŋ. <verse eid="LUK 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2" />Ne na yik wakɔ ne anyɛ shur anini me yaa. <verse eid="LUK 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3" />Fe Yesɔ adi ba, &lt;&lt;M bla zhin lɛ didik,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;te ki yiŋ ndi wakɔ waŋa ne nege ne naŋ ki yiŋ ndi abɛ adudunki ne nege. <verse eid="LUK 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4" />Bɔbɔk aneshir abaŋa nɛ nǝk ne min kɛ adudunki amen ,ama iwakɔ waŋ ne yaa maa ne nǝk bɔbɔk iki yiŋ ndi yi ma vuŋ kɛ li kili maa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngir mkpaŋ kɛ klɛtu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5" />Fe anuŋ ne min kɛ abɛ zǝ Yesɔ azǝn tɔ ir keŋ ndi ne mee Akabakɔŋ ne Mkpaŋ didik yi laŋ, ben kiki yiŋ ndi ne nek Arik ne yi. Ama Yesɔ adi, <verse eid="LUK 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6" />&lt;&lt;Atei iki yiŋ ndi izhin zen tɔi ma, mkpaŋ tei nyɛ ndi ba mkpaŋ ndi tei sɔŋ nǝ nuŋ ndi ba tei varǝ ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7" />Aneshire arib Yesɔ te di,&lt;&lt;Ine tsar,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;ayi atǝnta iki yiŋɛ tei na? Tǝ anii tei tsar ta ngir ndi kiki yiŋɛ tei na?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8" />Fe Yesɔ asaga: &lt;&lt;Hria zhin ayi kǝr nuŋ abɛ lɔm zhin ba. Tǝ aneshir tetɛk atei nyɛ ne sak muŋ, te di zhin, &lt;ŋgam myi wa,&gt; te, mkpaŋa iyi gbahir.&gt; Duŋ zǝ zhine ba ba. <verse eid="LUK 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9" />Fena adi ba, izhin te wɔ a tei kum ben gaaŋa, duŋ te zhin sisik ba, te kiyiŋɛ itei na fe mkpaŋ kɛ klɛ tu bane zen ye ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10" />Fe Yesɔ adi, &lt;&lt;Ntun ngɔŋ itei wɔb mgbu ben ntun ngɔŋ, fe ikɔb ŋgɔŋ itei wɔb mgbu ben kɔb ŋgɔŋ. <verse eid="LUK 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11" />Izhaŋ gɔnmimi ngɔŋ itei yime, ijɔŋ bǝn yik iya itei na yime ne mkpǝmkpa tetɛk, a tei na kiki yi nek sisik bǝn ki ngɔngɔŋ yi rɛ shu.<verse eid="LUK 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12" />&lt;&lt;Ama ndi ki yiŋɛ te tei na, atei vu zhin tei sak zhin iyah. Atei Gli zhin te nek ne akaba ben jaru, te vu zhin te gar ben atum ben angɔŋgɔŋ abɛ Gli aneshir, ne tu yi sak muŋ. <verse eid="LUK 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13" />Waŋa tei yi zhin ankɔŋ ane bla ba lɛ didik. <verse eid="LUK 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14" />Ama izhin bɛ kpa susun min, duŋ di zhin anii ta tei bla te ta atu amɔr shur. <verse eid="LUK 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15" />Ai nga M tei nek zhin mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ lɛ ben zhi lɛ ndi abɛ zor amin ba tei klɛ te gaaŋa bene bɛ zhin ba. <verse eid="LUK 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16" />Ane tetɛɛ min atei baŋ zhin lɛb, a muŋ zumin, aner abǝ kɔ min, ben akpǝkpa min, atei vuŋ zhin te ŋlɔk anuŋ ne min mine. <verse eid="LUK 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17" />Aneshir atei kyak zhin ne tɔ yi sak muŋ. <verse eid="LUK 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18" />Ama fumfuk tu min zhiin ba tei tun. <verse eid="LUK 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19" />Ne kli mgbamgbaŋ min iyi itei gli zhin gli rumɔ.<verse eid="LUK 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20" />&lt;&lt;Izhin tei yik abɛ te ikum akam aku Urshelima, izhin tei zhi mkpaŋ kɛ kam ku maa ne nyɛ. <verse eid="LUK 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21" />Abaŋ ndi ayi ne ntun yi Yahudiya, abɛ klu kɔmɔ ne atu mkpaŋ, abɛ na yi ne min ntun mɔtsɔtsɔb atei ru, abɛ yi ne ntun abɛ duŋ yir min ntun ŋgɔŋ ba. <verse eid="LUK 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22" />Waŋa ayi mkpaŋ kɛŋ ndi atei yik iya ndi ne mǝne cɛr. <verse eid="LUK 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23" />Iya tei yi kikin ne bǝn ben amba abɛ ane, ben abɛ so amumun ne mkpaŋ yuŋɔ, iyah ngɔŋ itei vuŋ gɔnmimi ben mfu kɛ Arik ben aneshir abaŋa. <verse eid="LUK 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24" />A tei ŋlɔk anuŋ ne kab tena vuŋ anuŋ te kɔmɔ ne amkpa ane sak yaa ne tuntun bɔbɔk. Abɛ yaŋ zǝ Arik a tei caŋ Urshelima kɔmɔ ne Amkpaŋ kɛ klɛ tu.<verse eid="LUK 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25" />&lt;&lt;Atei yik ngir ne arik, ihwa ben cinces. Nǝ gɔnmimi, aneshir abɛ tuntun atei te sisik tena wɔ igɔ ben gwu nek ngɔŋ. <verse eid="LUK 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26" />Alulum atei ku asǝ ne sisik, ben ku azhizhi ne kiki yiŋ ndi zen nyɛ ne gɔnmimi, te ki goŋgɔŋ iyi gbarshu itei jaŋ. <verse eid="LUK 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27" />Nǝ mkpaŋ yuŋɔ ateishe yik Izu Neshir anyɛ ne min kɛ ngungu ben mgbyamgbyaŋ bǝn ngɔŋ tetɛk. <verse eid="LUK 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28" />Ndi kiki yiŋɛ zǝn na, lu klɛ te nab zhin atu, te ta zhin zhɔk ne ka nyɛ gbahir.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29" />Yesɔ abla ba nkanlɛ yiŋɛ: &lt;&lt;Tɔ zhin tiŋ nglǝnglǝ bǝn a tiŋe kuŋkun bɔbɔk. <verse eid="LUK 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30" />Izhin te yige atɔ amgba, izhin tei yik kiki min te zhi ikus ne te gbahir. <verse eid="LUK 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31" />Neme ndi zhin te yik kiki yiŋɛ na me, izhin bǝ zhi nyɛ Arik ne te gbahir.<verse eid="LUK 21:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32" />&lt;&lt;Mbla zhin lɛ didik, mkpaŋ kǝŋe ba tei klɛtu ba, se kiki yiŋɛ nena baliŋ. <verse eid="LUK 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33" />Igbarshu bǝn gɔnmimi tei klɛtu, ilɛ muŋ ba tei klɛtu ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34" />&lt;&lt;Zhin bǝ shur kpa, te asusun min atei kɔmɔ ne kiki yi tik ayi, amkpa ane so ki rǝrǝ ben kiki yi men yi gɔŋmimi, te bɛr yuŋɔ itei nyɛ ku zhin nyak ndi agamdi. <verse eid="LUK 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35" />Iyi ndi atsitaŋ. Tǝ tei nyɛ ne tu abaŋ ndi akɔ sɔŋ ne ti kɛ gɔnmimi bɔbɔk <verse eid="LUK 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36" />kɔte mkpaŋ takɛ izhin bɛ blɛ, tena ben Arik ndi zhin tei gli atu amin rumɔ ne kiki zen na yiŋɛ, te zhin bǝ kli ne tii kɛ Izu Neshir.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37" />Kɔte bɛr tayi Yesɔ azǝn tsar ne Akabakɔŋ, fe kɔte amgbalu atawa ana te kur ne mkpaŋ yiŋ ndi azhɔi te mkpaŋ yi Zetun, <verse eid="LUK 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38" />fe amblimblɛ bib aneshir bɔbɔk ne nyɛ bene bɔu ne Akabakɔŋ te zen wɔu.<verse eid="LUK 21:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22" />
  <para style="s">Yahuda ne ta Anyeme te wa bǝ baŋ Yesɔ Alɛb</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1" />Ndi, igyaŋ yi tuk glak, ne nyɛ. <verse eid="LUK 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2" />Fe ngɔŋ ine na ndum kǝ Arik ben abɛ tsar cɛr yi Musa a zin wɔb alɛla ndi aba tei ŋunu Yesɔ, ama a klu sisik aneshir. <verse eid="LUK 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3" />Fe shetan ne yir Yahuda, waŋ ndi azhɔu te Iskariyɔti, izhin ne min kɛ a wur ane yaa baŋa. <verse eid="LUK 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4" />Fe Yahuda ne kɔmɔ te te lɛ bin bǝn ngɔŋ ine na ndum kǝ Arik ben angɔŋgɔŋ abɛ blɛ ne Akabaŋkɔŋ te lɛ biŋ ndi wa atei vuŋ Yesɔ alɛb ba. <verse eid="LUK 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5" />Fe ne nyɛr ne susun men te na tanyɛme aba te nǝgu azɔb te bɛ vuŋu anǝk ba. <verse eid="LUK 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6" />Akɔ ta anyɛ me, fe akɔ wɔb ankɔŋ ane vuŋ Yesɔ anǝk ba ne akpa waŋ ndi aneshir tetɛk ba yime ba.<verse eid="LUK 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ili kili yi amgbalu yi klɛ tu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7" />Ankyak iber yi kili yi yaŋ saŋ ne nyɛ, iber yi yak nklu ne ituk amkpur. <verse eid="LUK 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8" />Fe Yesɔ ne shar ane Biturus bǝn Yɔɔna te di ba, &lt;&lt;kɔmɔ zhin te kɔte na kili yi igyaŋ yi tuk glak.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9" />Ankyak a diu te di, &lt;&lt;Uwɔb te ta bǝ kɔ te nai ne me?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10" />Fe Yesɔ a di ba, &lt;&lt;Izhin te nak yir ntuno, izhin tei mla bǝn ineshir nuŋ atsine hru mkpalɛn amashir, izhin bɛ zeu kɔmɔ ne kɔb kɛŋ ndi atei yire, <verse eid="LUK 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11" />Izhin bǝ di ataki ne kɔbɔ, &lt;Ine tsar a di, iki kɛ kur acɛn iyi ne mee, amkpa waŋ ndi M tei li kili bǝn abɛ tsene amuŋ?&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12" />A tei tsar zhin iki nuŋ ngɔŋ ndi ne amɛ nuŋ asak ne tu mɔ, ne na kiki didik a nyak ne ki me. Ayi amɔ zhin tei na amkpama.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13" />Fe ne kɔmɔ gar ayik ikime ir keŋ ndi Yesɔ ne bla bama. Amɛ ne na kili igyaŋ yi tuk glak.<verse eid="LUK 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14" />Ndi mkpaŋa ne te, Yesɔ ne zǝ asɔŋ te zin li kili ben abɛ tsene maa. <verse eid="LUK 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15" />Fe Yesɔ di ba, &lt;&lt;Mǝ ne men wɔb te me li kili iyi igyaŋ yi tuk glak bene abɛ zhin tem M ka shi yik iyah. <verse eid="LUK 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16" />Mmen bla zhin, Bam tei na li kili yi igyaŋ yi tuk glak nuŋ bǝn abɛ zhin ba se ne ikɔb Arik.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17" />Ndi ne baŋ kuca ma, te nyɛr Arik te di, &lt;&lt;Ta zhin waŋa te gab ne akpamin. <verse eid="LUK 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18" />Tǝm bla zhin, baŋ rɛ azizaŋ, bam tei na so ama dɔ nkunkun ba se ta ne kɔmɔ ne ikɔb kǝ Arik.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19" />Fe abaŋ drugba, te nyer Arik, te amun kɛ te nek ba te di &lt;&lt;Waŋa ayi kpamuŋ mnǝk zhin, na zhin amɛ te zhin bǝ bǝn shum zhi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20" />Ne mee, ndi ne ta bɔbɔk ne baŋ kuca ma te di &lt;&lt;Kuca kǝŋe iyi kɛ lɛ yayas kɛ kpa nyak min ne azhizhi amuŋ, ndi ne anugu ne tu amin. <verse eid="LUK 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21" />Ama tɔ waŋ ndi atei baŋ me alɛb azǝn li agbǝgba azhin bene abɛm. <verse eid="LUK 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22" />Izu neshir atei kɔmɔ ir keŋ ndi ne nyak, ne me waŋ ndi atei baŋu alɛb abɛ zhin azhɔk tu maa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23" />Fe a rib akpa men ayi ŋɔwa ne min mɔrɔ a tei na ki yiŋɛ<verse eid="LUK 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24" />Fe a yir nga aŋa ne kpa men, ne tu ayi ŋɔwa atei yi ŋgɔŋ ne min mǝne. <verse eid="LUK 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25" />Yesɔ adi ba, &lt;&lt;Atum abaŋ ndi bai ŋli Yahudawa ba atsar ba mgbyamgbyaŋ; abɛ klik naŋ ba azho atu amen te abɛ lɔk aneshir. <verse eid="LUK 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26" />Ama kǝr izhin bǝ duŋǝ amɛ ba. Ne me iwaŋ ndi ate ayi ngɔŋ ne min mine abɛ kama na tu maa te vǝtsɔb, Waŋ ndi agli aneshir abɛ te ndi igen. <verse eid="LUK 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27" />Ŋɔwa ayi ngɔŋɔ, waŋ ndi ne zǝ sɔŋ te li kili kɔ ne gab kili me? Ba yi waŋ ndi azesɔŋ te li kili me ka yi? Mǝ yi bene bɛ zhin ndi igen ne gab kili. <verse eid="LUK 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28" />Ayi zhine ba nǝ kli ne mkpaŋ ne yik yaa muŋ. <verse eid="LUK 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29" />Ndi Tetɛɛ muŋ ne nǝm Tum, amɛ, nga mǝna nek zhin, <verse eid="LUK 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30" />te izhin bǝ li te na so bene bɛm ne ikɔb muŋ, te na sɔŋ bene bɛm ne kɔmuŋ te na sɔŋ ne mben, tena te nŋli wur ane aya kɛ Isrela ŋas.<verse eid="LUK 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31" />&lt;&lt;Biturus, Biturus, shetan ne wɔb te wa abɛ zɛu ndi alikama. <verse eid="LUK 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32" />Mne ben ne atu ami, Biturus, te nǝk tu mi bɛ klik. Ndi ite kam nyak, ubɛ lɔk amunzumin te abɛ klik susun.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33" />Biturus a tanyɛme te di, &lt;&lt;Ŋgɔŋ, nga M tei zeu kɔmɔ ne jaru te tabǝ ku bene bɔu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34" />Yesɔ adi, &lt;&lt;Mblau, Biturus, aliŋe utei tun zhim mkpaŋ atar te agbak abɛ shi atuk&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35" />Ankyak Yesɔ arib ba, &lt;&lt;Ndi mǝne shar zhin yaŋ abu, mgbɔ kɔ akpaza, zhin ne yaŋ ikinuŋ yi?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:35">Adi, &lt;&lt;Ba ta ne yaŋ kinuŋ ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36" />Yesɔ a di ba, &lt;&lt;Ama azizaŋa utǝ yi ne abu, baŋu, ben mgbɔ; Te yi ndi bau te yi ne anzigba ba, baŋ anklu azhin ami lɛb te lɛb anzigba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37" />Ne cɛr te di: &lt;Nǝ blau zhɔk ne min abɛ la lɛ&gt;; Mne mbla zhin iki yiŋɛ itei shaga ne atu amuŋ. Iye amɛ, ki yiŋ ndi ne cɛrǝ ne atu amuŋ nyɛ shaga.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38" />Fe abɛ zǝu tsǝn adi, &lt;&lt;Tɔ, Ŋgɔŋ, tɔ nzizi gba yaa yiŋ&gt;&gt; Adi ba &lt;&lt;ne mla amɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesɔ ne ben Arik ne gbu yi zaitun</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39" />Yesɔ ne ru ndi abene tsǝne rumɔ te gar igbu yi zetun, Abɛ tsene maa ne zeu. <verse eid="LUK 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40" />Ndi ne yir amkpa ma, adi ba te di, &lt;&lt;Ben zhin Arik te kǝr zhin bǝ zhaku ne ki yi tik yi ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:40" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40" />Ndi ne yir amkpa ma, adi ba te di, &lt;&lt;Ben zhin Arik te kǝr zhin bǝ zhaku ne ki yi tik yi ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41" />Fe ne tib aru ben abɛba, te tar agbarum te ben Arik te di, <verse eid="LUK 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42" />&lt;&lt;Tetɛɛ, utǝ tanyɛme, bǝ baŋ kuca kǝŋe Gli dɛm ma; Ne me bai yik muŋ ba, amaa bǝ yi yik mi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43" />Fe ne shar ayou Arik arɛ gbarshu azǝ akli bǝn abɔu te nǝgu mgbyamgbyaŋ. <verse eid="LUK 22:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44" />Nǝ min kɛ yik ya, ne nǝk tu ne ben Arik, akli amaa ne hrie ne mimi ndi andɔŋ azhizhi.<verse eid="LUK 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45" />Ndi ne lu ne amkpa ne ben Arik, ne kam agar ben abɛ tsene maa, ayik ba azǝn kurna, Sisik ne shak ba kpa. <verse eid="LUK 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46" />Arib ba te di&lt;&lt;Izhin kurna iye ni? lu zhin te ben zhin Arik te kǝr zhin bɛ zhaku ne iki yi tik ayi ba&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ne vuŋ Yesɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47" />Ndi aneyi ne min kɛ lɛ ntsan aneshir akɔ muŋ aru, fe ner nuŋ ndi azhɔu te Yahuda, izhin ne awur ane aya, wa agli ba. Ndi ne te gbahir ben Yesɔ arimu agli, <verse eid="LUK 22:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48" />ankyak Yesɔ aribu, &lt;&lt;Yahuda, urim me gli te shi baŋ Izu neshir lɛb?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49" />Ndi abɛ zǝ Yesɔ&gt; ayik kiyiŋ ndi tei na, adi &lt;&lt;Ŋgɔŋ, ta bɛ tsi ba ne anzigba amɔr yi?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50" />Izhin ne min mǝne a tsem igen ayou ngɔŋ ine na ndum kǝ Arik, te sɛr tɔŋ kɛ ŋɔk li maa akyaŋ.<verse eid="LUK 22:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51" />Ankyak Yesɔ adi ba te di, &lt;&lt;Duŋ na zhin amɛ ba!&gt;&gt; Akɔ sagu ŋɔk ne tɔŋ ma te duŋu are.<verse eid="LUK 22:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52" />Fe Yesɔ adi ngɔŋ ine na ndum kǝ Arik, angɔngɔŋ abɛ Akabakɔŋ ben anunkub, abaŋ ndi ne nyɛ vuŋu, &lt;&lt;Me yi ne na ki mimin, te zhin nyɛ ne nzinzigba bǝn amkpɔgoki? <verse eid="LUK 22:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53" />Yesɔ adi myi bǝn abɛ zhin kɔ te bɛr tayi ne miŋ akabakɔŋ, ba zhin ne vuŋ me ba. Waŋa ayi zhin mkpaŋ min ndi ibu ne ta amkpa ma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Biturus ne tun zhi Yesɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54" />Fe a kɔ te vuŋ, te gliu te kɔmɔ, te gliu te gar kɔb kɛ ngɔŋ ine na ndum kǝ Arik. Biturus ne tsǝne zǝu gbagbaŋ. <verse eid="LUK 22:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55" />Ndi ne mɔk lu ne min akabakɔŋ te azǝ asɔŋ ndɔndɔ, Biturus anyɛ azǝ ba azǝ asɔŋ. <verse eid="LUK 22:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56" />Vǝvǝn wanuŋ ndi ayi igen ayik Biturus akɔ sɔŋ ayik ilu mɔ. A shuru ayi par te di, &lt;&lt;Iner waŋa ayi ben a bɔu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57" />Ama a tun te di, &lt;&lt;Vǝn wa, Bam ne zhiu ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58" />Ne mkpaŋ wa watsɔb inuŋ a tara yigu te di, &lt;&lt;Uyi zhin ne miŋ mǝne.&gt;&gt; Biturus adi &lt;&lt;Ner waŋa, Ba ayi nga ba!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59" />Ne na baŋ mkpaŋ izhin nuŋ ana diu, &lt;&lt;Iye amɛ ner waŋa ane yi bǝn abɔu, ayi ner ne Galili.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60" />Biturus a di, &lt;&lt;Ner waŋa, bam ne zhi kiyiŋ ndi ublai ma ba! &gt;&gt; Ndi ayi ne min kɛ lɛ, agbak aku atuk. <verse eid="LUK 22:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61" />Fe ŋgɔŋɔ alǝk ayi ashur Biturus. Biturus a kɔ shu azhi ilɛ keŋ ndi ŋgɔŋ ane blau te di: &lt;&lt;Utei tun zhim amkpaŋ atar te agbak abɛ shi atuk.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62" />Fe akɔ ru abɛm te zhin gbomgboŋ.<verse eid="LUK 22:62" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abɛ blɛ ne zhab Yesɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63" />Aner abaŋ ndi ablɛ Yesɔ akɔ zhabu te tsǝgu. <verse eid="LUK 22:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64" />Ne kpau amacincii, te di, &lt;&lt;Bla ta! Ayi ŋɔwa aŋuru?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65" />Te na blau lǝlɛ mimin te bene yenu.<verse eid="LUK 22:65" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesɔ ne ti kɛ Bilatus ben Hiridus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66" />Ndi bɛr ne ŋan isɔŋ kɛ anuŋkub, ngɔŋ ine na ndum kǝ Arik bene abɛ tsar cɛr yi Musa, ne biŋ, Ne Gli Yesɔ anyɛ bene ba. <verse eid="LUK 22:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67" />Adi, &lt;&lt;Te yi ndi wa uyi Kristi me,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;bla ta.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:67">Yesɔ adi ba, &lt;&lt;Me ntǝ bla zhin, ba zhin tei tanyɛmɛ ba, <verse eid="LUK 22:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68" />me te rib zhin, ba zhin tei tanyɛm ma ba. <verse eid="LUK 22:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69" />Ne mee vuŋ rɛ azizaŋ te kɔmɔ ne ti, Izu neshir atei sɔŋ ne mgbyamgbyaŋ ne ŋɔk li kɛ Arik.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70" />Akɔ rib bɔbɔk mǝne te di, &lt;&lt;Uyi Izu Arik yi?&gt;&gt; Yesɔ a tanyɛme te di, &lt;&lt;Izhin ne bla anenen te me yi wa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:70" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71" />Fe adi, &lt;&lt;Ta na wɔb anii ne tu maa? Ta ne wɔ ilɛ kǝŋ ndi ru rɛ anu amaa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1" />Fe abɛ ŋas alu klɛ bɔbɔk mǝne te gliu te kɔmɔ ben Bilatus. <verse eid="LUK 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2" />Fe azeu ne wɔbo akla, tedi, &lt;&lt;Tani wɔ neshir waŋa azǝn la ntun mɔrɔ. Ayara ne ya gendu iye kaisar tena di wa ayi Kristi, Itum&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3" />Fe Bilatus a rib Yesɔ, &lt;&lt;Uyi Itum ne Yahudawa yi?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:3">&lt;&lt;Mm, ndi une bla,&gt;&gt; Yesɔ tanyɛme.<verse eid="LUK 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4" />Fe Bilatus abla ngɔŋ ine na ndum kǝ Arik bǝn aneshir te di, &lt;&lt;Bam ne vuŋ iner waŋa ne lalɛ nuŋ ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5" />Fena akyak, &lt;&lt;Azǝn lɛk asusun aneshir bɔbɔk ne Yahudiya ne tsar maa. Ne baŋ are ben Galili te kam aŋyak ayaŋa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6" />Ndi ne wɔ me, Bilatus ne rib ka iner waŋa ayi awɔ ne Galili. <verse eid="LUK 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7" />Ndi ne wɔ te Yesɔ ayi ne aŋɔk kɛ Hiridus, fe akɔ turu akɔmɔ bǝn Hiridus, waŋ ndi ayi ne Urshelima ne kpaŋa.<verse eid="LUK 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8" />Ndi Hiridus ne yik Yesɔ, ne nyer ngɔŋ, ne baŋ mkpaŋ te azǝn wɔb te wa abɛ yigu, ne baŋ mkpaŋ azǝn wɔ kiki yi na maa, awɔb te wa abɛ na yik ki ngɔngɔŋ iyi vuŋ anu ben Yesɔ. <verse eid="LUK 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9" />Fe Hiridus ne rib bu kiki tetɛk, Yesɔ bane sagu ma ba. <verse eid="LUK 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10" />Ngɔŋ ine na ndum kǝ Arik ben abɛ tsar atɔra ane cɛr Musa ne klikli amɔ, te azǝn sagu iyah te bla kiki mimin ne tɔ maa. <verse eid="LUK 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11" />Fe Hiridus ben abɛ kpaakpa maa azǝn sagu iyah te zen mlagu. Ne suu kiki didik, te kama gliu te kɔmɔ ben Bilatus <verse eid="LUK 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12" />Nǝ bere Hiridus bǝn Bilatus nɛ yi akpa; ne bǝne tǝ zor ne akpa mɛn.<verse eid="LUK 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13" />Bilatus ne zhɔ angɔngɔŋ abɛ na ndum Arik abiŋ, ben abɛ gli aneshir, <verse eid="LUK 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14" />te na diba, &lt;&lt;Izhin ne gli iner waŋa igli nyɛmɛ ndi azǝn shɔk aneshir abɛ wɔb akla. Nga mne rib bu ne ti min bam ne vuŋu ne lalɛ nuŋ ba. <verse eid="LUK 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15" />Tǝ vuŋ Hiridus maayi, ba ne Vuŋu ne kinuŋ ba te gliu aŋuru kama Gli tama; ndi izhin yik bane na kinuŋ ndi ne mla abɛ ŋunu ba. <verse eid="LUK 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16" />Tǝ yeme, M tei duŋ a shuru a sisa te zhɔ gu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:17" />Nǝ mkpaŋ kɛ na gyaŋ M tei zhɔk zhin neshir zhiin ne miŋ abaŋ ndi ne kpaba,<verse eid="LUK 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18" />Ne kɔr zhin ne ŋar kɔr, &lt;&lt;Abɛ baŋ ner waŋa agli atibe! Te zhɔk ta Barabas!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19" />(Barabas ne zhɔ gu ne jaru ne lɛ keŋ ndi ne te tsik ŋgbuu ne ntun,te ne tsik ner nuŋ aŋun.)<verse eid="LUK 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20" />Ne wɔb te bɛ zhɔk Yesɔ, Bilatus ne na lɛ bene bɛba. <verse eid="LUK 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21" />Fe aneshire akyak te ŋur ruru te di, &lt;&lt;Kpaŋ zhine wu! Kpaŋ zhine wu!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22" />Mkpaŋ kɛ ntar alɛ bene bɛba: &lt;&lt;Anii? Ayi lɛ nii ne la kɛ? Bam ne vuŋu ne lɛ nuŋ keŋ ndi ne mla tǝ bɛ ŋunu ba. M tei duŋ tsǝgu ne asisa te zhɔ gu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23" />Ama ne kɔr ŋgɔŋ azǝn kyak te zen wɔb te bɛ kpaŋu ne kuŋkun, te yaa atɔŋ ŋgɔŋ. <verse eid="LUK 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24" />Ankyak Bilatus anaa ba ki wɔb men. <verse eid="LUK 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25" />A zuk ner ne kur ne jaru m ɔ azhɔk waŋ ndi ne ku ne lalɛ mimin te na ŋun neshir, ayi wa aba ne ta nyɛmɛ bene bɔu, te kama vuŋ Yesɔ wa nek.<verse eid="LUK 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ne kpaŋ Yesɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26" />Ndi ne baŋu agli te ru, avuŋ Siman awɔ ne kurane waŋ ndi atsǝn are ntun nuŋ, a baŋ nkpɔk nkunkun kɛ gen asagu te duŋu gli kɛ te zǝ Yesɔ. <verse eid="LUK 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27" />Ntsan aneshir ne zeu, bene amba a zen zhin te lɔ susun maa. <verse eid="LUK 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28" />Yesɔ akama tɔ tedi ba, &lt;&lt;Izhin aŋɔ abɛ Urshelima, duŋ zhin ne tɔ muŋ ba; izhin bǝ zhin atu min ben amumun amin. <verse eid="LUK 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29" />Mkpaŋ tei nyɛ ndi zhin tei di, &lt;Anu adidik ben amba bǝ sɔŋ klu, ndi ba ne ŋli ba abaŋ ndi bane ma ayak men ba!&gt; <verse eid="LUK 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30" />Fe &lt;&lt;&lt;atei di Igbu ngɔngɔŋ, &lt;&lt;zhaku ne atu amɔr!&gt;&gt; Te na di igbu, &lt;&lt;Bǝ zǝr kuta!&gt;&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31" />Te yi ndi iki anai amee ndi nkunkuŋ nak ri yi shushu, ani tei na tǝ nkunkuŋo te klu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32" />Aneshir anuŋ amɛ yaa, abɛ lalɛ, ne gar ŋlɔk ba ben abɔu. <verse eid="LUK 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33" />Ndi ne kɔte yir amkpawaŋ ndi azhɔu te akpukpo tu, amɔ ne kpaŋu ne mkpɔk kuŋkun kɛ gen, ben abɛ zhib nuŋ ne ŋɔk lii maa, ine yaa maa ne ŋɔk mla. <verse eid="LUK 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34" />Yesɔ adi &lt;&lt;Tetɛɛ, zuk ba zhɔk, te bane zhi kiyiŋ ndi aba nai ba.&gt;&gt; Ne gab nklunklu maa te zhɔk ankeŋkam.<verse eid="LUK 23:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35" />Aneshire aklɛ zen tɔ, fe angɔŋgɔŋ azǝn mlagu. Te di, &lt;&lt;Ne ta anuŋ ashur; duŋu abɛ ta tu maa azhɔk ate yi ndi wa ayi Kristi ayou Arik, waŋ ndi ne hriau. &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36" />Abɛ kpaakpa anyɛ mlagu. Te nǝgu amashir mwamwaŋ <verse eid="LUK 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37" />te di, &lt;&lt;Ate yi ndi uyi itum ane Yahudawa, ta tu mi zhɔk.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38" />Ne cɛr lɛnuŋ asak ne tu maa, ndi icɛre di: &lt;&lt;WAŊA AYI ITUM ANE YAHUDAWA.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39" />Izhin ne min abɛ la lɛme ndi ne kpaŋ ba ne mkpɔk nkuŋkun kɛ gen amɔ ayen Yesɔ, &lt;&lt;Di ka ayi wa yi Kristi mɛ? Ta tu mi zhɔk te na ta ta shur!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40" />Fe izhin ma atsaŋu. &lt;&lt;Bau klu sisik Arik ka,&gt;&gt; a di, &lt;&lt;bɔbɔk mɔrɔ uyik ne kpaŋ ta anenen yi? <verse eid="LUK 23:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41" />Taba ne na ta anenen ne lalɛ mɔr, ai kiyiŋ ndi ta ni nai ayi ne na ta. Ama iner waŋa bene lalɛ ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42" />Fe adi, &lt;&lt;Yesɔ, shum zhi ndi utǝ yir ikɔb ngɔŋ mi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43" />Yesɔ atanyeuma te di, &lt;&lt;Mǝna blau lɛ didik, aliŋe uyi bene bɛm ne amkpa ne kur sik ne gbarshu&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iku kɛ Yesɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44" />Nǝ yi ne tsutsu arik, fe amkpaa akama te buu te ku gɔŋmimi gar zǝ yar Kǝrfe tar kɛ kab arik, <verse eid="LUK 23:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:45" />ilaŋ arik ne gburkli, mplɛ anklu kɛ Akabaŋkɔŋ ne gbuŋa shur yaa. <verse eid="LUK 23:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46" />Yesɔ a lɛk kɔr ne mgbyamgbyaŋ te di, &lt;&lt;Tetɛɛ, ne ŋɔgo mi Mǝne nek izhu muŋ.&gt;&gt; Ndi ne bla me, ivli maa gburkli.<verse eid="LUK 23:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47" />Ndi ngɔŋ ne blɛ amkpama ne yik amɛ, fe akɔ gbar Arik asak tedi, &lt;&lt;Ayi lɛ didik iner waŋa ayi tsetser.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 23:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48" />Ndi aneshir bɔbɔk abaŋ ndi ne gar tɔmɔ ne yik kiyiŋ ndi nena, a ŋur asa amen te kama tibɛ. <verse eid="LUK 23:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49" />Ankyak bɔbɔk abaŋ ndi ne zhiu, ben amba baŋ ndi ne zeu are Galili, ne klɛ gbagbaŋ, te zen tɔ kiki me.<verse eid="LUK 23:49" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iru Yesɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50" />Fe neshir nuŋ waŋa ndi azhɔu te Yusuu, ayi ne min kɛ abɛ te ŋas, ayi neshir didik tena klu sisik Arik, <verse eid="LUK 23:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:51" />Ba ne mǝne tanyɛmɛ ne lɛ mǝne ba ben kiyi na mǝne. Are ntun iyi Yahudawa ne Arimatiya te azǝn ŋub ikɔb ŋgɔŋ kɛ Arik. <verse eid="LUK 23:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52" />Yusuu ne gar ben Bilatus, te ben abɛ nek wa ikum kɛ Yesɔ. <verse eid="LUK 23:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53" />Fe a gli kumɔ azime, te nyɛn kɛ ne mplɛ anklu te baŋu azhɔk ne min bɛ ndi ne sub mkpaŋ iyiŋ ndi ba ne zǝn zhɔk nuŋɔ ba. <verse eid="LUK 23:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54" />Iber yuŋɔ ai bɛr yi ŋub, ibɛr yi sɔŋ sik ne te gbahir<verse eid="LUK 23:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55" />Amba abaŋ ndi ne zǝ Yesɔ are Galili ne zǝ Yusuu te yik ibɛmɛ te yik amkpa waŋ ndi ne zhɔk ikumɔ. <verse eid="LUK 23:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56" />Ankyak amba ma ne kama kɔmɔ, te kɔte wɔb wurdi bǝn anyɛ ane kin. Ne sɔŋ asik ne bɛr yi sɔŋ sik te nek ŋgɔŋ ne ilɛ kǝ kpa nyak.<verse eid="LUK 23:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24" />
  <para style="s">Ilu Yesɔ ne bǝ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1" />Nǝ bɛr yi sɔŋ sik, ne amblimble bib, amba anuŋ ne vu wurdi ndi ne ka nau anyak te kɔmɔ ne bɛmɛ. <verse eid="LUK 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2" />Ne yik ne ŋli mkpaŋa a gli tibɛ ne bɛmɛ. <verse eid="LUK 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3" />Ndi ne yir min bɛme, bane yik ikum kɛ Yesɔ ba. <verse eid="LUK 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4" />Ndi ayi ne min kɛ lɛne ne atɔ yi lu Yesɔ, ankyak aneshir amɛ yaa a kɛ kli gbahir bene bɛba, ne su kiki klikla ndi zar ayi ndi ira nas. <verse eid="LUK 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5" />Fe sisik vuŋ ba, amba ma ne tar agbarum te ku ati amen ne mimi, aneshire a diba tedi, &lt;&lt;Aye anii duŋ zhin wɔb ner ne vli ne min kɛ abɛ ku? <verse eid="LUK 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6" />Yesɔ ba yime ayaŋa ba; ne ka lu! Izhin bǝ shu zhi ne mǝne bla zhin ndi ane yi ben zhin ne Galili: <verse eid="LUK 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7" />&lt;Atei nek Izu Neshir asak ne aŋɔk aner abɛ na zumimin, atei kpaŋu ne nkunkun ne bɛr ntar atei kama lu&gt;&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8" />Fe, akɔ shu lǝlɛ maa azhi.<verse eid="LUK 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9" />Ndi ne ŋuro akam are ibǝ me, a bla awur ane zhin abɛ zeu, ben nki aneshire bɔbɔk. <verse eid="LUK 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10" />Ne yi Meryamu Magadaliya, bǝn Yuwana, ben Meryamu iyah maa Yakubu, bǝn nki amba abaŋ ndi ne yi ben abɛba, ayi aba ne bla abɛ tsene maa. <verse eid="LUK 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11" />Ankyak ba ne tanyɛmɛ ba ne lɛ kɛ amba ma, te lɛ mǝne yi ndi ki sha. <verse eid="LUK 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12" />Ne mee, Biturus ne lu, te klu akɔmɔ ne bɛmɛ, te zǝ adɔ te aklɔtɔ mine, ne yik amplɛ anklu akǝŋ ndi ne ku ma aku akur gar zhin, akama kɔmɔ, te zin bla ki sak ŋɔk ne anu ndi ne na.<verse eid="LUK 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nǝ ankɔŋ ane Imawus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13" />Ne bǝn zhin yiŋɛ aneshir amɛ yaa atsine kɔmɔ ne ntun yi zhɔ sak maa te Imawus ndi ilak ma yi igab taŋgba rɛ Urshelima. <verse eid="LUK 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14" />A zin lɛ ne akpa mɛn ne tu ayi ki yiŋ ndi ne na. <verse eid="LUK 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15" />Ayi ne min kɛ lɛ, te zin lɛ ne kpa ne tu ayi ki yiŋɛ, Yesɔ ne tu maa avu aru te atsǝn bene aba; <verse eid="LUK 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16" />Ama bane ya zhi te ai Yesɔ ba.<verse eid="LUK 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17" />Arib ba tedi, &lt;&lt;Izhin tsǝn lǝlɛ kɛ anii ne kpa min?&gt;&gt; Agbur akli, te akpa ti. <verse eid="LUK 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18" />Izhin ne min mǝne, waŋ ndi azhɔu te Kiliyobas, a tanyɛmɛ te di, &lt;&lt;Ayi wa kiki mi uyi cen ne Urshelima, ndi bau ne zhi kiyiŋ ndi ne na ne amɔ ne bɛr yiŋɛ kai?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19" />Fe adi aner amɛ yaa ma, &lt;&lt;Aye nii ne na?&gt;&gt; Adiu tedi &lt;&lt;Ne tu ayi Yesɔ awɔnǝ Nazara, waŋ ndi ayi ine bla shar yi Arik tena na kiki ngɔngɔŋ ben lǝlɛ didik ye Arik ben aneshir bɔbɔk. <verse eid="LUK 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20" />Ngɔŋ ine na ndum kǝ Arik bǝn abɛ gli ta ne avuŋu anǝk te bɛ aŋunu, te akpaŋu ne kuŋkun. <verse eid="LUK 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21" />Fe ta ne shur ayi te di ayi wa atei ta aner abɛ Isrela azhɔk. Waŋa ayi bɛr yi ntar ndi ki yiŋɛ ne na. <verse eid="LUK 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22" />Ne mee, amba anuŋ ne min mɔrɔ, ne duŋ ta sak aŋɔk ne anu. Ne gar ibɛmɛ amblimblɛ awaŋa. <verse eid="LUK 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23" />Ndi bane yik ikum maa ba, ne ŋur akam, anyɛ bla ta, aba ne yik abɛ shar ayou Arik. Ne bla ba tedi ne ka lu. <verse eid="LUK 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24" />Akpa amɔr anuŋ ndi ne gar bɛ me, ne kɔte yik iyi ndi amba ma ne bla ba, aba menyi ba ne yik kumɔ ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25" />Fe Yesɔ adi ba, &lt;&lt;Izhin abɛ yi bliblik, aneshir abɛ yaŋ zhi abɛ yaŋ tanyɛmɛ ne susun ne ki yiŋ ndi abǝ bla shar yi Arik ne blai! <verse eid="LUK 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26" />Ba rɛ ndi Kristi abɛ yik iyah ne kiki yiŋɛ, te ta ŋgɔŋ ma kai?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27" />Fe nak baŋ rǝ bǝn cɛr Musa bǝn abɛ bla shar yi Arik bɔbɔk, ne bla ba kiki yiŋ ndi ne yime ne tu maa ne min cɛrǝ.<verse eid="LUK 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28" />Ndi ne te gbahir ne ntun yiŋ ndi atsǝn agara,Yesɔ ne na ndi a tei li ti. <verse eid="LUK 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29" />Fe ne tsǝ aklɛ te abenu tedi, &lt;&lt;klɛ ben abɛ ta, te amgbalu ate; arik neka kyaŋ aku.&gt;&gt; Fe ayir te azesɔŋ ben abɛba.<verse eid="LUK 24:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30" />Ndi ayi ne min kɛ li kili bene abɛ ba, ne baŋ durgbama te nyer Arik, te gab ba ne kɛ. <verse eid="LUK 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31" />Fe ayi amene akɔ bu akɔ zhi te ayi Yesɔ, akɔ naŋadɔ ne ti mǝne. <verse eid="LUK 24:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32" />A rib akpa mɛn, &lt;&lt;Ba a susun mɔr bane bla ta ka ndi ta ne tsǝntsǝn ne ankɔŋ te azǝn bla ta mplimplɛ iyi cɛrǝ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 24:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33" />Ne lu aklɛ bɔbɔk mǝne te kama kɔmɔ ne Urshelima. Tǝ kɔ te yik amɛ wur ane zhin ben abaŋ ndi ayi ben abɛba <verse eid="LUK 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34" />te di, &lt;&lt;Ayi lɛ didik! Yesɔ ne lu te tsar Biturus ikpa maa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35" />Ankyak ayaa baŋa abla ki yiŋ ndi ne te bene bɛba ne ankɔŋ, ben ki ndi aba ne tɔ Yesɔ azhi ne mkpaŋ kɛ gab durgba.<verse eid="LUK 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesɔ ne ru akli bene abɛ zeu tsin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36" />Ayi ne min kɛ zen bla kiki me, ankyak Yesɔ aru akli ne tsutsu mǝne, te di ba, &lt;&lt;Isik susun bǝ yi bene bɛ zhin.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 24:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37" />Ankyak kpa ku rǝ ba te na te sisik, ayik te di ayi ner ne ku ru a ba yigu. <verse eid="LUK 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38" />Adi ba, &lt;&lt;Izhin ri kpa kɛ ni, te zin lɛ ne asusun min? <verse eid="LUK 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39" />Izhin bɛ tɔ aŋɔk amuŋ ben aza muŋ. Ai nga ne tu muŋ! Sak zhin aŋɔk amin ne kpa muŋ te yik; iner ne ku ru ba yi ne na ben akuku ba, ndi me yime ne kǝ ba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 24:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40" />Ndi Yesɔ ne bla amɛ, a tsar ba aŋɔk amaa ben aza amaa. <verse eid="LUK 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41" />Ndi ba ne tanyɛmɛ ba ne nyer bǝn ki didik ndi ne na, arib ba, &lt;&lt;Izhin yi ne kinuŋ yi li ayaŋai?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 24:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42" />Anugu ambɛ amɔ tsɔtsɔb ayi yuk, <verse eid="LUK 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43" />fe atau ata ne ti mǝne.<verse eid="LUK 24:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44" />Adi ba, &lt;&lt;Waŋa ai lɛ muŋ keŋ ndi mne bla zhin ne mkpaŋ ndi mne ri yi bene bɛ zhin: kɔte nii ite shaga ndi ne cɛrǝ ne tɔ muŋ ne cɛr yi Musa, abɛ na ndum Arik ben Zabura.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45" />Fe Yesɔ a bu asusun amene te abɛ zhi mplimplɛ yi cɛrǝ. <verse eid="LUK 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46" />Ablaa ba, &lt;&lt;Waŋa ayi kiyiŋ ndi ne cɛrǝ: Kristi me atei yik iyah tena lu ne bɛr yi ntar, <verse eid="LUK 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47" />te duŋ lalɛ bǝn zuk zhɔk abɛ na zumimin atei du lɛ kɛ Arik ne ntuntun bɔbɔk, vuŋ rɛ Urshelima. <verse eid="LUK 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48" />Ayi zhine ba ne yik iki yiŋɛ. <verse eid="LUK 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49" />M tei shar zhin ne ki yiŋ ndi Tetɛɛ muŋ nɛ kpai anyak te di wa atei na; izhin bǝ kli ne miŋ ntun gar mkpaŋ keŋ ndi atei nek zhin mgbyamgbyaŋ are shumɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 24:49" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ne baŋ Yesɔ tɔ kɔmɔ ne shu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50" />Ndi Yesɔ ne gli ba te kɔmɔ ne goŋ ntun iyi Batanya, ne lɛk aŋɔk amaa kɔmɔ ne shu te nek ba anu adidik <verse eid="LUK 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51" />Ndi Yesɔ azǝn nek ba anu adidik, a duŋ ba, fe abaŋu te kɔmɔ ne shu. <verse eid="LUK 24:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52" />Ankyak akɔ zekuru, te kama kɔmɔ ne Urshelima, te zen nyer. <verse eid="LUK 24:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53" />Fe akli ne Akabakɔŋ, te zen gbar Arik asak.<verse eid="LUK 24:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24" />
</usx>